ill P1 存根，结构与 claude 一致\n- ai/detector.ts：按 aiProvider 配置（auto/claude/codex）依序检测可用 CLI\n- ai/prompt-builder.ts：ModuleSkeleton → 骨架 prompt（≤30 文件，控 token），三层 JSON 解析容错\n- config.ts：读取 glimpse.aiProvider VSCode 配置\n- messages.ts：data 消息类型从 unknown 改为 ModuleAnalysis\n- analyzeModule.ts：串联静态分析 → AI 调用 → postMessage，无 AI 时降级为纯静态结果\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7cdce7b92f90655fbdd1c86607adb60890a0eb1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NikFranki/codeveal/git/trees/7cdce7b92f90655fbdd1c86607adb60890a0eb1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NikFranki/codeveal/git/commits/68163a4ac7ef8c76695019df88f73a6b08a794da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12709235?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikFranki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikFranki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikFranki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikFranki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NikFranki","id":12709235,"login":"NikFranki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzA5MjM1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikFranki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikFranki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikFranki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikFranki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikFranki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NikFranki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NikFranki/codeveal/commit/68163a4ac7ef8c76695019df88f73a6b08a794da","node_id":"C_kwDOSiivZ9oAKDY4MTYzYTRhYzdlZjhjNzY2OTUwMTlkZjg4ZjczYTZiMDhhNzk0ZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NikFranki/codeveal/commit/0af37be27d4e98ef98639d