.\n- Replace Image-based avatar with UserAvatar component that handles a src error fallback and displays initials when image is.\n Remove cart-store Image imports no used.\n\nThese changes reduce bundle size, remove unused env declarations, andimprove resiliency for user avatars and cart badge rendering.","tree":{"sha":"a401e58bdbe027b9d920d6ff8a7cc8b864a8de46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Its-Satyajit/MFECP/git/trees/a401e58bdbe027b9d920d6ff8a7cc8b864a8de46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Its-Satyajit/MFECP/git/commits/cb82159183d99f34586f81b27110d32d4e06f5bf","verification":{"payload":"tree a401e58bdbe027b9d920d6ff8a7cc8b864a8de46\nparent dfb9c601e36bb9e388bc411cdf86538d6ca14791\nauthor It''s Satyajit💫 <77627641+Its-Satyajit@users.noreply.github.com> 1779364821 +0530\ncommitter It''s Satyajit💫 <77627641+Its-Satyajit@users.noreply.github.com> 1779364821 +0530\ngitbutler-headers-version 2\nchange-id vyupnoksollpywnsmrsllrymrmwvzxqv\n\nfeat(env): remove db env schema and lazy-load cart badgeRemove unused database environment schema callers, simplify envimports, and streamline shell app server schema. Replace runtime envcreation in packages/db with env (db server schema nowempty) to avoid redundant optional env.\n\nIn apps/shell, stop importing dbServerSchema into env and removedependence on DATABASE/TURSO vars. Replace dynamic V_APP_TITLE usagewith a fixed title and \"MFECP\" as the brand string.\n\nactor root route:\n- Lazy-load CartBadge via React.lazy and wrap it with Suspense defer bundle weight.\n- Replace Image-based avatar with UserAvatar component that handles a src error fallback and displays initials when image is.\n Remove cart-store Image imports no used.\n\nThese changes reduce bundle size, remove unused env declarations, andimprove resiliency for user avatars and cart badge rendering.","reason":"bad_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEERHviHF7QgrzyNLrRf7mT6JcVYAMFAmoO89UACgkQf7mT6JcV\nYANi0A/7BRMsTGfabjWhr4Ed