in orders loading state and product detail imports to replace thin-divider and provide consistent dividers.\n- Ex retry from types module where needed.\n\nFix Intl typing for locale to avoid unsafe casts by using atyped navigator.languages access pattern in currency and date formatting.\n\nAdd basic accessibility attributes to product list controls:\n- aria-label on search input (\"Search catalog\")\n aria-label on category select (\"Filter by category\")\n\nThese changes improve reliability of network requests, fix a typingissue and enhance accessibility and visual consistency across apps.","tree":{"sha":"441630e0afc777f9525cc547857aead556b69288","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Its-Satyajit/MFECP/git/trees/441630e0afc777f9525cc547857aead556b69288"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Its-Satyajit/MFECP/git/commits/abeec8f7e93acc78783bd5424f96950bae87892d","verification":{"payload":"tree 441630e0afc777f9525cc547857aead556b69288\nparent 26c96577e5af708843d65113d42f45fef05c7bd3\nauthor It''s Satyajit💫 <77627641+Its-Satyajit@users.noreply.github.com> 1779350062 +0530\ncommitter It''s Satyajit💫 <77627641+Its-Satyajit@users.noreply.github.com> 1779350062 +0530\ngitbutler-headers-version 2\nchange-id ytlkxxmppnosqsknvkvquwrlqsxykuqw\n\nfeat(apiui): add retry helper to queries and improve accessibility product, orders, and dashboard data fetches with retryGet tocentral retry behavior and reduce transient API failure surface.\n\nUpdate queryFn signatures to passGet-wrapped forproducts, orders, dashboard, and individual product fetches.\n\nImprove UI consistency and semantics:\n- Add component in orders loading state and product detail imports to replace thin-divider and provide consistent dividers.\n- Ex retry from types module where needed.\n\nFix Intl typing for locale to avoid unsafe casts by using atyped navigator.languages access pattern in currency and date formatting.\n\nAdd basic accessibility attributes to product list controls:\n- aria-label on search input (\