m/users/Its-Satyajit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Its-Satyajit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Its-Satyajit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Its-Satyajit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Its-Satyajit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Its-Satyajit/MFECP/commits/2b6dba82d355d1f0a3c344ff399d07a6cb43d2ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T12:05:19Z","email":"77627641+Its-Satyajit@users.noreply.github.com","name":"It''s Satyajit💫"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T12:05:19Z","email":"77627641+Its-Satyajit@users.noreply.github.com","name":"It''s Satyajit💫"},"message":"feat(shell/db): add start script, env support and bundle fixAdd minimal index.html stubs for multiple microfrontends (product-app,\n\norder-app, cart-app) to provide mounting points for preview builds.\n\n a start.mjs launcher for the shell app that spawns previewservers for each MFE then starts the preview on port3000.\nThis replaces the previous \"vite preview\" start script with a node-basedstarter to coordinate multiple processes and ensure MFEs claim portsbefore the shell starts.\n\nFix Vite build for the shell by adding a fixMfBundle plugin thatpatches module-federation/rollup output: it clears accidental entryflags non-index chunks and rew server export to point to thegenerated server asset when necessary. Register the plugin in viteconfig to broken server bundle.\n\n database configuration and env handling:\n- Support DATABASE as a primary credential fallback alongside TURSO_DATABASE_URL.\n- Add DATABASE_URL to env schema.\n Update config db factory to build client from either DATABASE_URL or TURSO_URL and includeSO_TOKEN when present, un local file fallback and avoiding duplicated client creation logic.\n\nChange shell package start script to run start.mjs.","tree":{"sha":"a3d574a7a76a4ac0c5cb79e9ebe2654a43be84eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Its-Satyajit/MFECP/git/trees/a3d574a7a76a4ac0c5cb79e9ebe2654a43be84eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Its-Satyajit/MFECP/git/commits/2b6dba82d355d1f0a3c344ff399d07a6cb43d2ac","verification":{"payload":"tree a3d574a7a76a4ac0c5cb79e9ebe2654a43be84eb\nparent 4604fe10c3614aa698a91e0f9f6f68eeeb2974da\nauthor It''s Satyajit💫 <77627641+Its-Satyajit@users.noreply.github.com> 1779278719 +0530\ncommitter It''s Satyajit💫 <77627641+Its-Satyajit@users.noreply.github.com> 1779278719 +0530\ngitbutler-headers-version 2\nchange-id smkzrmtsqxzvwxrorxsprkvtxtnnpsys\n\nfeat(shell/db): add start script, env support and bundle fixAdd minimal index.html stubs for multiple microfrontends (product-app,\n\norder-app, cart-app) to provide mounting points for preview builds.\n\n a start.mjs launcher for the shell app that spawns previewservers for each MFE then starts the preview on port3000.\nThis replaces the previous \"vite preview\" start script with a node-basedstarter to coordinate multiple processes and ensure MFEs claim portsbefore the shell starts.\n\nFix Vite build for the shell by adding a fixMfBundle plugin thatpatches module-federation/rollup output: it clears accidental entryflags non-index chunks and rew server export to point to thegenerated server asset when necessary. Register the plugin in viteconfig to broken server bundle.\n\n database configuration and env handling:\n- Support DATABASE as a primary credential fallback alongside TURSO_DATABASE_URL.\n- Add DATABASE_URL to env schema.\n Update config db factory to build client from either DATABASE_URL or TURSO_URL and includeSO_TOKEN when present, un local file fallback and avoiding duplicated client creation logic.\n\nChange shell package start script to run start.mjs.","reason":"bad_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEERHviHF7QgrzyNLrRf7mT6JcVYAMFAmoNo38ACgkQf7mT6JcV\nYAPyEQ/+K7Kp9pdo3d0u7zXxnDhmkrfGpf46H5v+WOyWaqLrLBaNmC3bjEM3