ior.\n\nWhy- module federation interoperability providing explicit module remotes, exposing a debug env module, and reducing duplicate/tanstack instances across remotes. The declaration prevents type errors for the virtual host init module. Diagnostic JSON updates are regenerated artifacts tooling","tree":{"sha":"0e1f543b11e4bfc0ddcd39f6d349cad0ef81203d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Its-Satyajit/MFECP/git/trees/0e1f543b11e4bfc0ddcd39f6d349cad0ef81203d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Its-Satyajit/MFECP/git/commits/47a6baacb2c3415567071f4a189a4110d15f49b0","verification":{"payload":"tree 0e1f543b11e4bfc0ddcd39f6d349cad0ef81203d\nparent 8bd328878bf2cbdd45ab7b1a29bd4be5edde0868\nauthor It''s Satyajit💫 <77627641+Its-Satyajit@users.noreply.github.com> 1779266204 +0530\ncommitter It''s Satyajit💫 <77627641+Its-Satyajit@users.noreply.github.com> 1779266204 +0530\ngitbutler-headers-version 2\nchange-id xnupwxxuvlxyttvmoovwqqpwrkwzkuyx\n\nfeat(federation): configure shell module federation and adjust tooling- Add detailed federation configuration to apps/shell/vite.ts:\n\n- set filename to remoteEntry.js and enable manifest generation.\n - expose ./src/env.ts as ./dummy for remote discovery.\n - convert remotes to explicit module objects (type, name, entry)\n auth, product, cart, order and dashboard to enable module federation module format and clearer runtime metadata.\n - add additional shared single for @tanstack/react-router and @tanstack/react-query to avoid duplicate instances acrossotes.\n reorder plugins and update viteReact usage to pass Babel presets via its option. Reintroduce tailwindcss and tanstackStart plugins.\n\n- TypeScript declaration for the virtual host auto-init module:\n - apps/shell/src/remotes/module-federation.d.ts declares the virtual module the initHost() function so TypeScript recognizes the runtime-provided host initializer.\n\n- generated diagnostic metadata in several .mf/diagn JSON (auth-mf, order-app, dashboard-mf):\n updatesc project file hashes and produced by the tooling. These changes regenerated outputs and do affect runtime behavior.\n\nWhy- module federation interoperability providing explicit module remotes, exposing a debug env module, and reducing duplicate/tanstack instances across remotes. The declaration prevents type errors for the virtual host init module. Diagnostic JSON updates are regenerated artifacts tooling","reason":"bad_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEERHviHF7QgrzyNLrRf7mT6JcVYAMFAmoNcpwACgkQf7mT6JcV\nYAPZSw/+PLgkAAC/KTFJcHs40TnTULdnnclgoM/W2IGgBbbu2CP8w343JFIcKNGG\nDaWOQYkfA8w2PpabKQnv0RTLLBr6W/d/DO3DZoo2SIqvwHXMADVFsEF1gESKnF1/\nxjfh9Dgyw0O576IdzibnrLPHs+oDNDYegStYkoFTrHPH2hIAw77Ce9C2ZvMUAqTp\nWmha8g1S4bMrSqvIhozGtsA3ZoNFX+fSvvFKu7Ap3xqMYGN1Ynl6gaymZ+Xlg4Ng\nmq17PvFDYEwrD85fhJwoNe4g3DstlyorXupHh/lmyZWXspswrUFSnBmungKbpaJq\nF3g3zIVOdh1c4yD/ABlekdkVg0oRUdGnpBtFIRay5UjSCZ3pltViqD6vG5Ow0dXS\n/O4zQ/3f+niReaGGsNJB9uhgOrKyJKZcN5idz15uOHjRNo3OMkxouAXSFY8Hayqg\neLJ0lSlXgmxeDTCG++uwyMbVB0y/Gs0cPQotr9pT3Nq4fYUTmaru8oYeLdAHY4u6\n5KH7txi9NfHwjWVQYU8zdRzZQ3kz1ZlBdy+aTqJj/txzSDmetFFQnlipUB+esRbC\nc6fn2ApQUESOtuhPJe2c9APR6Eabw2K25lDf5HC4WdUP/eaWul3dhQkGTVjzUukA\nZo9HHv+8XbHbpclURyGFqbQraptFPms4jgP0BNdTT4YIv/uFrnQ=\n=GwXd\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77627641?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Its-Satyajit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Its-Satyajit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Its-Satyajit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Its-Satyajit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Its-Satyajit","id":77627641,"login":"Its-Satyajit","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NjI3NjQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Its-Satyajit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Its-Satyajit/received_events","repos_ur