count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T06:42:50Z","email":"77627641+Its-Satyajit@users.noreply.github.com","name":"It''s Satyajit💫"},"message":"(api+uiapps add product app, adjust ui imports, and misc fixes- apps/product-app: add package.json treaty client setup create apps/product-app/src/lib/api and package manifest to enable a standalone product micro that communicates with the API using treaty. Use window.location for browser runtimes and localhost fallback for SSR/dev. Configure fetch to include.\n\n- packages/ui: fix relative imports for utility helpers - update imports in components (input.tsx,.tsx) to use \"../../lib/utils\" so UI components resolve correctly from the package.\n\n- apps/order-app: use local treaty client and remove l noise - import treatyClient from local lib/api instead of an external alias.\n - remove biome-ignore comments used only for skeleton placeholder keys.\n\n- apps/shell: improve loading UX and update cart store import - switch cart store import from @repo/commerce-mf to @repo/cart-store.\n - wrap Outlet with React.Suspense and add a simple Loading fallback to client-side route loading experience.\n\n- packages/cart: re-export cart API surface - add index.ts to expose cart types and hooks from the package.\n\n- apps/order-app: add diagnostic artifact - latest.json capturing a TYPE-001 federation/tsc diagnostic to make failure context available-/order-app: add utils - add src/lib/utils.ts (start of utility helpers used by the appThese changes set up the product-app, fix module resolution for UIcomponents, centralize the treaty client usage, improve shell UX,\nand the cart-store surface. They address runtime import issues,\nenable API communication the new product micro-app and surface adiagnostic to help resolve federation/type issues.","tree":{"sha":"05ff8b345dd6845fe8cbe79a6797af4d4e01a23f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Its-Satyajit/MFECP/git/trees/05ff8b345dd6845fe8cbe79a6797af4d4e01a23f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Its-Satyajit/MFECP/git/commits/daf155112fdc6b9c4433a16faf434158df59cff2","verification":{"payload":"tree 05ff8b345dd6845fe8cbe79a6797af4d4e01a23f\nparent ac3fa428e384e1802fd19ff6ec13c41e72558a88\nauthor It''s Satyajit💫 <77627641+Its-Satyajit@users.noreply.github.com> 1779259370 +0530\ncommitter It''s Satyajit💫 <77627641+Its-Satyajit@users.noreply.github.com> 1779259370 +0530\ngitbutler-headers-version 2\nchange-id lqvtspprykuvlkylprwyltnqurzxslmr\n\n(api+uiapps add product app, adjust ui imports, and misc fixes- apps/product-app: add package.json treaty client setup create apps/product-app/src/lib/api and package manifest to enable a standalone product micro that communicates with the API using treaty. Use window.location for browser runtimes and localhost fallback for SSR/dev. Configure fetch to include.\n\n- packages/ui: fix relative imports for utility helpers - update imports in components (input.tsx,.tsx) to use \"../../lib/utils\" so UI components resolve correctly from the package.\n\n- apps/order-app: use local treaty client and remove l noise - import treatyClient from local lib/api instead of an external alias.\n - remove biome-ignore comments used only for skeleton placeholder keys.\n\n- apps/shell: improve loading UX and update cart store import - switch cart store import from @repo/commerce-mf to @repo/cart-store.\n - wrap Outlet with React.Suspense and add a simple Loading fallback to client-side route loading experience.\n\n- packages/cart: re-export cart API surface - add index.ts to expose cart types and hooks from the package.\n\n- apps/order-app: add diagnostic artifact - latest.json capturing a TYPE-001 federation/tsc diagnostic to make failure context available-/order-app: add utils - add src/lib/utils.ts (start of utility helpers used by the appThese changes set up the product-app, fix module resolution for UIcomponents, centralize the treaty client usage, improve shell UX,\nand the cart-store surface. They address runtime import issues,\nenable API communication the new product micro-app and surface adiagnostic to help resolve federation/type issues.","reason":"bad_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEERHviHF7QgrzyNLrRf7mT6JcVYAMFAmoNV+oACgkQf7mT6JcV\nYAO2IhAAzI2QkXzic0KuW95xPT69TOoQSUFKAx4jT2YzUj2apF5aoVrdGKy/bpkp\nOqqp1ZzeIgNc8ygy2qCv1FqZ8aKy1SbIKuz1ok+djpF7/gz0d1sN+68zVYCDPblE\nnJsaAvjyZl/cpW0RvnjpkZB148jmeLxe4gYoSr5VmdvVuurmq+SdxtjW5Qw+RDFI\nv1fROSFIq5n6q3O25VEmsyAf+WocNfNdSfWKjyayPXy+6dNx7Y6nz9dkX9sJMAHC\nUfq89IGahdz3+f42UIrZrXfZnrAwBE3Ang7bY1IHH1MMSKO5Xysyx4CkSzVGQxOP\ni7h5/Wjk5jsSnTv29ux9Uc+T1NpcAW7fAbhsJkMpB6//Y5vjFkOl/ZNxin/cos48\nd1J/8ZvGIZ/Cm6Ev1W70J4rocmh0Dj6vP9M1qKvmVyAlY42ZKDeRZqPJXE7DIt9K\nA+qiRRPR/0fT7RkKAih9cmhnvHtq/l3kgZCRyLe1Z4QXiEn2F5OPJGIM59ilpKWA\nktNmKZhfnqYq/vV6QAtvOtnLWwTR0Sv28ywTUnpXqByEA7A8dKLxkxcqgmoqaApm\n17b5xTOpZp3ojkY/p1VFIIs9C+HK5kzsIr77ITkltXaKq2xpCthpG7/R376bcvA6\nkjjIJQL0Bzs3RpC8YCC6JH8jns9MQ6KjJQgHqiMmdpu/044MQWU=\n=8XW8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77627641?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Its-Satyajit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Its-Satyajit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Its-Satyajit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Its-Satyajit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Its-Satyajit","id":77627641,"login":"Its-Satyajit","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NjI3NjQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Its-Satyajit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Its-Satyajit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Its-Satyajit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Its-Satyajit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Its-Satyajit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Its-Satyaji