name":"It''s Satyajit💫"},"message":"feat(mfe): add build-time federation, new ui checkbox, and env pkgIntroduce build-time Module Federation for the commerce microand related workspace pieces to enable SSR and simplify runtime.\n\n- Add apps/commerce/vite.config.ts to remoteEntry and expose ./src/export.ts while sharing react, react-dom and internal packages.\n Configure build target and server CORS.\n- minimal/commerce-mf/index.html as M entry shell.\n\n workspace env package typed environment handling.\n- Create/env.json with exports and dependencies on @3-oss/env-core and z.\n\nAdd a reusable Checkbox UI component.\n- Implement packages/ui/components/.tsx using Radix and lucide-react with utility className merging.\n\nDocument architectural decision for build-time federation.\n- Add docs/adr/0003-build-time-federation.md explaining context,\n tradeoffs, and migration from runtime federation to build-time federation to restore SSR, reduce duplication, and simplify dev.","tree":{"sha":"61459c2dc142409a0aa89578a5c289004132142a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Its-Satyajit/MFECP/git/trees/61459c2dc142409a0aa89578a5c289004132142a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Its-Satyajit/MFECP/git/commits/ac3fa428e384e1802fd19ff6ec13c41e72558a88","verification":{"payload":"tree 61459c2dc142409a0aa89578a5c289004132142a\nparent af07173ea0e7ad8fb6fff0735c8e78d6383cdc0f\nauthor It''s Satyajit💫 <77627641+Its-Satyajit@users.noreply.github.com> 1779256300 +0530\ncommitter It''s Satyajit💫 <77627641+Its-Satyajit@users.noreply.github.com> 1779256300 +0530\ngitbutler-headers-version 2\nchange-id ywpvorsnlkpwzrzwsrlzxnsrpkzpntmp\n\nfeat(mfe): add build-time federation, new ui checkbox, and env pkgIntroduce build-time Module Federation for the commerce microand related workspace pieces to enable SSR and simplify runtime.\n\n- Add apps/commerce/vite.config.ts to remoteEntry and expose ./src/export.ts while sharing react, react-dom and internal packages.\n Configure build target and ser