5835503a0f377662b8a22800dce0ddb1d3b12","node_id":"C_kwDOSir9AdoAKDZiODU4MzU1MDNhMGYzNzc2NjJiOGEyMjgwMGRjZTBkZGIxZDNiMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/edly-io/frontend-app-fbr-admin/commit/b5405626f41a122bcb88dee3e4ab771add51fccb","sha":"b5405626f41a122bcb88dee3e4ab771add51fccb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-fbr-admin/commits/b5405626f41a122bcb88dee3e4ab771add51fccb"}],"sha":"6b85835503a0f377662b8a22800dce0ddb1d3b12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-fbr-admin/commits/6b85835503a0f377662b8a22800dce0ddb1d3b12"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57627710?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eemaanamir","id":57627710,"login":"eemaanamir","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjI3NzEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-fbr-admin/commits/b5405626f41a122bcb88dee3e4ab771add51fccb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T13:08:38Z","email":"57627710+eemaanamir@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eemaan Amir"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T13:08:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(admin-console): batch filter on user list + city-scoped batch picker with inline create (#38)\n\nUsers page\n- New Batch filter dropdown next to Status, driven by the same bootstrap\n  batches list. Threads through UsersPage state, useUsers, getUsers to\n  the biodata ?batch= filter that the backend companion PR adds.\n\nAdd User modal\n- Batch dropdown now shows only batches whose city matches the trainee''s\n  resolved city (values.city, or the caller''s own city for a middle\n  admin). This closes the loophole that let admins put a Karachi trainee\n  into a Lahore batch, which is what produced the mixed-city seed data\n  the last cleanup had to sort out.\n- \"+ New batch\" button next to the batch picker opens an inline form.\n  Submits to POST /v1/users/batches/ with the resolved city, adds the\n  new batch to the bootstrap cache, and auto-selects it. Only shown for\n  STP trainees with a resolved city.\n\nBackend companion in tutor-contrib-fbr (eemaan/bulk-enrollment-batch-\nendpoints) adds Batch.city, the POST/city_id/city_filter support, and\nserializer-level enforcement of batch.city == trainee.city.","tree":{"sha":"6aef2312b602a412045b39e52961cd23d90c7e09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-fbr-admin/git/trees/6aef2312b602a412045b39e52961cd23d90c7e09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-fbr-admin/git/commits/b5405626f41a122bcb88dee3e4ab771add51fccb","verification":{"payload":"tree 6aef2312b602a412045b39e52961cd23d90c7e09\nparent 52600418079a26e6147dcd3bbc647a69ead974c7\nauthor Eemaan Amir <57627710+eemaanamir@users.noreply.github.com> 1790687318 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790687318 +0500\n\nfeat(admin-console): batch filter on user list + city-scoped batch picker with inline create (#38)\n\nUsers page\n- New Batch filter dropdown next to Status, driven by the same bootstrap\n  batches list. Threads through UsersPage state, useUsers, getUsers to\n  the biodata ?batch= filter that the backend companion PR adds.\n\nAdd User modal\n- Batch dropdown now shows only batches whose city matches the trainee''s\n  resolved city (values.city, or the caller''s own city for a middle\n  admin). This closes the loophole that let admins put a Karachi trainee\n  into a Lahore batch, which is what produced the mixed-city seed data\n  the last cleanup had to sort out.\n- \"+ New batch\" button next to the batch picker opens an inline form.\n  Submits to POST /v1/users/batches/ with the resolved city, adds the\n  new batch to the bootstrap cache, and auto-selects it. Only shown for\n  STP trainees with a resolved city.\n\nBackend companion in tutor-contrib-fbr (eemaan/bulk-enrollment-batch-\nendpoints) adds Batch.city, the POST/city_id/city_filter support, and\nserializer-level enforcement of batch.city == trainee.city.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu7hWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOaQQAELD2yffVRK00TlXtWDyorAV\nAFgH/fHBnMpBDInfDqoemGICt0h61B+KoNRQRMMoEUOcpqG8weK9RLfJt6s7eok/\nqI47VezuqoB7z8VPOgKeW79EmiVOC4Njcw8dgYv9+q94CQrl+PkNjShPZA3hjqpp\nNXG6nNQXbAfearTKFp4DNVGWhRGh71XpJ8DBQWslH2svTS1y3DZ0UbFc+FrU2hJ2\n7SsyqaOstykCStCkoEx0cB+lh2TOR4Ru+LEk/Du2pKiTuTpbRosrn/7D9ylaa+Sv\n6j7SFd3mC0+RV9dVhl7wAVRHTaTss7t9tYydIRMc6yqUnG0Hn7/9juC+hXw3BZzE\nshrT954RcTT4AMtncCJn+U8sMsm1FQmwyfbHEXx9KWudFJ9KV/OuloxiIGFLOxKz\nxLy3E9q/dsVGsTe1zBVq1bgYFCwzZ8FqYZ816eebvwR8+TjzkcF8HX45wWd2MEhz\nIg5rAJC9qHL/qj3lnxmwVrDfZe/H6EIqyfHgPyDUV/seaTSAKs4E0z7cLcG1JQVl\nSULmozuCBM7o2gVCM2g3BaoFSKje64r2H5x+8S1JT7kkccAvljCjzkeK0NNeIZAj\nYsww8vBCBYsRcgQD60YptezwTcQR4NQgmry9phPo+E57hFTZc4v+icTTBCPWYHkK\n1Q8o/f7TLC9i0TlqOczj\n=7umO\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T13:08:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-