m/users/eemaanamir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eemaanamir","id":57627710,"login":"eemaanamir","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjI3NzEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eemaanamir","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-fbr-admin/commits/256291d6568a2db35b4e447486a844efaa3bea2c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T10:01:20Z","email":"57627710+eemaanamir@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eemaan Amir"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T10:01:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(admin-console): require city when creating a trainee or instructor (#36)\n\nThe Add User modal only showed the City picker when the selected role\nwas middle_admin or data_admin. Creating a trainee or an instructor\nwent through without a city, which the backend permissively accepted —\nproducing users with fbr_profile.city = NULL that silently dropped\nout of every city-scoped filter (program enrollable pool, add-instructor\ndropdown, sessions locations…).\n\nWiden the guard so the City picker is shown for every non-super-admin\nrole, and hidden only when the caller is a middle admin (backend\nauto-locks to their own city in that case). The City row is also now\nthreaded into the instructor and trainee create-fields layouts.\n\nBackend companion in tutor-contrib-fbr makes the field required.","tree":{"sha":"518769ca45e017c6445843cd45deebd849866afa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-fbr-admin/git/trees/518769ca45e017c6445843cd45deebd849866afa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-fbr-admin/git/commits/256291d6568a2db35b4e447486a844efaa3bea2c","verification":{"payload":"tree 518769ca45e017c6445843cd45deebd849866afa\nparent a51565d57f266cf6f182a925a2276973ee1d34df\nauthor Eemaan Amir <57627710+eemaanamir@users.noreply.github.com> 1790589680 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790589680 +0500\n\nfix(admin-console): require city when creating a trainee or instructor (#36)\n\nThe Add User modal only showed the City picker when the selected role\nwas middle_admin or data_admin. Creating a trainee or an instructor\nwent through without a city, which the backend permissively accepted —\nproducing users with fbr_profile.city = NULL that silently dropped\nout of every city-scoped filter (program enrollable pool, add-instructor\ndropdown, sessions locations…).\n\nWiden the guard so the City picker is shown for every non-super-admin\nrole, and hidden only when the caller is a middle admin (backend\nauto-locks to their own city in that case). The City row is also now\nthreaded into the instructor and trainee create-fields layouts.\n\nBackend companion in tutor-contrib-fbr makes the field required.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqujrwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAf1kQAGcwoQ6xGLmXZpYxNxYw5R0x\ncx4nR+CZoWobzKTuimmI86JmnSmIUateyQx3eBo+wncypSmywqDiO2Rn5GBiM2z9\nc0nP40n1H9rCtfrF+N5MmQvZlBmxC76zGAwmFT4bv55HsxrVCfwZvyBz2wxzioTJ\nD9nw1H/m63W/h1Uc5EepQEVza0S5mAUX2O4kOZKDa3PtVaCw60kp820vTfwLDNQ9\nLy01QAfiVpxgtKCrX2I99XLthJGguOZLhZm+DHkYSHjGo9RPOPMAjTNUgxtotwje\nrUXnxTxag5pZu1WbIOUQyHZLvlFMHRTEhMhuUmkj98Zq7NeMXwHIVPkrcq0xfpL8\ndB2CJ5miCcIjskPKk2TGYsOQOVOE5dk5l+mvRrDAhLx+GlmQ6u3pPzV3QTFu8Muo\nrSnEmAEgcCpEpaFF02pKmaAOCT5kFKFql7J7xAz1Fk5yyW7QLTx7e79LdV/pwn1l\nwRe6G3WCmAcJ5y86p5gIV6y+JXYUyBeKs2fHUnq/L6SumO+P6C/xTorBJGf04Bt/\nXVSFv8V+HrW9cYAGQJkjCs92BePLzfHj0d1dpMu5/v9cMXHvgpSjOhndRm8UHkeZ\nBIEvy