udes recordFilter; handleClearFilters propagates\n  to parent so clear button appears on per-record views\n- Renamed internal batch row fields (_type/_batchId/_count/_entries) to\n  (rowType/batchId/batchCount/batchEntries) to fix lint errors\n- continue replaced with advanced boolean flag (no-continue rule)\n\n* refactor(audit-log): use IconButtonWithTooltip for the full-history action\n\nReplaces the link-styled Button with Paragon''s IconButtonWithTooltip and\nremoves the SCSS overrides that were faking a link appearance. The row\naction is now a proper icon-only control with a tooltip.","tree":{"sha":"df3653a77a3ed7d04ddec512b9ba519997145190","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-fbr-admin/git/trees/df3653a77a3ed7d04ddec512b9ba519997145190"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-fbr-admin/git/commits/041a04b44fd5961238d15ec523d7e098d438d4de","verification":{"payload":"tree df3653a77a3ed7d04ddec512b9ba519997145190\nparent 2b63e71e7e100ba87c49a92408977e04e6b3ad96\nauthor Eemaan Amir <57627710+eemaanamir@users.noreply.github.com> 1790234633 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790234633 +0500\n\nfeat(audit-log): filter labels, clear filter, and batch naming fixes (#34)\n\n* feat(audit-log): filter labels, clear filter, and batch naming fixes\n\n- UsersPage now passes models prop so filter options are contextual\n- MULTI_MODEL_FILTER_LABELS for fbrprofile+fbrprofilerole+biodataeditrequest\n- biodataeditrequest updated action label changed to ''Resolved''\n- hasActiveFilters includes recordFilter; handleClearFilters propagates\n  to parent so clear button appears on per-record views\n- Renamed internal batch row fields (_type/_batchId/_count/_entries) to\n  (rowType/batchId/batchCount/batchEntries) to fix lint errors\n- continue replaced with advanced boolean flag (no-continue rule)\n\n* refactor(audit-log): use IconButtonWithTooltip for the full-history action\n\nReplaces the link-styled Button with Paragon''s IconButto