/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arbirali","id":51116673,"login":"arbirali","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTE2Njcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbirali/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbirali/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbirali/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbirali/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbirali/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbirali","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-fbr-admin/commits/f52e2aaf13fc06f48b858e59770f18a6c35d56fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T12:53:20Z","email":"rahat.ali@arbisoft.com","name":"Rahat Ali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T12:53:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Rahat/reports breadcrumb fix (#9)\n\n* fix: Reports pages breadcrumb root label\n\nReports pages (Program, Sessions Instructor, Attendance) were showing\n''Administration'' as the breadcrumb root because Breadcrumb hardcoded\nthat label. Breadcrumb now accepts an optional root prop (defaulting\nto Administration), and the three Reports pages pass ''Reports''.\n\nAdministration pages are unaffected.\n\n* fix: distinct leaf labels for Reports pages\n\nbreadcrumbLeaf (and Program''s pageTitle) were all defaulting to the\ngeneric ''Reports'' string across the three report pages. Give each\npage its own distinct leaf label: Program, Sessions, Attendance.","tree":{"sha":"253f764d6b2ecf84e44abdeff19811efebf73645","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-fbr-admin/git/trees/253f764d6b2ecf84e44abdeff19811efebf73645"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edly-io/frontend-app-fbr-admin/git/commits/f52e2aaf13fc06f48b858e59770f18a6c35d56fb","verification":{"payload":"tree 253f764d6b2ecf84e44abdeff19811efebf73645\nparent 9d8877bcef1e9