e,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/2f452782440bf160a616c6032d87067e7d93ff7d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T08:02:28Z","email":"gregory.panagary@cwseychelles.com","name":"Gregory Panagary"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T08:02:28Z","email":"gregory.panagary@cwseychelles.com","name":"Gregory Panagary"},"message":"fix(deploy): sync Entra IDs into .env on every deploy, not just first bootstrap\n\n.env already existed on the VM from before the Entra app registration was\ncreated, so bootstrap_env_if_missing()''s one-time-only write never ran,\nleaving ENTRA_TENANT_ID/ENTRA_CLIENT_ID blank forever despite the GitHub\nsecrets being set correctly. Backend reported \"JWT validation is not\nconfigured\" since jwks_url falls back to \"\" without a tenant ID.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f1bfb723fb90c68dc731449951be540cd0838369","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/trees/f1bfb723fb90c68dc731449951be540cd0838369"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/commits/2f452782440bf160a616c6032d87067e7d93ff7d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274989658?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryCWS","id":274989658,"log