count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T11:05:16Z","email":"gregory.panagary@cwseychelles.com","name":"Gregory Panagary"},"message":"fix(ui): stop golden ticket sparkle icon overlapping the \"Nominated by\" line\n\nFloatingSparkles positioned one decorative sparkle at bottom-6 left-8,\nwhich lands directly on the \"Nominated by\" text since both grid columns\nshare the same card height and that line sits at the bottom of the left\ncolumn. Moved it to the card''s left edge, vertically centered, where it\ncan''t collide with any text in either the stacked or two-column layout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8ef81ae4db93229a7dbf21d3cb4ab968a0f873f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/trees/8ef81ae4db93229a7dbf21d3cb4ab968a0f873f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/commits/d1827a88584068caafe8b497d234b027ddac9f5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274989658?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryCWS","id":274989658,"login":"GregoryCWS","node_id":"U_kgDOEGQCWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commit/d1827a88584068caafe8b497d234b027ddac9f5c","node_id":"C_kwDOSi08UNoAKGQxODI3YTg4NTg0MDY4Y2FhZmU4YjQ5N2QyMzRiMDI3ZGRhYzlmNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commit/1235ef95d9b498c9d6ccf854bf0c1b1067c86c61","sha":"1235ef95d9b498c9d6ccf854bf0c1b1067c86c61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/1235ef95d9b498c9d6ccf854bf0c1b1067c86c61"}],"sha":"d1827a88584068caafe8b497d234b027ddac9f5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/d1827a88584068caafe8b497d234b027ddac9f5c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274989658?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryCWS","id":274989658,"login":"GregoryCWS","node_id":"U_kgDOEGQCWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/1235ef95d9b498c9d6ccf854bf0c1b1067c86c61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T10:30:20Z","email":"gregory.panagary@cwseychelles.com","name":"Gregory Panagary"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T10:30:20Z","email":"gregory.panagary@cwseychelles.com","name":"Gregory Panagary"},"message":"fix(frontend): resolve header logo path against Vite base, not site root\n\nCwsLogoMark hardcoded src=\"/brand/cws-logo.png\" — a root-absolute path that\nignores the app''s URL_PATH_PREFIX on shared VMs. On staging the app is\nserved under /pulse-awards/, so this resolved to a nonexistent root-level\npath instead of the actual /pulse-awards/brand/cws-logo.png NGINX serves.\nUses import.meta.env.BASE_URL (same pattern already used in App.tsx''s\nrouter basename) so it resolves correctly under any base path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"942c4f006da32fe011c82e5cd308cb57aa9d6a88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/trees/942c4f006da32fe011c82e5cd308cb57aa9d6a88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/commits/1235ef95d9b498c9d6ccf854bf0c1b1067c86c61","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274989658?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryCWS","id":274989658,"login":"GregoryCWS","node_id":"U_kgDOEGQCWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commit/1235ef95d9b498c9d6ccf854bf0c1b1067c86c61","node_id":"C_kwDOSi08UNoAKDEyMzVlZjk1ZDliNDk4YzlkNmNjZjg1NGJmMGMxYjEwNjdjODZjNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commit/a29f0d3a33b4904f2a9af9f94d4769add52d429f","sha":"a29f0d3a33b4904f2a9af9f94d4769add52d429f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/a29f0d3a33b4904f2a9af9f94d4769add52d429f"}],"sha":"1235ef95d9b498c9d6ccf854bf0c1b1067c86c61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/1235ef95d9b498c9d6ccf854bf0c1b1067c86c61"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274989658?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryCWS","id":274989658,"login":"GregoryCWS","node_id":"U_kgDOEGQCWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/a29f0d3a33b4904f2a9af9f94d4769add52d429f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T10:25:00Z","email":"gregory.panagary@cwseychelles.com","name":"Gregory Panagary"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T10:25:00Z","email":"gregory.panagary@cwseychelles.com","name":"Gregory Panagary"},"message":"docs(exit): record first successful staging deployment\n\ndeploy-staging.yml completed end-to-end on 2026-07-09: runner registered,\nGitHub Environments configured, verify_release.sh passing (backend health,\nDB, SMTP, all public routes) at https://cwscx-tst01.cwsey.com/pulse-awards/.\nAlso notes the repo is now public and that no dedicated TLS cert is needed\nsince Pulse Awards has no vhost of its own on the shared VM.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"084adfde9af720c4a2f4d75035c67a28f23c63d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/trees/084adfde9af720c4a2f4d75035c67a28f23c63d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/commits/a29f0d3a33b4904f2a9af9f94d4769add52d429f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274989658?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryCWS","id":274989658,"login":"GregoryCWS","node_id":"U_kgDOEGQCWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commit/a29f0d3a33b4904f2a9af9f94d4769add52d429f","node_id":"C_kwDOSi08UNoAKGEyOWYwZDNhMzNiNDkwNGYyYTlhZjlmOTRkNDc2OWFkZDUyZDQyOWY","parents":[{"