o, and deploy_nginx.sh\ncalled nginx -t/systemctl reload nginx without sudo — all failed with\nPermission denied on the first real deploy. Also documents the journalctl\nsudoers entry needed for the failure-diagnostic path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"63c138c28c574471235e2eaf6a1c645ea11064a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/trees/63c138c28c574471235e2eaf6a1c645ea11064a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/commits/ec932bb74e54a05c7c703e3dbf07feed12a03a2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274989658?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryCWS","id":274989658,"login":"GregoryCWS","node_id":"U_kgDOEGQCWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commit/ec932bb74e54a05c7c703e3dbf07feed12a03a2e","node_id":"C_kwDOSi08UNoAKGVjOTMyYmI3NGU1NGEwNWM3YzcwM2UzZGJmMDdmZWVkMTJhMDNhMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commit/84849e3572e904ef1a91d376d8865f9722b81cc0","sha":"84849e3572e904ef1a91d376d8865f9722b81cc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/84849e3572e904ef1a91d376d8865f9722b81cc0"}],"sha":"ec932bb74e54a05c7c703e3dbf07feed12a03a2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/ec932bb74e54a05c7c703e3dbf07feed12a03a2e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274989658?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryCWS","id":274989658,"login":"GregoryCWS","node_id":"U_kgDOEGQCWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/84849e3572e904ef1a91d376d8865f9722b81cc0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T07:22:53Z","email":"gregory.panagary@cwseychelles.com","name":"Gregory Panagary"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T07:22:53Z","email":"gregory.panagary@cwseychelles.com","name":"Gregory Panagary"},"message":"fix(deploy): check_ports.sh dying silently when a port is genuinely free\n\nport_owner_pid()''s pipeline ended in `grep -oE ''pid=...''`, which exits 1\nwhen ss finds nothing to match (i.e. the port is free). Under pipefail,\nthat non-zero exit propagated through head/cut even though they succeeded,\nand set -e then killed the whole script before it reached any of the\nintended \"port is free\" messages. Broke the very first real deploy, since\nall three of Pulse Awards'' ports are genuinely free on a first-ever install.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1bfb8fdcb32e843dae54fe6142854331300a47b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/trees/1bfb8fdcb32e843dae54fe6142854331300a47b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/commits/84849e3572e904ef1a91d376d8865f9722b81cc0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274989658?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryCWS","id":274989658,"login":"GregoryCWS","node_id":"U_kgDOEGQCWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commit/84849e3572e904ef1a91d376d8865f9722b81cc0","node_id":"C_kwDOSi08UNoAKDg0ODQ5ZTM1NzJlOTA0ZWYxYTkxZDM3NmQ4ODY1Zjk3MjJiODFjYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commit/10b01e6fbfa187cc5bf59e2392e3c9798e12f00a","sha":"10b01e6fbfa187cc5bf59e2392e3c9798e12f00a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/10b01e6fbfa187cc5bf59e2392e3c9798e12f00a"}],"sha":"84849e3572e904ef1a91d376d8865f9722b81cc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/84849e3572e904ef1a91d376d8865f9722b81cc0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274989658?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryCWS","id":274989658,"login":"GregoryCWS","node_id":"U_kgDOEGQCWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/10b01e6fbfa187cc5bf59e2392e3c9798e12f00a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T07:02:13Z","email":"gregory.panagary@cwseychelles.com","name":"Gregory Panagary"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T07:02:13Z","email":"gregory.panagary@cwseychelles.com","name":"Gregory Panagary"},"message":"fix(deploy): set executable bit on scripts/linux/*.sh\n\nAll deploy scripts were committed as mode 644, so ./scripts/linux/*.sh\nfailed with \"Permission denied\" (exit 126) on the very first real\ndeploy-staging run. ci.yml never surfaced this since it never invokes\nthese scripts directly (only docker compose/alembic/pytest).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":