d PDF_PORT (8001) are unaffected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2fd9eb9ef263bfcb525fa2a60cf6a60ae49236d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/trees/2fd9eb9ef263bfcb525fa2a60cf6a60ae49236d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/commits/6d4420069fb85c98000068abb47d3997babffbb8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274989658?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryCWS","id":274989658,"login":"GregoryCWS","node_id":"U_kgDOEGQCWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commit/6d4420069fb85c98000068abb47d3997babffbb8","node_id":"C_kwDOSi08UNoAKDZkNDQyMDA2OWZiODVjOTgwMDAwNjhhYmI0N2QzOTk3YmFiZmZiYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commit/7b0662b6ca4bba3c9dee84e31f2f298b773b06c5","sha":"7b0662b6ca4bba3c9dee84e31f2f298b773b06c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/7b0662b6ca4bba3c9dee84e31f2f298b773b06c5"}],"sha":"6d4420069fb85c98000068abb47d3997babffbb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/6d4420069fb85c98000068abb47d3997babffbb8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274989658?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryCWS","id":274989658,"login":"GregoryCWS","node_id":"U_kgDOEGQCWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/7b0662b6ca4bba3c9dee84e31f2f298b773b06c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T05:26:58Z","email":"gregory.panagary@cwseychelles.com","name":"Gregory Panagary"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T05:26:58Z","email":"gregory.panagary@cwseychelles.com","name":"Gregory Panagary"},"message":"feat(deploy): configurable ports + GitHub Environment-driven .env sync\n\nPorts (BACKEND_PORT/DB_PORT/PDF_PORT) are no longer hardcoded in\ndocker-compose.yml or pulse-awards.service, since the target VM\n(cwscx-tst01) already has 8000 and 5433 taken by sibling apps.\n\ndeploy_backend.sh now bootstraps /opt/pulse-awards/.env from GitHub\nEnvironment vars/secrets on first deploy, then re-syncs only the\nlow-risk operational keys on every later deploy, so routine config\nchanges (SMTP, ports, admin role, asset URLs) never require VM login.\n\nDocuments the full variable/secret list and corrected 8010/5434 ports\nin docs/deployment/self-hosted-runner-setup.md and EXIT.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"11d55a26fc00784a7a1535403d807c54add88f15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/trees/11d55a26fc00784a7a1535403d807c54add88f15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/commits/7b0662b6ca4bba3c9dee84e31f2f298b773b06c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274989658?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryCWS","id":274989658,"login":"GregoryCWS","node_id":"U_kgDOEGQCWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commit/7b0662b6ca4bba3c9dee84e31f2f298b773b06c5","node_id":"C_kwDOSi08UNoAKDdiMDY2MmI2Y2E0YmJhM2M5ZGVlODRlMzFmMmYyOThiNzczYjA2YzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commit/fd88e52424212f2f0857f2b4186bdb60804b78ab","sha":"fd88e52424212f2f0857f2b4186bdb60804b78ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/fd88e52424212f2f0857f2b4186bdb60804b78ab"}],"sha":"7b0662b6ca4bba3c9dee84e31f2f298b773b06c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/7b0662b6ca4bba3c9dee84e31f2f298b773b06c5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274989658?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryCWS","id":274989658,"login":"GregoryCWS","node_id":"U_kgDOEGQCWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/fd88e52424212f2f0857f2b4186bdb60804b78ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T12:34:26Z","email":"gregory.panagary@cwseychelles.com","name":"Gregory Panagary"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T12:34:26Z","email":"gregory.panagary@cwseychelles.com","name":"Gregory Panagary"},"message":"docs(running): add frontend stale-dev-server troubleshooting entry\n\nSame root cause as the backend entry added earlier this session, but on\nthe Vite side: an orphaned npm run dev process from an earlier session\nkept serving CSS compiled before the Instant Impact emerald colour change,\nso the new impact/impact-soft classes were undefined and failed silently\n(transparent text, default-grey borders) rather than erroring visibly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b01cbadb3cb5deeacdf5873c9a08aa7db6f26b78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/trees/b01cbadb3cb5deeacdf5873c9a08aa7db6f26b78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/commits/fd88e52424212f2f0857f2b4186bdb60804b78ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274989658?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryCWS","id":274989658,"login":"GregoryCWS","node_id":"U_kgDOEGQCWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commit/fd88e52424212f2f0857f2b4186bdb60804b78ab","node_id":"C_kwDOSi08UNoAKGZkODhlNTI0MjQyMTJmMmYwODU3ZjJiNDE4NmJkYjYwODA0Yjc4YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commit/a351c9860b6724093a794b4ce0c30a49bd4c7522","sha":"a351c9860b6724093a794b4ce0c30a49bd4c7522","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/a351c9860b6724093a794b4ce0c30a49bd4c7522"}],"sha":"fd88e52424212f2f0857f2b4186bdb60804b78ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/fd88e52424212f2f0857f2b4186bdb60804b78ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274989658?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryCWS","id":274989658,"login":"GregoryCWS","node_id":"U_kgDOEGQCWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryCWS","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/commits/a351c9860b6724093a794b4ce0c30a49bd4c7522/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T12:19:58Z","email":"gregory.panagary@cwseychelles.com","name":"Gregory Panagary"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T12:19:58Z","email":"gregory.panagary@cwseychelles.com","name":"Gregory Panagary"},"message":"feat(deploy): staging/production GitHub Actions workflows + runner setup\n\nAdds the deploy pipeline referenced by EXIT.md as an open item, scoped\nspecifically for cwscx-tst01 (internal-only, multi-app VM):\n\n- .github/workflows/deploy-staging.yml, deploy-production.yml — each runs\n  the backend test suite + frontend typecheck/build as a gate, then deploys\n  via scripts/linux/*.sh on a self-hosted runner. Both currently target the\n  one available VM; environment-specific values (ports, app root, server\n  name) come from GitHub Environment variables so a future separate\n  production VM needs only new variable values, no workflow changes.\n- scripts/linux/check_ports.sh — pre-flight check that Pulse Awards'' three\n  ports (8000/5433/8001) are free or already owned by its own service/\n  containers, so a deploy fails loudly instead of silently fighting another\n  app on the shared VM for a port.\n- scripts/linux/build_release_bundle.sh, install_release_bundle.sh — builds\n  a fresh backend venv + frontend dist in the CI workspace, then installs it\n  as a new /opt/pulse-awards/releases/<sha>/ directory with symlink swaps\n  for backend/ and frontend-dist/ — keeps the already-committed\n  pulse-awards.service (ExecStart hardcoded to /opt/pulse-awards/backend/...)\n  valid with no changes, and makes rollback a symlink flip.\n- scripts/linux/deploy_backend.sh, deploy_frontends.sh, deploy_nginx.sh,\n  verify_release.sh — systemd unit refresh, Docker support services,\n  Alembic migration, NGINX site render/reload (deploy/nginx/\n  pulse-awards.conf.template, single-frontend variant of the dev-kit''s\n  generic template), and end-to-end health/route verification through NGINX.\n- docs/deployment/self-hosted-runner-setup.md — step-by-step runner install\n  scoped and labelled for this app only (pulse-awards-runner-01, labels\n  self-hosted/linux/pulse-awards/staging/production), a dedicated\n  unprivileged runner user with narrowly-scoped sudo, and the GitHub\n  Environment configuration needed on the repo side.\n\nEXIT.md updated: repo remote/branch pushed, deploy workflows, and runner\nlabels are no longer \"to be confirmed\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6d22012aee8cd801efea6dac1dec735d65aa7f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/trees/e6d22012aee8cd801efea6dac1dec735d65aa7f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/commits/a351c9860b6724093a794b4ce0c30a49bd4c7522","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","si