ews\n\nImplements the Phase 1 frontend foundation:\n- Vite + React 18 + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS 3 project setup\n- AnimatedBackground with blue/gold variant orbs and grid\n- Header with nav tabs linking both Hall of Fame pages\n- MonthNav with horizontal scroll, active state per award type variant\n- AwardCard featuring Golden Ticket full-span treatment, card bar gradients,\n  avatar with initials/photo, pillar tag, story with decorative quote\n- Avatar component with initials fallback and gold ring for GT\n- CategoryBadge, PillarTag, EmptyState shared components\n- useWinners hook with loading/error/success states\n- API client layer wired to /api/v1 backend endpoints\n- CharterChampions and InstantImpact pages with hero, month chip, card grid\n- Design tokens (Cormorant Garamond / Plus Jakarta Sans / Outfit fonts,\n  navy/deep/gold/blue/sky palette) per DESIGN_SYSTEM.md\n- Animations: fadeUp hero, cardIn staggered entrance, drift orbs, pulse dot\n- prefers-reduced-motion discipline\n- Accessible: aria-pressed, aria-hidden, keyboard focus ring, semantic HTML\n- Clean TypeScript build (tsc -b && vite build)","tree":{"sha":"d42a7a57714fd4f52d45d07dd13762950353040a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/trees/d42a7a57714fd4f52d45d07dd13762950353040a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GregoryPana/cws-pulse-awards/git/commits/35cb294faf88635a74c049cfbd98e858a6715a23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107904435?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryPana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryPana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryPana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GregoryPana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GregoryPana","id":107904435,"login":"GregoryPan