/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Omnishore-Smart-Agents/Omniplatform/commits/6d89924fcd9fff2e6ce1f421e900aa68f0105483/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T10:06:20Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T10:06:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: overhaul task system — outbound sync, escalation, failed column, MCP filtering (#548)\n\nFixes all critical and medium priority issues from task system audit:\n\nOutbound sync (H1/H2):\n- Create syncTaskOutbound() shared helper in github-sync-engine.ts\n- Wire into bulk PUT (drag-and-drop), replacing per-endpoint inline sync\n- Wire into task-dispatch.ts at all 5 status transition points\n- GNAP sync now updates on status changes (was create-only)\n\nEscalation (H3):\n- Add task.escalated event type to event bus\n- Broadcast escalation when tasks fail after max retries (dispatch, Aegis, stale)\n- Webhook subscribers auto-receive escalation events\n\nFailed + awaiting_owner as formal statuses (H4):\n- Add to validation schemas, github-label-map, gnap-sync, all Task types\n- New \"Failed\" column on task board with error display and retry button\n- Retry resets dispatch_attempts and moves task back to assigned\n\nMCP server filtering (M2):\n- mc_list_tasks now accepts: status, assigned_to, priority, search, limit\n- Backward compatible — no params returns all tasks\n\nModel classification (M3):\n- Add size heuristics: description >2000 chars or estimated_hours >=4 → opus\n\nTests updated for new status counts and enums.","tree":{"sha":"50480394912feae52a1444d16d2753e77bdd4ae6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Omnishore-Smart-Agents/Omniplatform/git/trees/50480394912feae52a1444d16d2753e77bdd4ae6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Omnishore-Smart-Agents/Omniplatform/git/commits/6d89924fcd9fff2e6ce1f421e900aa68f0105483","verification":{"payload":"tree 50480394912feae52a1444d16d2753e77bdd4ae6\nparent e8023d3733133bee31410f1c6684b469368d776f\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1775210780 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775210780 +0700\n\nfix: overhaul task system — outbound sync, escalation, failed column, MCP filtering (#548)\n\nFixes all critical and medium priority issues from task system audit:\n\nOutbound sync (H1/H2):\n- Create syncTaskOutbound() shared helper in github-sync-engine.ts\n- Wire into bulk PUT (drag-and-drop), replacing per-endpoint inline sync\n- Wire into task-dispatch.ts at all 5 status transition points\n- GNAP sync now updates on status changes (was create-only)\n\nEscalation (H3):\n- Add task.escalated event type to event bus\n- Broadcast escalation when tasks fail after max retries (dispatch, Aegis, stale)\n- Webhook subscribers auto-receive escalation events\n\nFailed + awaiting_owner as formal statuses (H4):\n- Add to validation schemas, github-label-map, gnap-sync, all Task types\n- New \"Failed\" column on task board with error display and retry button\n- Retry resets dispatch_attempts and moves task back to assigned\n\nMCP server filtering (M2):\n- mc_list_tasks now accepts: status, assigned_to, priority, search, limit\n- Backward compatible — no params returns all tasks\n\nModel classification (M3):\n- Add size heuristics: description >2000 chars or estimated_hours >=4 → opus\n\nTests updated for new status counts and enums.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpz5EcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3FEQAIIJx2W2o+pCS/VTA8H4zfbb\nDkJh1dyawDxw8CqDsoKe2NflLBbTj2odHl5JXX+4ceU9qZSiYYtA5oYx75GsFFNC\nW6LKyZRxhbBczm7u/1NHhHfXcoog+FDAhjzftDtsrwngpR0GC9uN0EB4P7GrDLb0\nz4Mphqp6hRyN/cN1VlKmyl3Hz9p9RQKk7DcL+YOJc8h4L7408GwjQWBQMbCnM/0S\nJ5mMSslKEt8LIRuZrLXVxNj3B40xcpcYxt9LEc55ft6QwIvTWC1F2O0TmNrOu82V\num1tk/O5QzTDby9wGsi/CwIBCwD1255+o2utQ+tzQ08fR9TDuWQ9LcgolW3kBCug\n/RGIynvEoL0VgOhvFX5b9QMOSLrxafnGyFneRu8cQCBtpevjviR2Yww5GA0hA3Av\nRkUZOSJwkZX2L+e674gQ6JRqXc1bKWuKfTRvW5wBeQTGbSVcsslg1p0O2SIFsqLj\nR4rP2OZH0VTYDXawo7FM+4C3ZqNrZ1XL9seJ4iwAaHxltCV27foX9ODTxnnChBwM\nB0B6lfKuFNEM+BPlI+Lwo2IW8f/sOTwRRnHl0e6LBDftgd3RsILUM8qJvJWWD72O\nkySsfi5lqnxR5jLvYfQY0wmOSMDzDEUpVWpAT75LWJnCOuL0PdV91khoBP3jwxeH\nemUZMc7vpNqduG2Ht3AU\n=Dd/d\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-20T14:44:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Omnishore-Smart-Agents/Omniplatform/commit/6d89924fcd9fff2e6ce1f421e900aa68f0105483","node_id":"C_kwDOSjEa59oAKDZkODk5MjRmY2Q5ZmZmMmU2Y2UxZjQyMWU5MDBhYTY4ZjAxMDU0ODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Omnishore-Smart-Agents/Omniplatform/commit/e8023d3733133bee31410f1c6684b469368d776f","sha":"e8023d3733133bee31410f1c6684b469368d776f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Omnishore-Smart-Agents/Omniplatform/commits/e8023d3733133bee31410f1c6684b469368d776f"}],"sha":"6d89924fcd9fff2e6ce1f421e900aa68f0105483","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Omnishore-Smart-Agents/Omniplatform/commits/6d89924fcd9fff2e6ce1f421e900aa68f0105483"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Omnishore-Smart-Agents/Omniplatform/commits/e8023d3733133bee31410f1c6684b469368d776f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T08:14:46Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T08:14:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: redesign onboarding — auto-detect runtimes, remove install step (#547)\n\nReplace the 4-card runtime installation step with auto-detection in\nthe Welcome screen. Runtimes are now detected and displayed as a\nstatus list (installed/authenticated/not installed) without requiring\nusers to install anything during onboarding. Runtime management\nmoves exclusively to Settings > Agent Runtimes.\n\nChanges:\n- Remove agent-runtimes from onboarding wizard steps (4→3 local, 5→4 gateway)\n- Redesign StepWelcome with runtime status list + live system status chips\n- Delete step-agent-runtimes.tsx (592 lines) — Settings handles this now\n- Consolidate step definitions: API route imports from onboarding-flow.ts\n- Enhance empty-state-launchpad with version/auth details per runtime\n- Add i18n keys for runtime status labels (10 locales)\n- Fix runtime detection: search ~/.local/bin, ~/Library/pnpm, hermes --help\n- Fix Codex auth detection via OPENAI_API_KEY env var\n- Fix version string cleanup for LACP-wrapped binaries\n\nNo migration needed — existing completed_steps arrays silently drop\nthe removed step ID via parseCompletedSteps validation.","tree":{"sha":"7f65e847f63478bdb6e3a92419843424fec0a401","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Omnishore-Smart-Agents/Omniplatform/git/trees/7f65e847f63478bdb6e3a92419843424fec0a401"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Omnishore-Smart-Agents/Omniplatform/git/commits/e8023d3733133bee31410f1c6684b469368d776f","verification":{"payload":"tree 7f65e847f63478bdb6e3a92419843424fec0a401\nparent 04719fa2333d756fe0879ba0c4c874d139f201dc\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1775204086 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775204086 +0700\n\nfeat: redesign onboarding — auto-detect runtimes, remove install step (#547)\n\nReplace the 4-card runtime installation step with auto-detection in\nthe Welcome screen. Runtimes are now detected and displayed as a\nstatus list (installed/authenticated/not installed) without requiring\nusers to install anything during onboarding. Runtime management\nmoves exclusively to Settings > Agent Runtimes.\n\nChanges:\n- Re