eway.\n\nAdd [edit] link next to the token indicator that expands an inline\npassword input. Supports Enter to save, Escape to cancel. Calls\nPUT /api/gateways with the token field (already supported by API).","tree":{"sha":"097a7a74e23f15c020490818c5ec873bf062f2ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Omnishore-Smart-Agents/Omniplatform/git/trees/097a7a74e23f15c020490818c5ec873bf062f2ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Omnishore-Smart-Agents/Omniplatform/git/commits/5bc5737d5611a2dcb0e441d561f359e9a6b18b5b","verification":{"payload":"tree 097a7a74e23f15c020490818c5ec873bf062f2ec\nparent 60f6dc07a1925a695bd519c3577baf7d28042d84\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1774171504 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774171504 +0700\n\nfix: add inline token editor to gateway card (#459) (#471)\n\nThe gateway card showed token status as read-only (set/none) with no\nway to update it. Users with a registered gateway but missing token\nhad to delete and re-add the gateway.\n\nAdd [edit] link next to the token indicator that expands an inline\npassword input. Supports Enter to save, Escape to cancel. Calls\nPUT /api/gateways with the token field (already supported by API).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpv7VwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAaKMQAF9ZOZ7WBRxb8TUFHZm3zV6u\n/jon2tLHs+tDUy5a6iuZRz3AP/0BfvdJyZkkAY9qxrFxKGJ2JrqYXGPfQMHDFWHJ\no0akEkzVytcLjqY1owN9Y0se6VgbKQQmPOjrxpxtbciMgwM/O0rX2CPR6O83aC3q\nzRldoBF0suQUTEFS5mK5v40YgQicW6T6mvZV2mBWx8vsxZVogfBubk58p9xFhLBb\nRMbnVfKH3seDqbedCzIDrzVsxIdJ403ucOFsgBPCwUrQEr8nuxHW9hbmvx+ncbi8\nothH2hf4t9NIXQJaFqUlx3mWOVz3pz1lTAJzOwXQmcE+DKXe1k+tv9WcAeED7kAy\nUMyqqhch9xsTycfeAwcJbirbDfZG2x3V5bWeXZFnbcPfgHLxKjQWOGy79Otq+E0p\n1C9nR4VrDcuhv/FDURyArbOJ9fQH5adjmqXM4ZHYYa1AQvlfEdi9lcy8Ccbzythh\nH0wLq7CyBXBtRqmpMxBUZL60r6IVHa46FPCb1TmHjkBxu1zf1Y9LR/DODrjEuCHD\nn5coVJwUU1ASLUEvj6SKOGWCU1ojwB85DjntzbCFPe6rU9U737Iyu/QyHVqfiTn4\nDizZ9AbVXq6xebUAJZoa/NQTwTFr7MZeUSiSZfutIMbUTQ9edaOnqJcexohnqtXn