umn children\nso that overflow-y-auto on column bodies can actually trigger. Without\nthis, flexbox min-height:auto causes containers to grow unbounded\ninstead of constraining height and enabling scroll.\n\nFixes #376\n\nCo-authored-by: Dan <github@bookkept.com.au>","tree":{"sha":"e0e429c689ebaa4a9889e97accf3234bf57628c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Omnishore-Smart-Agents/Omniplatform/git/trees/e0e429c689ebaa4a9889e97accf3234bf57628c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Omnishore-Smart-Agents/Omniplatform/git/commits/51a51a0ba2462bb2b028d1fe7100739a0c17ae72","verification":{"payload":"tree e0e429c689ebaa4a9889e97accf3234bf57628c9\nparent 4ddb4d02680c4b4591a5d5da319feaa386b8554c\nauthor danielaustralia1 <40316131+danielaustralia1@users.noreply.github.com> 1773928095 +1100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773928095 +0700\n\nfix: enable vertical scrolling on tasks board columns (#452)\n\nAdd min-h-0 to the kanban board flex container and its column children\nso that overflow-y-auto on column bodies can actually trigger. Without\nthis, flexbox min-height:auto causes containers to grow unbounded\ninstead of constraining height and enabling scroll.\n\nFixes #376\n\nCo-authored-by: Dan <github@bookkept.com.au>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpu/6fCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANuMQAGG/ef2h9UO6E09vSpGJP6k2\nwDc1fnlRNMy25sjdXUUZsPO+KOqilE9FXn75eTus/uyLWWcaWe6fjSe+8+V+gpqs\nV99xQsYsvVA6aGY0ojuPYxQNVUUUXw8Zc+a3w/I2RGYCIyOhQzrxu+ERmRwPmMx6\nUmuw6ov8Wl+hCy5sYg8H3Pf0F7tJx4HA1Dhw0mH///4+TmG0b74BGFPF2FJGSY4o\ng3CkOITgk4cjflqI2ToYrU4hZOFFHb4atXTiW9fRMdNEI7Ga+l34lkkBmEkooBw9\nMfVDWmX3ua7AFUa3PQcw36ao0Idx2uz2jfTfEo6s0fpJhsxluYSpTEgq33Fpd9jT\nBBr24CYZ4erzw28PuK7msZPYxiIg8dMaCadk5btNbeBGXNlrAf0C3GmHpf3nWXJ6\ncg9HtwTrsLrIh3wnN6K7bcA0Es5cEI/hav7o4nagIigUw00TgNlVlitwPFcb/zfN\nNzUoy7Zx4qVDVg383QAr43dPVWlhENwv9i8myexVyvLdLGvGZbnghmD1e4MNnoo9\n7+HaQUfYGTCzDS0pqFK5nPyYCVIxme6vzTy0PNzYCsCHrha3THNHHVWAIVPC/E0T\ng2fz3xRmeTZ/dExM4aVO+RMEhvR33+GAA7Q