om","name":"Rohith Therambil Pavithran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T17:39:57Z","email":"rohithtp@gmail.com","name":"Rohith Therambil Pavithran"},"message":"fix(lint): migrate to ESLint v9 flat config\n\nAdd eslint.config.js to host-shell and example-widget using\ntypescript-eslint''s recommended flat config. Drop the --ext flag from\nboth lint scripts (removed in ESLint v9; file globs are now declared in\nthe config itself). Add typescript-eslint as a devDependency in both\npackages so the TypeScript parser is available.\n\nFixes the CI JS job which was failing with \"eslint.config.(js|mjs|cjs)\nfile not found\" on every run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6eec7739575b9cbccc52ef932e58e415c79c41d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/irmein/zerostate-mesh/git/trees/6eec7739575b9cbccc52ef932e58e415c79c41d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/irmein/zerostate-mesh/git/commits/fa144dda8fd1ec095528b4b17860a4439aaad70e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2780123?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohithtp","id":2780123,"login":"rohithtp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3ODAxMjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/irmein/zerostate-mesh/commit/fa144dda8fd1ec095528b4b17860a4439aaad70e","node_id":"C_kwDOSjK5mtoAKGZhMTQ0ZGRhOGZkMWVjMDk1NTI4YjRiMTc4NjBhNDQzOWFhYWQ3MGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/irmein/zerostate-mesh/commit/e519e565f0486ce66ea4a1bb4952aaed19b14f98","sha":"e519e565f0486ce66ea4a1bb4952aaed19b14f98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/irmein/zerostate-mesh/commits/e519e565f0486ce66ea4a1bb4952aaed19b14f98"}],"sha":"fa144dda8fd1ec095528b4b17860a4439aaad70e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/irmein/zerostate-mesh/commits/fa144dda8fd1ec095528b4b17860a4439aaad70e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2780123?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohithtp","id":2780123,"login":"rohithtp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3ODAxMjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/irmein/zerostate-mesh/commits/e519e565f0486ce66ea4a1bb4952aaed19b14f98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T17:30:11Z","email":"rohithtp@gmail.com","name":"Rohith Therambil Pavithran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T17:30:11Z","email":"rohithtp@gmail.com","name":"Rohith Therambil Pavithran"},"message":"fix(e2e): register MFE module and stabilise Playwright suite\n\nImport the example-widget side-effect in host-shell/src/index.ts so\ncustomElements.define runs and the inventory-monitor-mfe Custom Element\nis fully upgraded in the browser (root cause of all 5 failures).\n\nFix test 02 by blocking the WASM file via page.route so the Worker\nnever sends a VIEW_UPDATE, keeping the loading state visible.\n\nExtend waitForMFE to wait until the initial SUBSCRIBE_QUERY flush has\nsettled (display past \"Awaiting…\") so direct onMeshViewUpdate calls in\ntests 04-06 are not overwritten by the in-flight Worker response.\n\nAll 6 Playwright tests now pass in ~3 s.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"508303fa1b377899bd252ebbf86bbe6696cf1911","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/irmein/zerostate-mesh/git/trees/508303fa1b377899bd252ebbf86bbe6696cf1911"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/irmein/zerostate-mesh/git/commits/e519e565f0486ce66ea4a1bb4952aaed19b14f98","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2780123?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohithtp","id":2780123,"login":"rohithtp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3ODAxMjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohithtp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/use