MDQ6VXNlcjUzNTU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/mf-examples/commits/ba89b988d5ab822bb512f80bc35b1b2edad393a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T20:22:00Z","email":"jack.hsu@gmail.com","name":"Jack Hsu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T20:22:00Z","email":"jack.hsu@gmail.com","name":"Jack Hsu"},"message":"feat(mf): add dynamic/runtime federation mode to react + angular trees\n\n## Current Behavior\nHost bundles list remotes at build time. To develop locally you had to\nspin up all 4 dev servers even to render the host home page or work on\none remote.\n\n## Expected Behavior\nFour trees (react-rspack, react-rsbuild, react-vite, angular-native-fed)\nnow ship a dynamic federation variant alongside the existing static one.\n\nReact trees: host''s bundler config drops `remotes:`; bootstrap fetches\npublic/mf-remotes.json and calls init() from the federation runtime;\nroutes use loadRemote() instead of static `import(''remote-N/...'')`.\n\nAngular native fed: already dynamic by design - manifest is fetched at\nruntime by initFederation(). No code changes needed beyond the proof.\n\nEach tree adds `pnpm test:e2e:dynamic` that spawns only host + remote-1\n(remote-2 / remote-3 servers absent) and verifies:\n- home loads with zero console errors\n- /remote-1 federated route loads\n- (React only) /remote-2 falls back to RemoteErrorBoundary gracefully\n\nREADME + MF-COMPARISON updated to document the dynamic variant per tree.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\nN/A","tree":{"sha":"9e86597c8dce9fd8f26bbcdb2ec719668eca3fee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/mf-examples/git/trees/9e86597c8dce9fd8f26bbcdb2ec719668eca3fee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/mf-examples/git/commits/ba89b988d5ab822bb512f80bc35b1b2edad393a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53559?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jaysoo","id":53559,"login":"jaysoo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNTU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nrwl/mf-examples/commit/ba89b988d5ab822bb512f80bc35b1b2edad393a7","node_id":"C_kwDOSjN0WNoAKGJhODliOTg4ZDVhYjgyMmJiNTEyZjgwYmMzNWIxYjJlZGFkMzkzYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nrwl/mf-examples/commit/e518704ecaa2897aaeeee710f1d2b66557608a5a","sha":"e518704ecaa2897aaeeee710f1d2b66557608a5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/mf-examples/commits/e518704ecaa2897aaeeee710f1d2b66557608a5a"}],"sha":"ba89b988d5ab822bb512f80bc35b1b2edad393a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/mf-examples/commits/ba89b988d5ab822bb512f80bc35b1b2edad393a7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53559?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/events{/privacy}","follower