71143d8aa7a84d9900c937bc242e9946b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/mf-examples/commits/73a96b71143d8aa7a84d9900c937bc242e9946b2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53559?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jaysoo","id":53559,"login":"jaysoo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNTU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/mf-examples/commits/abc8f04692c4f62fc24e0f5cd8bd937ed20083cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T15:54:09Z","email":"jack.hsu@gmail.com","name":"Jack Hsu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T15:54:09Z","email":"jack.hsu@gmail.com","name":"Jack Hsu"},"message":"fix(nx-react): share react/react-dom as eager singletons + add README\n\n## Current Behavior\nnx serve host (or nx serve remote2 etc) bootstrapped successfully but the\nhost page crashed with \"dispatcher.getOwner is not a function\" because\nreact/react-dom were not configured as shared singletons. React 19''s new\ndispatcher API got loaded by one bundle and not by the other.\n\n## Expected Behavior\nEach Nx React app (host + remote1/2/3) shares react / react-dom / react/*\nsub-paths as eager singletons via module-federation.config.ts. Explicit\nreact/react-dom/react-router-dom deps in each app''s package.json so\n@nx/module-federation discovers them unambiguously during the static-remote\nbuild.\n\nTop-level README rewritten to document the six MF trees, default ports,\nhow to run dev/build/e2e for each stack, and where screenshots land.\nMF-COMPARISON.md added as the deeper feature/gotcha matrix.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\nN/A","tree":{"sha":"54022831d1374cfc2a9e332a6e349e4748f97814","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/mf-examples/git/trees/54022831d1374cfc2a9e332a6e349e4748f97814"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/mf-examples/git/commits/abc8f04692c4f62fc24e0f5cd8bd937ed20083cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53559?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jaysoo","id":53559,"login":"jaysoo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNTU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nrwl/mf-examples/commit/abc8f04692c4f62fc24e0f5cd8bd937ed20083cc","node_id":"C_kwDOSjN0WNoAKGFiYzhmMDQ2OTJjNGY2MmZjMjRlMGY1Y2Q4YmQ5MzdlZDIwMDgzY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nrwl/mf-examples/commit/49f595715f42fa2974cf026cecf9723698049f87","sha":"49f595715f42fa2974cf026cecf9723698049f87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/mf-examples/commits/49f595715f42fa2974cf026cecf9723698049f87"}],"sha":"abc8f04692c4f62fc24e0f5cd8bd937ed20083cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/mf-examples/commits/abc8f04692c4f62fc24e0f5cd8bd937ed20083cc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53559?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jaysoo","id":53559,"login":"jaysoo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNTU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/mf-examples/commits/49f595715f42fa2974cf026cecf9723698049f87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T23:46:38Z","email":"jack.hsu@gmail.com","name":"Jack Hsu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T23:46:38Z","email":"jack.hsu@gmail.com","name":"Jack Hsu"},"message":"feat(nx): add canonical Nx-generated React + Angular MF examples\n\n## Current Behavior\nNo Nx-generated module federation examples to compare against the bespoke\nnon-Nx trees.\n\n## Expected Behavior\nTwo new trees generated via nx add + canonical generators:\n\n- packages/nx-react: @nx/react:host with --bundler=rspack, 3 remotes via\n  @module-federation/enhanced\n- packages/nx-angular: @nx/angular:host (webpack-based), 3 remotes\n\nBoth trees customized with the same Counter/Form/List components, host nav,\nand styled themes to match the rsbuild/rspack/rsbuild/vite/native-fed trees.\nPlaywright e2e via nx run X-e2e:e2e, 7/7 passing each, screenshots written\nto host-e2e/screenshots/.\n\nNaming: Nx generators require JS-identifier-safe project names (no hyphens).\nnx-react uses host/remote1/remote2/remote3. nx-angular uses ng-host plus\nng_remote1/ng_remote2/ng_remote3 to avoid name collisions with the React tree.\n\nRequired workspace tweaks for the existing setup:\n- NX_IGNORE_UNSUPPORTED_TS_SETUP=true for @nx/angular:init (project-refs\n  conflict with Angular)\n- Angular tsconfig.app.json overrides emitDeclarationOnly, declaration,\n  composite from base tsconfig (Angular CLI rejects emitDeclarationOnly)\n- Angular tsconfigs add lib: [es2022, dom, dom.iterable] explicitly\n- sirv-cli added at root devDeps for ad-hoc static serving\n\n## Related Issue(s)\nN/A","tree":{"sha":"ac9c8d6333e6e1f7a7bbfbe05133a7894ed7630b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/mf-examples/git/trees/ac9c8d6333e6e1f7a7bbfbe05133a7894ed7630b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/mf-examples/git/commits/49f595715f42fa2974cf026cecf9723698049f87","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53559?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jaysoo","id":53559,"login":"jaysoo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNTU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_ur