: add module federation example with @module-federation/vite\n\n## Current Behavior\nNo Vite-based module federation example.\n\n## Expected Behavior\npackages/react-vite tree with 1 host + 3 routed remotes using\n@module-federation/vite. Mirrors the React rsbuild/rspack trees: identical\nsrc/ (Counter/Form/List), shared deps singleton, code-parity rule.\n\nPorts 5100-5103 (avoids macOS AirTunes occupying 5000). Playwright e2e uses\nmulti-webServer to ensure all 4 ports are up before tests. 7/7 tests pass\nincluding 3 standalone-remote routes. Screenshots written to\ne2e/screenshots/.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\nN/A","tree":{"sha":"7dbfcb65d76578b4579e2a2c29307be75f5bf3de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/mf-examples/git/trees/7dbfcb65d76578b4579e2a2c29307be75f5bf3de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/mf-examples/git/commits/56b0d6406032411e6489873991e0b848459962e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53559?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jaysoo","id":53559,"login":"jaysoo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNTU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nrwl/mf-examples/commit/56b0d6406032411e6489873991e0b8484599