, Form, List) using @angular-architects/native-federation.\nHost loads remotes via loadRemoteModule and federation.manifest.json. Ports\n4200-4203. Same Playwright e2e shape as the React trees: home, 3 federated\nroutes, 3 standalone routes, screenshots saved under e2e/screenshots.\n\n## Related Issue(s)\nN/A","tree":{"sha":"0af1891c0cc51dacf5561a51e4680dd459f83e47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/mf-examples/git/trees/0af1891c0cc51dacf5561a51e4680dd459f83e47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/mf-examples/git/commits/ca0aa7d6225b67708b0983e47b2bede5f2d8e5eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53559?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jaysoo","id":53559,"login":"jaysoo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNTU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaysoo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nrwl/mf-examples/commit/ca0aa7d6225b67708b0983e47b2bede5f2d8e5eb","node_id":"C_kwDOSjN0WNoAKGNhMGFhN2Q2MjI1YjY3NzA4YjA5ODNlNDdiMmJlZGU1ZjJkOGU1ZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nrwl/mf-examples/commit/2e6369f011c5985096eab73fbb633d2cf2611a34","sha":"2e6369f011c5985096eab73fbb633d2cf2611a34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nrwl/mf-examples/commits/2e