eceived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noofreuuuh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noofreuuuh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noofreuuuh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noofreuuuh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/noofreuuuh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grasdouble/sebastien-lemouillour.fr/commits/ec0af19509533da83848bbfd7e6f3c1dacccd2c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T08:54:17Z","email":"dev.n2ofr@gmail.com","name":"Noofreuuuh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T08:54:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Add import map overrides for preview and update sync logic (#70)\n\n* feat: add import map overrides for preview environment and update sync logic\n\n- Introduced a new import map overrides file for the preview environment at `public/importMap.overrides.preview.json`, mapping various libraries to local development URLs.\n- Updated the import maps synchronization script to read from the `public` directory instead of `src`, ensuring the correct path is logged during updates.\n- Removed the import map injector plugin from the Vite configuration to streamline the build process.\n- Refactored the highlight.js integration in `slm-vendors` to utilize the full library instead of individual language imports, improving bundle size and simplifying language registration.\n- Updated `pnpm-lock.yaml` to include new dependencies and ensure compatibility with the latest versions of `vite`, `terser`, and other related packages.\n\n* fix: add changeset","tree":{"sha":"2f4f20487962d6e1243d4471865ca1ec0d9a513f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grasdouble/sebastien-lemouillour.fr/git/trees/2f4f20487962d6e1243d4471865ca1ec0d9a513f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grasdouble/sebastien-lemouillour.fr/git/commits/ec0af19509533da83848bbfd7e6f3c1dacccd2c8","verification":{"payload":"tree 2f4f20487962d6e1243d4471865ca1ec0d9a513f\nparent 5d6dcdef2fe7929340e8c353a41bbe5d3b1dcbba\nauthor Noofreuuuh <dev.n2ofr@gmail.com> 1780822457 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780822457 +0200\n\nfix: Add import map overrides for preview and update sync logic (#70)\n\n* feat: add import map overrides for preview environment and update sync logic\n\n- Introduced a new import map overrides file for the preview environment at `public/importMap.overrides.preview.json`, mapping various libraries to local development URLs.\n- Updated the import maps synchronization script to read from the `public` directory instead of `src`, ensuring the correct path is logged during updates.\n- Removed the import map injector plugin from the Vite configuration to streamline the build process.\n- Refactored the highlight.js integration in `slm-vendors` to utilize the full library instead of individual language imports, improving bundle size and simplifying language registration.\n- Updated `pnpm-lock.yaml` to include new dependencies and ensure compatibility with the latest versions of `vite`, `terser`, and other related packages.\n\n* fix: add changeset","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqJTG5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKD0QAK4Yc+zH9XOKrDt5pfkHBX+H\nvEZlndZaBziE4j2TRWtkp4uRHO9EUGxD25t6oPDjRGgN6rAyyPr2qFUk3HCMIGF+\nc+Noi2H3VHzgUEKQfHM7gjhJtdMf82IrOVD3f9Of3fNoJKExIetu095gdMNPW4H8\nZRyLXZ3iZRKEl2ZmH4la6qvw8KPxZER0dpQqjW/dRS1CKRc6qVYlGBQEJbLKSxeV\ndGNPJBe1+tDtxFCoyY4x5OmyQatf+wmCGjJcF2HgUtSI8oeZ+jsi27Pc9eDsSvic\nfXJoX7ZyJm4vlqjGzLAFi+3y9FwKuKxmC82IxTybk37NFypGublTmkMVhnrFTPGk\nl6yn6HZezEfuRPYHSMoojQK7JNz7z71Q8r+N5oHT4Kbx7fcoxzpZR0JwsyW6j33R\nT/1QO+SZCzuTYxFkq/bsW4fl8uzHrxzGexxsJLi+asaX2yGQpFWXYiz+TS2/ZIeJ\n0v+onjC4kGMfENaK5JGb0+Dft3rnmML0DWjaE2gt9PhuILWgM3Vb2vQvzUBs1+qZ\nFC7yevQuJ1K3grXYYGlAetQD0CdoRMe9h3/ACSPbL0YOk+A+5GrOm46YmEtcsrjH\ndjGySqXyOKrk9/qi7kbeGeNeKuJ5d8goaurX8kHWypiFeXUzSZVubTTm4j4A