epos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noofreuuuh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noofreuuuh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noofreuuuh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/noofreuuuh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grasdouble/sebastien-lemouillour.fr/commits/d75fe8271be89e20ed9e85df377b07521f4e0702/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T23:59:37Z","email":"dev.n2ofr@gmail.com","name":"Noofreuuuh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T23:59:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Enhance vendor handling and add ESM shim for useSyncExternalStore (#60)\n\n* fix: update importMapExternal.json to prevent bundled duplicate React instances\n\n* feat: add ESM shim for useSyncExternalStore and update Vite config for vendor manifest handling\n\n- Introduced a new file `use-sync-external-store-shim.ts` to provide an ESM shim for `useSyncExternalStore`.\n- Enhanced `vite.config.js` to read the vendor manifest and construct an external import map for dependency injection.\n- Updated dependencies in `pnpm-lock.yaml` to include `esbuild` and other related packages, ensuring compatibility with the latest versions.\n\n* feat: major version bump for @grasdouble/slm_plugin_vite_import-map-injector; removed extImportMap option and simplified plugin API\n\nchore: update .gitignore to exclude vendor bundles\n\nfix: update build scripts in package.json to include new slm-vendors package\n\nfeat: add @grasdouble/slm-vendors package with vendor build and serve scripts\n\nrefactor: remove build-vendors script from slm-container and integrate vendor builds into slm-vendors\n\ntest: update importMapPlugin tests to reflect changes in import map handling\n\nchore: update import maps in slm-container for new vendor structure\n\nfix: update vite.config.js to remove vendor manifest handling and adjust import map plugin configuration\n\nchore: update pnpm-lock.yaml to include new dependencies for slm-vendors package\n\n* fix: correct package name for @grasdouble/slm-vendors in changeset\nchore: add changeset for updating dependencies to consume new @grasdouble/slm-vendors package\n\n* fix: update versioning for @grasdouble/slm-vendors and @grasdouble/slm-container to major\n\n* fix: update ESLint configuration to use tsconfig.eslint.json for improved TypeScript support\n\n* fix: enhance security in static file server by validating requested paths to prevent directory traversal attacks","tree":{"sha":"2fe9f0d3a4d9d84fc87cc0cf7db8bd13738d61a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grasdouble/sebastien-lemouillour.fr/git/trees/2fe9f0d3a4d9d84fc87cc0cf7db8bd13738d61a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grasdouble/sebastien-lemouillour.fr/git/commits/d75fe8271be89e20ed9e85df377b07521f4e0702","verification":{"payload":"tree 2fe9f0d3a4d9d84fc87cc0cf7db8bd13738d61a1\nparent 74980956989c409e01f0a4808192ad0ef536a1e6\nauthor Noofreuuuh <dev.n2ofr@gmail.com> 1780444777 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780444777 +0200\n\nfix: Enhance vendor handling and add ESM shim for useSyncExternalStore (#60)\n\n* fix: update importMapExternal.json to prevent bundled duplicate React instances\n\n* feat: add ESM shim for useSyncExternalStore and update Vite config for vendor manifest handling\n\n- Introduced a new file `use-sync-external-store-shim.ts` to provide an ESM shim for `useSyncExternalStore`.\n- Enhanced `vite.config.js` to read the vendor manifest and construct an external import map for dependency injection.\n- Updated dependencies in `pnpm-lock.yaml` to include `esbuild` and other related packages, ensuring compatibility with the latest versions.\n\n* feat: major version bump for @grasdouble/slm_plugin_vite_import-map-injector; removed extImportMap option and simplified plugin API\n\nchore: update .gitignore to exclude vendor bundles\n\nfix: update build scripts 