lication dates and content for clarity\n\n- Added entry for guide review on generation parameters to the decision log.\n- Created a new changeset for the human review of guides and updated publication dates.\n- Updated publication and update dates for AI benchmarks in both English and French.\n- Revised content for AI benchmarks to enhance clarity and precision.\n- Updated publication and update dates for automated LLM evaluation in both English and French.\n- Revised content for automated LLM evaluation to improve clarity and structure.\n- Adjusted generation parameters documentation to reflect updated publication dates and improve content clarity.\n- Updated temperature and top-k documentation to correct order and enhance clarity.\n- Adjusted top-p documentation to correct order and improve content clarity.\n\n* Refactor top-p and transformer documentation for clarity and precision\n\n- Revised explanations of top-p sampling to emphasize its role in managing tail tokens without compromising overall tone.\n- Updated code examples for top-p usage in both English and French documentation.\n- Enhanced the section on transformer models, clarifying the distinctions between encoder-only, decoder-only, and encoder-decoder architectures.\n- Improved the mental models and flowcharts for better understanding of transformer operations and task suitability.\n- Added checks for model configurations to ensure proper usage and deployment considerations.\n\n* Refactor prompting content and localization files\n\n- Updated structured outputs documentation in English and French, including examples and clarifications on JSON Schema usage.\n- Revised \"What is a prompt\" section to emphasize the importance of context and constraints in prompting.\n- Enhanced zero-shot prompting guidance with clearer definitions and examples.\n- Removed unnecessary localization keys from English and French JSON files for cleaner translations.\n- Adjusted publication and update dates for consistency across documents.\n\n* Update publication dates across multiple prompting documents for consistency","tree":{"sha":"f56daa09979a93ae180fe06b5c926a74195f6f85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grasdouble/sebastien-lemouillour.fr/git/trees/f56daa09979a93ae180fe06b5c926a74195f6f85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grasdouble/sebastien-lemouillour.fr/git/commits/4f5bacd103b80cb316f11195b7c86533cbafe9d2","verification":{"payload":"tree f56daa09979a93ae180fe06b5c926a74195f6f85\nparent 410ef357cea7ce47f4baa6ce2ab2c8fbf9d6ade8\nauthor Noofreuuuh <dev.n2ofr@gmail.com> 1780273992 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780273992 +0200\n\nfeat: Refine LLM content clarity and update publication dates across documents (#58)\n\n* Update publication and update dates across multiple LLM content files; refine language for clarity and precision in explanations of LLM concepts such as attention mechanisms, embeddings, generation parameters, hallucinations, evaluation methods, model biases, reasoning, temperature, top-k, and transformers.\n\n* Update decision log and review documents; adjust publication dates and content for clarity\n\n- Added entry for guide review on generation parameters to the decision log.\n- Created a new changeset for the human review of guides and updated publication dates.\n- Updated publication and update dates for AI benchmarks in both English and French.\n- Revised content for AI benchmarks to enhance clarity and precision.\n- Updated publication and update dates for automated LLM evaluation in both English and French.\n- Revised content for automated LLM evaluation to improve clarity and structure.\n- Adjusted generation parameters documentation to reflect updated publication dates and improve content clarity.\n- Updated temperature and top-k documentation to correct order and enhance clarity.\n- Adjusted top-p documentation to correct order and improve content clarity.\n\n* Refactor top-p and transformer documentation for clarity and precision\n\n