:"2026-05-20T08:37:27Z","email":"namanraj@amazon.com","name":"Naman Rajpal"},"message":"fix: pass full environment to agent subprocess\n\nThe ACP SDK''s default_environment() only passes 6 basic env vars (HOME,\nPATH, etc.). Agent binaries like claude-agent-acp need ANTHROPIC_API_KEY.\nNow we pass os.environ (with dotenv loaded) to spawn_agent_process.\n\nBoth kiro-cli and claude-agent-acp tested end-to-end successfully.","tree":{"sha":"d6e2efec1c197efedb77a01d2a58c5da7c1363f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanrajpal/acp-to-agui/git/trees/d6e2efec1c197efedb77a01d2a58c5da7c1363f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanrajpal/acp-to-agui/git/commits/00938f657164567f6c4002abf9f8baa6e272639f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18372667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanrajpal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanrajpal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanrajpal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanrajpal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanrajpal","id":18372667,"login":"namanrajpal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MzcyNjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanrajpal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanrajpal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanrajpal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanrajpal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanrajpal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanrajpal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/namanrajpal/acp-to-agui/commit/00938f657164567f6c4002abf9f8baa6e272639f","node_id":"C_kwDOSjW7cdoAKDAwOTM4ZjY1NzE2NDU2N2Y2YzQwMDJhYmY5ZjhiYWE2ZTI3MjYzOWY","parents":[{"htm