mplements acp.Client protocol (session_update,\n  request_permission, ext_notification callbacks)\n- request_permission uses asyncio.Future for async approval flow\n- Rename backend/tasks/ → backend/sessions/ (SessionManager, SessionStore)\n- Simplify backend/types/acp.py (SDK provides protocol types)\n\nTested end-to-end with kiro-cli: initialize, new_session, prompt streaming,\nand extension notifications (_kiro.dev/metadata) all work correctly.","tree":{"sha":"ae5b63c505bc64ae8f15891228b23d1a0fcbe5d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanrajpal/acp-to-agui/git/trees/ae5b63c505bc64ae8f15891228b23d1a0fcbe5d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanrajpal/acp-to-agui/git/commits/52df4108136524dad520f1a847feb9e07f05b286","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18372667?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanrajpal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanrajpal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanrajpal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanrajpal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanrajpal","id":18372667,"login":"namanrajpal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MzcyNjY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanrajpal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanrajpal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanrajpal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanrajpal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanrajpal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanrajpal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/namanrajpal/acp-to-agui/commit/52df4108136524dad520f1a847feb9e07f05b286","node_id":"C_kwDOSjW7cdoAKDUyZGY0MTA4MTM2NTI0ZGFkNTIwZjFhODQ3ZmViOWUwN2