6-17640–17654/17663):\n- browser-metrics-plugin.contrib, troubleshooting, personio-pipeline-projen,\n  tensorlake, @praveenvjpm/color-utils-7210, @ziedzzz/demo-canary,\n  abbishal-poc-as-dependency, abbishal-poc2, mfasolver,\n  internallib_v788 (any), waie-crash-baileys (any), random-certs (any),\n  vectorizers (any), tailwindcss-animatecss-keyframes (any)\n\nnpm-tombstoned packages newly picked up (MAL-2022-2806, MAL-2025-47990,\nMAL-2025-49241, MAL-2025-49244 — all updated Oct 7 2026):\n- eslint-config-support, e2e-test-utils, store-webpack-config,\n  windows_registry_editor (all any-version, 0.0.1-security placeholder)\n\nOSV sources: MAL-2022-2806, MAL-2025-47990, MAL-2025-49241, MAL-2025-49244,\nMAL-2026-17640, MAL-2026-17641, MAL-2026-17642, MAL-2026-17643,\nMAL-2026-17644, MAL-2026-17645, MAL-2026-17646, MAL-2026-17647,\nMAL-2026-17648, MAL-2026-17649, MAL-2026-17650, MAL-2026-17651,\nMAL-2026-17652, MAL-2026-17653, MAL-2026-17654, MAL-2026-17655,\nMAL-2026-17656, MAL-2026-17657, MAL-2026-17658, MAL-2026-17659,\nMAL-2026-17660, MAL-2026-17661, MAL-2026-17662, MAL-2026-17663,\nMAL-2026-17664\n\nAutomatically updated every 4 hours $(date -u +%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ)","tree":{"sha":"993558739a4176d675f71f4d0c06777ce6960267","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/trees/993558739a4176d675f71f4d0c06777ce6960267"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/commits/121f7fce83e68ab97861b0999772805d73ac8255","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/768841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"htt