 obfuscated install-time dropper; native-extension\n  payload hidden inside an image file (steganography).\n  https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-17196\n- coinscan 0.1.0 — install-time C2 beacon; fetches JSON manifest from\n  attacker-controlled domain.\n  https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-17197\n- caracas4check 1.1.1/1.1.2 — boot.pth planted at site-packages root for\n  persistent per-interpreter execution; VirusTotal-confirmed.\n  https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-17198\n- scrapetools2 0.2.0/0.2.1/1.2.0/1.2.1 — downloader.py fetches tar.gz\n  payloads from IPFS gateways (eu.orbitor.dev) and executes them.\n  https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-17199\n- aseity 0.1.0 — same steganographic-dropper pattern as donutpromotion;\n  obfuscated fetch loads native extension hidden in an image.\n  https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-17200\n\nSources: OSV bulk export (GCS, Sep 28 2026 snapshot).\nAll 9 records confirmed active (not withdrawn) via bulk-export verification.\n\nAutomatically updated every 4 hours 2026-09-28T04:17:59Z\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TTRdDLkLp7JwmfmpHsz9Kb","tree":{"sha":"a07135f1821067023999c55b721d334e4c4df05c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/trees/a07135f1821067023999c55b721d334e4c4df05c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/commits/91b88915047171fae61a7476d47099f0a768845f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/768841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"h