er.com","name":"Jascha"},"message":"Sep 10 2026 sweep — 15 new entries (eToro dep-confusion, pinochiomathm, pylever)\n\nnpm (12 new packages):\n- eToro dep-confusion cluster (10): etoro-aggregator, etoro-analytics,\n  etoro-api, etoro-auth, etoro-billing, etoro-builders, etoro-cashout,\n  etoro-charts, etoro-client, etoro-core — all at 999.0.0; impersonate\n  eToro''s internal npm packages to hijack dep resolution in CI/CD.\n  OSV MAL-2026-16111 through MAL-2026-16120\n- pinochiomathm 2.3.2–2.3.5: malware communicating with malicious domain.\n  OSV MAL-2026-16123\n- tailwindcss-contact-forms 0.5.4–0.6.0: Tailwind CSS plugin typosquat,\n  7 malicious versions.\n  OSV MAL-2026-16124\n\nPyPI (3 new packages):\n- websetup 0.1.0: install-time malware (OpenSSF Package Analysis).\n  OSV MAL-2026-16121\n- pylever 1.0.0–1.0.12: prolific install-time malware family, 13 versions.\n  OSV MAL-2026-16122\n- lucy-python-script-2030 0.1.1/0.1.2: throwaway credential exfiltrator.\n  OSV MAL-2026-16125\n\nPrimary sources: OSV bulk export (GCS, Sep 10 2026 snapshot).\nActive-record gate: all 15 records confirmed non-withdrawn in OSV bulk export.\n\nAutomatically updated every 4 hours 2026-09-11T04:24:00Z\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012cG8hoWM9yCZxs696cc1WW","tree":{"sha":"edf99f38622584c742957e0eade0b06510500ce7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/trees/edf99f38622584c742957e0eade0b06510500ce7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/commits/6c48e8c80713df3523532f4a2d18e68a84bd1963","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/768841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/followers","following_url":"https://ap