ion-fe dep-confusion cluster (4 npm, any-version):\n- @auction-fe/base/portal/reporting-system/ui-kit (MAL-2026-16106–16109)\n\nMiscellaneous npm batch (10):\n- reactlogo-load 1.0.0, external_deps_enjoyer 1.0.0,\n  cache-cleanup-module 2.5.0/2.6.0, server-authorized-cleanup 1.1.0,\n  @staticj/cropperxmjs 1.6.0, amprem-activator (any-version),\n  vinnleys (any-version), matrixkit-js 1.0.0,\n  twilio-hackerone-poc-b8f21a 1.0.0/1.0.1, @convertics/script (any-version)\n  (MAL-2026-16069/16076/16078/16079/16081/16084/16092/16095/16097/16110)\n\nPyPI dep-confusion/probe batch (3):\n- databricks-webapp-navigation-homepage 999.0.0 (MAL-2026-16080)\n- bq-build-probe-vrp-2026 0.2.0 (MAL-2026-16098)\n- bq-sdist-probe-vrp 0.0.1 (MAL-2026-16099)\n\nSources:\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-16069 through MAL-2026-16110\n- https://osv-vulnerabilities.storage.googleapis.com/npm/all.zip\n- https://osv-vulnerabilities.storage.googleapis.com/PyPI/all.zip\n\nAutomatically updated every 4 hours 2026-09-10T04:16:00Z\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PkeMKgszfKUsQR5xs4XjN1","tree":{"sha":"790987b7aa51d8a5fd4cf9dc27ad1c3b74ebbaa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/trees/790987b7aa51d8a5fd4cf9dc27ad1c3b74ebbaa2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/commits/2557f8a1fbbfb861280ff4aa412140964c0c27a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/768841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jaschadub","id":