ank-bot-gogle-cloning,\n  frank-research-poc-apple, apple-cktool-internal-api-v9,\n  apple-internal-test-utility, frank-apple-sync-service, frank-apple-utils,\n  google-cloud-internal-build-helper, google-cloud-internal-core-utils,\n  google-cloud-mono-repo-helper, google-internal-cloud-audit-security-check —\n  dep-confusion probes targeting Apple and Google internal namespaces; all\n  versions fully compromise the host. OSV MAL-2026-3080/3081/15833/15834/\n  15837/15838/15839/15840/15841/15842.\n- @viertechjs/* (3): attacker-controlled scope with malicious Baileys\n  (WhatsApp Web) forks and API package; fully compromises host.\n  OSV MAL-2026-15830/15831/15832.\n- @bx-ui-framework/* (3): authentication, common at 1.2.0/15.0.0,\n  microfrontend at 15.0.0 — pull runtime dependency from attacker-controlled\n  Artifactory mirror. OSV MAL-2026-15866/15867/15868.\n- guci/btree Chinese-ecosystem malware cluster (15): btree-core/leaderboard/\n  lru-cache/range-store/time-index, indexed-btree — fake data-structure\n  library; element-guci-util/icon/utils, guci-date/main/wxrout — impersonates\n  Chinese Vue.js component library; fullcalendar-windos, html_vue, vscode-vue.\n  OSV MAL-2026-15873–15894 (various).\n- Miscellaneous batch (27): fuels-versions 1.0.0, bamru 1.0.0,\n  @grab-food/order-sdk-web 49.9.9, @yuva2210/okx-poc-rce-impact 2.0.0,\n  lil-swisgom-hlepers 49.9.9, eslint-rxjs 1.0.1,\n  bt2-api-gateway-node-js 999.0.x (SSH-key exfiltrator),\n  order-package-saas 999.0.x, daisypick 1.2.0, eyiouss,\n  is-generator-check, onceaction, react-mongoose, tailwind-theme-engine,\n  fieldbase-webapplication-buildtools 99.99.99,\n  @avigilon/node-webrtc 2.1.4/2.1.5, mcp-consultasdeveiculos-client,\n  vitest-cli-dev 10.0.7, wallet-watcher 1.0.2, @a23842/dsh-notifier,\n  cbc97b7a, dsh-waste-market, neighbor-key-map, ordered-freq-counter,\n  ordered-kv-index, priority-slot-queue, sliding-score-window.\n  OSV MAL-2026-15673/15674/15681/15687/15689/15812/15813/15816/15835–\n  15836/15843–15847/15865/15869–15872/15878–15879/15889–15893.\n- 8 new scope entries added to NPM_SUSPECT_SCOPES.\n\nPyPI (10 new packages):\n- requests typosquat cluster (4): 0requests, py-0requests, py-1requests,\n  py-2equests — all at 0.0.1; import-time env-var exfiltrators.\n  OSV MAL-2026-15859/15860/15861/15862.\n- Misc credential infostealers (6): company-sdk 0.0.1 (SSH key + cloud\n  credential harvester; OSV MAL-2026-15827), env-validator-tool\n  1.0.0/1.0.1/1.0.2 (OSV MAL-2026-15828), telemetry-helper 8 versions\n  1.0.0–2.0.1 (OSV MAL-2026-15829), trongridi 0.0.1 (Tron private-key\n  stealer variant; OSV MAL-2026-15858), uvhttp-custom 1.7.9/1.8.1/1.9.9\n  (OSV MAL-2026-15863), asti 0.1.0 (env-var infostealer; OSV MAL-2026-15864).\n\nSources:\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-3080\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-3081\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15827\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15828\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15829\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15830\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15831\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15832\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15833\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15834\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15837\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15838\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15839\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15848\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15857\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15858\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15859\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15863\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15864\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15865\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15866\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15873\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15880\n\nAutomatically updated every 4 hours 2026-09-04T04:30:00Z\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01U9QYaw7vX9MAcZX