nels)\n  @systemzero/baileys   1.1.2          (hardcoded remote-control signal stream)\n\nFake-SDK credential harvesters from July 22-24 2026 wave, backfilled\n(OSV MAL-2026-5572 / GHSA-3cvf-g4vx-wgr3 — sendgrid-sdk;\n OSV MAL-2026-5612 / GHSA-wrmh-73gr-22fc — gpt-sdk;\n OSV MAL-2026-5621 / GHSA-889w-p55g-884m — twilio-sdk — 3 packages):\n  sendgrid-sdk  0.1.0-0.1.3, 0.2.0-0.2.4\n  gpt-sdk       0.1.0-0.1.3, 0.2.0-0.2.4\n  twilio-sdk    0.1.0-0.1.3, 0.2.0-0.2.4\n\nSources:\n  https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15819\n  https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15820\n  https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15821\n  https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15822\n  https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15823\n  https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-15824\n  https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-5572\n  https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-5612\n  https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-5621\n  https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-3cvf-g4vx-wgr3\n  https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-wrmh-73gr-22fc\n  https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-889w-p55g-884m\n\nAll records verified active (no withdrawn field) via OSV GCS bulk export\nsnapshot dated 2026-09-02. Verified via OSV bulk ZIP (api.osv.dev blocked\nby egress proxy in this environment).\n\nAutomatically updated every 4 hours 2026-09-03T00:00:00Z\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HAfo5sWixdisTe5dKsAm7e","tree":{"sha":"10643f32ca60a856d1c30b9bc5bbc6f73b9f2cda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/trees/10643f32ca60a856d1c30b9bc5bbc6f73b9f2cda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/commits/fde387172b41ba6047e5f4c2cbb1878c58feb72f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/768841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/e