HSA-w3j6-3pww-qfcw), saas-f-testing (GHSA-fvrj-4h6r-8rcg),\n  tailwind-animate-css-plugin (GHSA-5w98-j73p-rv7m), kelly-sizing (GHSA-vj74-3pcr-5p7j),\n  qr-code-styling-temp (GHSA-pp2c-4x5r-7h8j), react-hook-use-debounce-throttle-12\n  (GHSA-2x4w-64xc-78fv), utils-common-helpers (GHSA-fq4g-5xjj-r935),\n  pino-deploy (GHSA-9hw3-p3rx-59cw / MAL-2024-2871). All SEMVER >=0.\n- Exact-version probes (19): @js-lib-team/env-parser 1.0.0 (MAL-2026-14344),\n  express-session-handler 2.3.3 (MAL-2026-14345), @next-fonts/font 1.0.0/1.0.1 (MAL-2026-14346),\n  mcq-session 1.0.3/1.0.4 (MAL-2026-14347), moidevy 1.0.0 (MAL-2026-14348),\n  @gfe/lx-watcher 1.5.3/1.5.4 (MAL-2026-14353), fuel-react 91.0.0 (MAL-2026-14355),\n  lumen-pages-community 9.9.9 (MAL-2026-14356).\n\nPyPI (3 new packages):\n- boto4 1.0.0/1.0.2 — typosquat of boto3; setup.py drops and executes ~17MB ELF (MAL-2026-14349)\n- scrambleeer 0.1.0/0.1.1 — opens TCP reverse shell to bax.h4x.tv:6363 on import (MAL-2026-14350)\n- requests-crypt 0.1.0 — HTTP client that exfiltrates JSON responses to attacker (MAL-2026-14351)\n\nSources: OSV bulk export (GCS, Aug 21-22 2026 snapshot); osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-4209;\nsafedep.io/malicious-polymarket-npm-crypto-wallet-drainer/; github.com/advisories/GHSA-h84r-259m-g3fg\n\nAutomatically updated every 4 hours 2026-08-22T04:31:00Z","tree":{"sha":"60b960befd0424a228d2e36d96b3a46e30641366","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/trees/60b960befd0424a228d2e36d96b3a46e30641366"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/commits/7e8efa44d443fdd6d4971873b55a0f4052297ab2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/768841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/followers","following_url":"https://