v493, mev-shield, polygon-toolkit-validate, timed-assess, ai-texts, fetch-webjs-script, frenchworldcupwin, test-flow-{1,entire6,entire7}, debug-fnt/cig-data-patcher/ethereum-validator/goldstar-api-server wildcards, create-react-app-{text,ui,ux}, @pablo_clueless/{printr,sniffr}, exam-kit, chai-as-soul.\n\nPyPI (1): reqcrypts 0.1.0–0.1.3 — further reqcrypt infostealer variant with hidden backdoor.\n\ncrates.io (9): droundy (David Roundy) account compromise — arrayref 0.3.10, internment 0.8.7, append-only-vec 0.1.9 (legitimate crates with trojanized versions adding dep on malicious dropper). Pure-malware companion crates: proc-macro1 (proc-macro2 typosquat by ''dtolney''), proc-macro-en, aovine, arone, aronenao, tinymember — all any-version.\n\nSources:\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-12186 (pfp-forms-insurance-health)\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-12390 (hubert-document-actual-insurance-rules-am)\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-12391 (hubert-verify-primary-email-am)\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-12393 (invest-module-cookie)\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-12406 (pfa-errors)\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-12410 (pfp-block-mobile-steps)\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-12412 (pfp-forms-independent-sme-glossary-anchor)\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-12415 (pfp-forms-sme-sitebuilder)\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-12691 (devplatform-api-clients)\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-12852 (bigops-umf-statist)\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-12855 (bigops-watchdog-angular)\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-13302 (dolyame-boxy-desktop-bnpl-card-panel)\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-13348 (lakk-analytics)\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-13369 (kepler)\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-13451 (nms-dashboard-js)\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-14332 (aovine)\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-14333 (append-only-vec 0