PECT_SCOPES\n  (OSV MAL-2026-10703/10704)\n- @hibachi-xyz dep-confusion: 5 packages at 99.0.0; scope added to NPM_SUSPECT_SCOPES\n  (OSV MAL-2026-10712–10716)\n- AI-agent / remote-access-tool C2 cluster (WebSocket/PTY tunnels to attacker C2):\n  @agent-link/agent, @agentvox/host, @ai-support-agent/cli, @aicommander/agent,\n  @cyberrant-rantai/rantai, @equans-services/codex (@openai/codex typosquat),\n  @funny-booth/agent-core, @onescience/onecode, @sciagent/cli, @thepayulink/server,\n  @vibelet/cli, @whalent/agent, @whalent/agent-core, @yeaft/webchat-agent, @yuandc/aica,\n  agentto, bvm-core, channel-worker, codeam-cli, http-req-lite, isite, memtry-cli,\n  netcontrol-agent, patchwork-os, phantomx-tool-client, sakuraai, sensorium-mcp,\n  vanexa-agent (OSV MAL-2026-10699/10705–10725/10729–10731/10735–10737/10741/10744–10748/10751)\n- Prominent typosquats: astro 7.1.0 (Astro framework), nordpass 3 versions (NordPass),\n  axios-test-one 1.19.0, idlive-document-capture-web 14.2.1, telemetry-metrics 0.2.1\n  (OSV MAL-2026-10726/10727/10733/10743/10750)\n- Dep-confusion inflated-version: infrastructure-common 99.9.9, myreviews-core 99.0.0,\n  amdocs-auth-package 3 versions (OSV MAL-2025-6694/MAL-2026-10734/10740)\n- Generic malware / infostealers: px8my 34 versions, theta-sdk-js 4 versions,\n  time-format-kit, date-utils-light, hehehe, mmagrt, mui-option, mw-server-util,\n  node-as-api, string-formatter-pro, sync-grove, xxdxa 6 versions\n  (OSV MAL-2026-10104/10135/10700/10728/10730–10732/10737–10739/10742/10748–10749/10752)\n- ai-pro-sdk: added versions 2.0.2 and 2.0.4 (OSV MAL-2026-10629)\n\nPyPI (10 new entries):\n- discord-telemetry / discordia-telemetria: Discord-themed remote-execution droppers\n  (OSV MAL-2026-10701/10702)\n- a3s-code: native binary payload on import (OSV MAL-2026-10753)\n- airflow-provider-spirit: Airflow provider typosquat (OSV MAL-2026-10754)\n- captcha-solve-api: remote payload dropper (OSV MAL-2026-10755)\n- darkglitch: WebSocket C2 beacon (OSV MAL-2026-10756)\n- dde-common: env exfiltrator (OSV MAL-2026-10757)\n- mfq-private-encoder: remote payload via encoder guise (OSV MAL-2026-10758)\n- ryry-cli: persistent WebSocket agent (OSV MAL-2026-10759)\n- abseil-py: absl-py typosquat, host exfiltration (OSV MAL-2026-10760)\n\nAll records verified non-withdrawn from fresh OSV bulk export (api.osv.dev blocked\nby egress policy; bulk export downloaded this run serves as active-record gate).\n\nSources:\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-10693\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-10695\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-10697\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-10698\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-10703\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-10704\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-10712\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-10716\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-10726\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-10743\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-10701\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-10760\nhttps://osv-vulnerabilities.storage.googleapis.com/npm/all.zip\nhttps://osv-vulnerabilities.storage.googleapis.com/PyPI/all.zip\n\nAutomatically updated every 4 hours 2026-07-17T04:30:00Z","tree":{"sha":"d4b2fb8b7bb6ddc81612e6fb9bd6ade1428ede10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/trees/d4b2fb8b7bb6ddc81612e6fb9bd6ade1428ede10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/commits/787f6cc42affd76a1d14a62938543c9280d86207","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/768841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":""