-component-chaos, testzapier, canary-ci-test, and ~55 more\n  (MAL-2024-1006 / MAL-2025-32206 / MAL-2025-47009 / MAL-2026-4789 / 4803 /\n   5460 / 5461 / 5515 / 5566 / 5575 / 5579 / 5580 / 5704 / 5727 / 5741 /\n   5752 / 5790 / 5792 / 5793 / 5889 / 5890 / 5972 / 5980 / 6302 / 6325 /\n   6326 / 6365 / 6475 / 10628 through 10692)\n\nPyPI batch (11 packages):\n  log-guru / pylogora 0.7.8 — Mythic/Poseidon C2 nation-state malware\n    (MAL-2026-10688/10689)\n  fflask 3 dev versions (MAL-2025-923)\n  northstart-sdk 4 versions (MAL-2026-10672)\n  xyq-drama-skill 3 versions (MAL-2026-10681)\n  qlinforge 0.3.2 (MAL-2026-10091)\n  trongridweb 0.0.1 (MAL-2026-10685)\n  data-proxy-for-test / ethereum-input-decorder / proxy-checker-j / qwen-asr-pvt\n    (MAL-2026-10642/10643/10644/10690)\n\nAlso upgraded 3 existing entries to any-version wildcards where OSV now shows\nranges >= 0: vps-maintenance-paperclip-adapter (MAL-2026-6757),\npaperclip-adapter-helpers (MAL-2026-6981), none123s (MAL-2026-7024).\n\nTotals: NPM_BAD 2227 entries (+115), PYPI_BAD 257 entries (+11).\n\nAutomatically updated every 4 hours — 2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","tree":{"sha":"6a5d3950bba548af18f591fcb039dd7053460841","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/trees/6a5d3950bba548af18f591fcb039dd7053460841"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/commits/d493ac6a27be828333adf7e2fdb3975f68de0ab0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/768841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jaschadub","id":768841,"login":"jasc