.1\n  (OSV MAL-2026-6677/6678/6695/6719/6720/6721; GHSA-vjgf-xg3j-g9c5,\n  GHSA-8mpj-272v-jhv7)\n- Frontend framework typosquats: date-fns-lite 13 versions, svgson-lite\n  7 versions, vega-lite-next 19.2.1, vue-demi-fix 10.0.3–10.0.5,\n  electron-orbit 31 versions, svgcraft-core 1.0.1–1.0.4\n  (OSV MAL-2026-6702/6707/6709/6715/6722/6723)\n- Hardhat/Solidity typosquats: hardhat-compile-ethers 13 versions,\n  hardhat-plugin-solidity 4 versions\n  (OSV MAL-2026-6705/6706)\n- GHSA full-compromise batch: rs-biginteger, terminal-prettier,\n  agent-starter-pack, brock-loader, brock-react-alerts,\n  confluent-kafka-javascript, nbmolviz-js, postcss-property-rollup,\n  quoting, setup-cicd, procwire, console-fmt-cli, decimal-format-core,\n  log-taker1, thirdwb, thirdwebb — all any-version wildcards\n  (OSV MAL-2026-6675/6676/6679–6690/6693/6694)\n- Miscellaneous malware: pp-react-v5 (any), triage-bot 1.0.1/1.0.2,\n  sypoi1 1.0.0/1.0.1, ripshakti 80.0.0, ripshakti1 81.0.0,\n  ecto-corsair-flag-7kq3mz 3 versions, module-index-cache 3 versions,\n  zyncmap 2 versions, vitest-agent 1.0.5/1.0.6, base65-85x 5.0.1,\n  test-pkg-pnpm 2 versions, test-pkg-x0 5 versions, test-pkg-yarn 3 versions\n  (OSV MAL-2026-3509/6346/6405/6674/6699/6700/6701/6704/6708/6710/6716–6718)\n- Dependency-confusion: @businessapp-microsites/apis 9999.0.0/9999.0.1,\n  @sudoughnym/enviro-demo 99.99.99, @andes-tools/colors 999.0.0,\n  cursed-modules 19 versions\n  (OSV MAL-2026-6696/6697/6698/6703)\n\nPYPI_BAD — 3 new/updated entries:\n- magique-ai: 0.4.4 added (Woodpecker campaign; OSV MAL-2026-5294)\n- twrap-tool 1.0.0 (OSV MAL-2026-6711)\n- starlette-healthcheck 1.2.0/1.3.0/1.3.1 (OSV MAL-2026-6724)\n\nREADME: 9 new rows in \"What''s tracked\" table; 53 new source entries.\n\nAutomatically updated every 4 hours 2026-07-02T04:24:45Z","tree":{"sha":"89bcb3c977aca1f3b64f94563e5833e99aba1f56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/trees/89bcb3c977aca1f3b64f94563e5833e99aba1f5