privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/commits/2424bf72bf3b62b486ccad72bbd283b5ed59a34e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T04:18:53Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T04:19:24Z","email":"jascha@tarnover.com","name":"Jascha"},"message":"June 29–30 2026 npm/PyPI malware batch (190+ packages)\n\nAI/LLM toolkit impersonation wave: anthropic-toolkit (21 pinned versions),\nai-sdk-helpers, ollama-helpers, openai-agents-helpers (any-version wildcard).\nLarge dep-confusion wave (79 packages, OSV MAL-2026-6594–6672) targeting Deel,\nPostman, Rakuten, Experian, LexisNexis, Sixt, Gallup, PlanetLabs and others;\nall SEMVER >=0. ts-einkle / ts-einkle-slot / ts-ankle TypeScript exploit cluster.\n@thone33 attacker-scope credential injectors. @epic-common/observability-node\ndep-confusion. Gartner GX dep-confusion cluster (gx-npm-feature-flags, gx-npm-lib,\ngx-npm-ui). 25 additional targeted dep-confusion packages. 55-package miscellaneous\nnpm malware batch (path-internal-util, http-uploader-dev, react-json-chalk,\ntailwind-form, react-pinojs, node-denv, chain-chai-test, ssr-auth-sync, quirky-token,\nswift-parse-stream, uol-simple-api-futebol, stackus, clx-cookie-signature, routecraft,\nhunsterx-package, hardhat-test-log, base58-core, @vpms/design-system,\nunsafe-malicious-package, velocityfix, wellnpm, @appupdate/cdn-sync, chai-as-assured,\ncrossmint-wallets-sdk, @uisp/utils, date-uuid, eslint-commit-parser, express-mocha-test,\nlongzy-basic-ui, pkg-fallback (npm), react-wp-viewer, rebrandly-domains-digger/\nrebrandly-domains-search-client, yandex-geobase, @ibrahim1337/baksen,\ncheckmarx-claude-cache, int_sezzle_sfra, layerd-unit-codec-parser, lessload, loadutils,\npino-debugging, poly-kelly, stake-math, yastatic-s3, clob-client-math, endpointmap,\nenvfile-sync, envfile-sync-cli, ledgerflow-deploy-utils, maplibre-gl-vue3, vkzmn, and\nmore). PyPI batch: sqligen, inlifegram, pdf-converter-pro (any-version), django-bkvision\n1.2.0. Also adds autotel-devtools 6.2.0 (new version in OSV MAL-2026-5218).\n\nSources:\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-6673 (anthropic-toolkit)\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-5565 (ai-sdk-helpers)\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-6581 (ollama-helpers)\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-6582 (openai-agents-helpers)\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-6594 (large dep-confusion wave, first of 79)\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-6672 (large dep-confusion wave, last of 79)\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-6562 (@epic-common/observability-node)\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-6563 (@thone33/analytics-injector)\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-6564 (@thone33/core-utils)\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-6466 (gx-npm-feature-flags)\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-6480 (gx-npm-lib)\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-6481 (gx-npm-ui)\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-6515 (sqligen PyPI)\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-6516 (inlifegram PyPI)\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-6541 (pdf-converter-pro PyPI)\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-6593 (django-bkvision PyPI)\nhttps://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-5218 (autotel-devtools, adds 6.2.0)\n\nAutomatically updated every 4 hours 2026-06-30T04:25:00Z","tree":{"sha":"59dc494e369460a1592d6c5361946a775495186d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/trees/59dc494e369460a1592d6c5361946a775495186d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/commits/2424bf72bf3b62b486ccad72bbd283b5ed59a34e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/768841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jaschadub","id":768841,"login":"jaschadub","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2ODg0MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/commit/2424bf72bf3b62b486ccad72bbd283b5ed59a34e","node_id":"C_kwDOSjXM-toAKDI0MjRiZjcyYmYzYjYyYjQ4NmNjYWQ3MmJiZDI4M2I1ZWQ1OWEzNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/commit/5f134a8d144ca02246cd145751e547ce4927fcdf","sha":"5f134a8d144ca02246cd145751e547ce4927fcdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/commits/5f134a8d144ca02