:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T20:07:59Z","email":"jascha@tarnover.com","name":"Jascha"},"message":"Woodpecker +4 PyPI, consumerweb-authflow npm (June 7 2026)\n\nFour additional Woodpecker campaign packages (PyPI):\n- coolbox 0.4.1, 0.4.2 (OSV MAL-2026-5295)\n- magique 0.6.8, 0.6.9 (OSV MAL-2026-5296)\n- executor-engine 0.3.4, 0.3.5 (OSV MAL-2026-5298)\n- pantheon-agents 0.6.1, 0.6.2 (OSV MAL-2026-5299)\n\nnpm malware (OpenSSF Package Analysis):\n- consumerweb-authflow 4.1.1, 4.1.3 (OSV MAL-2026-5297)\n\nSources:\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-5295\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-5296\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-5297\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-5298\n- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-5299\n- https://bad-packages.kam193.eu/pypi/campaign/2026-06-compr-woodpecker\n\nAutomatically updated every 4 hours 2026-06-07T20:07:36Z","tree":{"sha":"b04eeb89fb8d77d49cf0569a6ff0c20c5f70255d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/trees/b04eeb89fb8d77d49cf0569a6ff0c20c5f70255d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaschadub/compromised-packages-check/git/commits/adf74982603a6ed290ce6458145bd11da1ac9283","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/768841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jaschadub","id":768841,"login":"jaschadub","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2ODg0MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaschadub/rece