_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigitozkadir-commits/frontend-studio-g-k-umay/commits/886348420ea77aab2d8eceae72b3af637fec06c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T22:09:28Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T22:09:28Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: Enhance Chess UI Components with Advanced Features\n\nThis commit implements a comprehensive chess UI enhancement project:\n\nCOMPLETED TASKS:\n\n1. PromotionDialog.tsx Enhancement\n   - Support for white (Q, R, B, N) and black (q, r, b, n) promotion pieces\n   - Modal dialog with backdrop blur and smooth pop-in animation\n   - Keyboard shortcuts (Q/R/B/N keys) for quick piece selection\n   - Full accessibility with aria-modal and aria-label\n   - Dark mode support with tailwind utilities\n\n2. ChessBoard.tsx Improvements\n   - Last move highlighting (yellow background on from/to squares)\n   - Full board coordinates (a-h files, 1-8 ranks)\n   - Check indicator with red pulse animation on king\n   - Keyboard navigation (arrow keys for square selection, Enter to move)\n   - Board legend showing move indicators (last move, selected, possible, check)\n   - Smooth hover effects and transitions\n   - Full accessibility with proper ARIA labels\n\n3. GameControls.tsx Enhancements\n   - Captured pieces display with color-coded sections\n   - Material count calculation and display\n   - Game status indicator with emoji icons\n   - Better visual feedback with colored borders and gradients\n   - Improved button styling with focus states\n\n4. MoveHistory.tsx Improvements\n   - Move display in proper SAN notation\n   - Active move highlighting with blue ring effect\n   - Copy to clipboard for PGN format export\n   - Move counter showing total moves and turns\n   - Scrollable list with auto-scroll to latest move\n   - Accessibility region with proper aria labels\n\n5. Game.tsx Updates\n   - Proper promotion dialog integration\n   - Smooth game state transitions\n   - Responsive grid layout (2 cols for board, 1 for controls on mobile)\n   - Fade-in and slide animations\n   - Footer info cards with tips and rules\n\n6. Storybook Stories (31 total)\n   - ChessBoard.stories.tsx (8 stories): various board states\n   - GameControls.stories.tsx (9 stories): different game phases\n   - MoveHistory.stories.tsx (8 stories): move list scenarios\n   - PromotionDialog.stories.tsx (5 stories): promotion scenarios\n\n7. Tailwind Enhancements\n   - New ''pop-in'' animation for dialog entrance\n   - Extended animation definitions\n   - Custom color schemes for chess board\n   - Dark mode support throughout\n\n8. TypeScript Strict Mode\n   - All components use strict TypeScript\n   - Proper interface definitions for all props\n   - Callback type safety\n   - Full accessibility type support\n\nFEATURES:\n- Full keyboard navigation support\n- Complete accessibility (ARIA labels, roles, focus states)\n- Dark mode support\n- Smooth animations and transitions\n- Responsive design (mobile-friendly)\n- Material design principles\n- Visual feedback for all interactions\n\nTECHNICAL STACK:\n- React 18 with TypeScript (strict mode)\n- Next.js 14 (app router)\n- Tailwind CSS with animations\n- Storybook 7+ for component documentation\n\nAll components follow best practices for accessibility, performance, and user experience.\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01Xvodqoo3UXdjTnwmAddKcJ","tree":{"sha":"77b13fcd53948ec488d496d12ccd598ba1b2d6cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigitozkadir-commits/frontend-studio-g-k-umay/git/trees/77b13fcd53948ec488d496d12ccd598ba1b2d6cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigitozkadir-commits/frontend-studio-g-k-umay/git/commits/886348420ea77aab2d8eceae72b3af637fec06c7","verification":{"payload":"tree 77b13fcd53948ec488d496d12ccd598ba1b2d6cc\nparent d3d11cb053b4079630c7cbcb80f0712d9c691cd6\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1779314968 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1779314968 +0000\n\nfeat: Enhance Chess UI Components with Advanced Features\n\nThis commit implements a comprehensive chess UI enhancement project:\n\nCOMPLETED TASKS:\n\n1. PromotionDialog.tsx Enhancement\n   - Support for white (Q, R, B, N) and black (q, r, b, n) promotion pieces\n   - Modal dialog with backdrop blur and smooth pop-in animation\n   - Keyboard shortcuts (Q/R/B/N keys) for quick piece selection\n   - Full accessibility with aria-modal and aria-label\n   - Dark mode support with tailwind utilities\n\n2. ChessBoard.tsx Improvements\n   - Last move highlighting (yellow background on from/to squares)\n   - Full board coordinates (a-h files, 1-8 ranks)\n   - Check indicator with red pulse animation on king\n   - Keyboard navigation (arrow keys for square selection, Enter to move)\n   - Board legend showing move indicators (last move, selected, possible, check)\n   - Smooth hover effects and transitions\n   - Full accessibility with proper ARIA labels\n\n3. GameControls.tsx Enhancements\n   - Captured pieces display with color-coded sections\n   - Material count calculation and display\n   - Game status indicator with emoji icons\n   - Better visual feedback with colored borders and gradients\n   - Improved button styling with focus states\n\n4. MoveHistory.tsx Improvements\n   - Move display in proper SAN notation\n   - Active move highlighting with blue ring effect\n   - Copy to clipboard for PGN format export\n   - Move counter showing total moves and turns\n   - Scrollable list with auto-scroll to latest move\n   - Accessibility region with proper aria labels\n\n5. Game.tsx Updates\n   - Proper promotion dialog integration\n   - Smooth game state transitions\n   - Responsive grid layout (2 cols for board, 1 for controls on mobile)\n   - Fade-in and slide animations\n   - Footer info cards with tips and rules\n\n6. Storybook Stories (31 total)\n   - ChessBoard.stories.tsx (8 stories): various board states\n   - GameControls.stories.tsx (9 stories): different game phases\n   - MoveHistory.stories.tsx (8 stories): move list scenarios\n   - PromotionDialog.stories.tsx (5 stories): promotion scenarios\n\n7. Tailwind Enhancements\n   - New ''pop-in'' animation for dialog entrance\n   - Extended animation definitions\n   - Custom color schemes for chess board\n   - Dark mode support throughout\n\n8. TypeScript Strict Mode\n   - All components use strict TypeScript\n   - Proper interface definitions for all props\n   - Callback type safety\n   - Full accessibility type support\n\nFEATURES:\n- Full keyboard navigation support\n- Complete accessibility (ARIA labels, roles, focus states)\n- Dark mode support\n- Smooth animations and transitions\n- Responsive design (mobile-friendly)\n- Material design principles\n- Visual feedback for all interactions\n\nTECHNICAL STACK:\n- React 18 with TypeScript (strict mode)\n- Next.js 14 (app router)\n- Tailwind CSS with animations\n- Storybook 7+ for component documentation\n\nAll components follow best practices for accessibility, performance, and user experience.\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01Xvodqoo3UXdjTnwmAddKcJ\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCYwKSdq\nRMLmHoS07rSQUXJ3YLb+dhyFl5tEzXU0dwwe53cpi2aFX2u+mSr7vke/BhUiDAZxMMDo/0gzX7dg\nZwA=\n-----END SSH SIG