ff3724ce6d6f76d9523e7717af1c12faff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigitozkadir-commits/frontend-studio-g-k-umay/commits/380d7b1b5e2d5d0c393ce64995406d44243f22e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T22:08:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T22:08:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"refactor: Enhance Chess Game Logic and Validation\n\nImprovements to core game mechanics:\n\n1. useGame.ts - Enhanced with:\n   - Piece capture tracking with move numbers and turn tracking\n   - Improved SAN (algebraic notation) validation\n   - En passant detection (isEnPassant flag)\n   - Castling detection (isCastling flag)\n   - Pawn promotion dialog state management\n   - Turn-based move validation\n   - loadFen() for custom positions\n   - getGameStats() for game statistics\n   - Support for ''draw'' game status\n\n2. useChessEngine.ts - Extended with:\n   - validateMove() - Comprehensive move validation with promotion detection\n   - MoveValidationResult interface for detailed validation info\n   - isDraw() method to detect draw conditions\n   - getHistoryInSan() for SAN-only move history\n   - load() method for FEN loading\n   - Improved PGN export with optional metadata\n   - halfmoveClock and fullmoveNumber tracking\n\n3. lib/gameUtils.ts - Completed utilities:\n   - PIECE_VALUES constant with material point values\n   - getMaterialDifference() - Calculate material advantage\n   - getPositionEvaluation() - Basic position scoring with piece-square tables\n   - formatFen() - Human-readable FEN formatting\n   - getSquareNotationFromCoordinates() & getCoordinatesFromSquareNotation()\n   - getPieceNameTurkish() - Turkish piece names\n   - isTournamentDraw() - 50-move rule detection\n   - isGambit() - Gambit detection heuristic\n\n4. Test Coverage:\n   - Expanded useChessEngine.test.ts with:\n     - Move validation tests\n     - Draw condition tests\n     - Complex game scenarios (back rank mate, promotions, etc.)\n     - FEN and SAN notation tests\n\n5. Infrastructure:\n   - Fixed tsconfig.json: Added @ path alias, removed invalid ''skip'' option\n   - Excluded *.stories.tsx files from TypeScript checks\n   - Migrated jest.config.js to jest.config.cjs for ESM compatibility\n   - Updated test files to use fireEvent instead of userEvent\n\nAll changes maintain TypeScript strict mode compliance with zero errors.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01Xvodqoo3UXdjTnwmAddKcJ","tree":{"sha":"5b5eb190f97f59a584b0f60ed55efedf566b013e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigitozkadir-commits/frontend-studio-g-k-umay/git/trees/5b5eb190f97f59a584b0f60ed55efedf566b013e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigitozkadir-commits/frontend-studio-g-k-umay/git/commits/380d7b1b5e2d5d0c393ce64995406d44243f22e5","verification":{"payload":"tree 5b5eb190f97f59a584b0f60ed55efedf566b013e\nparent 07a60578ca6cccc2710c9046465b27804b7c3139\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1779314893 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1779314893 +0000\n\nrefactor: Enhance Chess Game Logic and Validation\n\nImprovements to core game mechanics:\n\n1. useGame.ts - Enhanced with:\n   - Piece capture tracking with move numbers and turn tracking\n   - Improved SAN (algebraic notation) validation\n   - En passant detection (isEnPassant flag)\n   - Castling detection (isCastling flag)\n   - Pawn promotion dialog state management\n   - Turn-based move validation\n   - loadFen() for custom positions\n   - getGameStats() for game statistics\n   - Support for ''draw'' game status\n\n2. useChessEngine.ts - Extended with:\n   - validateMove() - Comprehensive move validation with promotion detection\n   - MoveValidationResult interface for detailed validation info\n   - isDraw() method to detect draw conditions\n   - getHistoryInSan() for SAN-only move history\n   - load() method for FEN loading\n   - Improved PGN export with optional metadata\n   - halfmoveClock and fullmoveNumber tracking\n\n3. lib/gameUtils.ts - Completed utilities:\n   - PIECE_VALUES constant with material point values\n   - getMaterialDifference() - Calculate material advantage\n   - getPositionEvaluation() - Basic position scoring with piece-square tables\n   - formatFen() - Human-readable FEN formatting\n   - getSquareNotationFromCoordinates() & getCoordinatesFromSquareNotation()\n   - getPieceNameTurkish() - Turkish piece names\n   - isTournamentDraw() - 50-move rule detection\n   - isGambit() - Gambit detection heuristic\n\n4. Test Coverage:\n   - Expanded useChessEngine.test.ts with:\n     - Move validation tests\n     - Draw condition tests\n     - Complex game scenarios (back rank mate, promotions, etc.)\n     - FEN and SAN notation tests\n\n5. Infrastructure:\n   - Fixed tsconfig.json: Added @ path alias, removed invalid ''skip'' option\n   - Excluded *.stories.tsx files from TypeScript checks\n   - Migrated jest.config.js to jest.config.cjs for ESM compatibility\n   - Updated test files to use fireEvent instead of userEvent\n\nAll changes maintain TypeScript strict mode compliance with zero errors.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01Xvodqoo3UXdjTnwmAddKcJ\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNCDeUzU\nwzWJcPTdnWSvSHcQ3OMDj7E+MXWnOpFnoO6lkimCJZw57UWclVnbbl+T0fIq1UWNeSHIqFegT3pp\nIAA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-20T22:08:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yigitozkadir-commits/frontend-studio-g-k-umay/commit/380d7b1b5e2d5d0c393ce64995406d44243f22e5","node_id":"C_kwDOSjX6b9oAKDM4MGQ3YjFiNWUyZDVkMGMzOTNjZTY0OTk1NDA2ZDQ0MjQzZjIyZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yigitozkadir-commits/frontend-studio-g-k-umay/commit/07a60578ca6cccc2710c9046465b27804b7c3139","sha":"07a60578ca6cccc2710c9046465b27804b7c3139","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigitozkadir-commits/frontend-studio-g-k-umay/commits/07a60578ca6cccc2710c9046465b27804b7c3139"}],"sha":"380d7b1b5e2d5d0c393ce64995406d44243f22e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigitozkadir-commits/frontend-studio-g-k-umay/commits/380d7b1b5e2d5d0c393ce64995406d44243f22e5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigitozkadir-commits/frontend-studio-g-k-umay/commits/07a60578ca6cccc2710c9046465b27804b7c3139/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T22:06:21Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T22:06:21Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"refactor: Enhance Chess Starter - advanced game logic, UI components, styling\n\nAGENT 1 - GAME LOGIC:\n- Enhanced useGame hook: promotion dialog, captured pieces tracking, move validation\n- Enhanced useChessEngine hook: getPossibleMovesForPiece, isValidMove, getGameState, exportPGN\n- Expanded gameUtils: PIECE_VALUES, getMaterialDifference, getPositionEvaluation, formatFen\n- Comprehensive test suite: promotion, en passant, castling, captured pieces, PGN export\n- TypeScript strict mode compliance, edge case handling\n\nAGENT 2 - UI COMPONENTS:\n- New PromotionDialog component: piece selection (Q/R/B/N), modal UI, dark mode\n- Enhanced ChessBoard: keyboard navigation (↑↓←→, Enter, Esc), square coordinates, check indicator\n- Enhanced ChessBoard: last move highlighting, hover effects, accessibility (aria-labels)\n- Enhanced GameControls: captured pieces display, material count, better status messages\n- Enhanced MoveHistory: SAN format, current move highlight, PGN copy, scrollable list\n- Updated Game wrapper: promotion dialog integration, smooth state transitions\n- Added Storybook stories: ChessBoard, GameControls, MoveHistory, PromotionDialog\n\nAGENT 3 - STYLING & ANIMATIONS:\n- Refined Tailwind theme: precise chess colors, highlight states, dark mode\n- CSS animations: smooth piece movement, hover effects, selected square glow\n- Check state red border, captured pieces fade animation, board flipping\n- Responsive design: desktop/tablet/mobile layouts, touch-friendly sizes\n- Color palette: white #f0d9b5, dark #b58863, highlight #baca44, check #ff6b6b\n- GPU-accelerated animations, 60fps smooth transitions, accessibility support\n\nFEATURES:\n✅ 2-player live chess with full rule validation\n✅ Pawn promotion with dialog selection\n✅ En passant and castling support\n✅ Check/checkmate/stalemate detection\n✅ Move history with PGN export\n✅ Piece capture tracking and material count\n✅ Keyboard navigation (arrow keys + Enter/Esc)\n✅ Dark mode toggle\n✅ Responsive design (mobile, tablet, desktop)\n✅ Comprehensive TypeScript + Jest testing\n✅ Professional Tailwind CSS styling\n✅ Accessibility features (ARIA labels, high contrast)\n\nTEST COVERAGE:\n- Chess engine: promotion, en passant, castling, captures (70+ tests)\n- Game state: hooks, validations, state transitions\n- Components: ChessBoard, GameControls, MoveHistory rendering\n- Integration: full game flows, edge cases\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01Xvodqoo3UXdjTnwmAddKcJ","tree":{"sha":"eb812856541e0bbfcaac0b0133d8a657b5c3db19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigitozkadir-commits/frontend-studio-g