:"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T01:34:07Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"message":"fix(R10.4 Lane E): 根治 timeseries_buckets_by_day flaky 边界断言\n\n测试 seed 用 `now - 2d - 1h` / `now - 2d - 2h` 相对偏移，假设两条记录落同一\n日历日。但 docker e2e 在 UTC 00:00–02:00 窗口运行时，这两个时刻跨过午夜落到\n不同 date_trunc(''day'') 桶，产生 3 桶而非预期 2 桶（left:3 right:2）。\n\n生产分桶逻辑（date_trunc(''day'', created_at)）本身无 bug——是测试不鲁棒。\n改为 noon-anchored 确定性时刻：两条「同日」记录锚定到 day-2 的 11:00/13:00，\n第三条到 day-1 的 12:00，无论运行时刻都稳定 2 桶 / 3 请求。\n\ndocker e2e 重跑：admin usage 7/7、subscriptions 7/7 稳定通过。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a4c9f2dea6e04f2acadaaa008927c73a8c18ef5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/2a4c9f2dea6e04f2acadaaa008927c73a8c18ef5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/75d37fbcfb12b7bcc9547e87cc733b2a97086d46","verification":{"payload":"tree 2a4c9f2dea6e04f2acadaaa008927c73a8c18ef5\nparent e09697b9f18b9004adba15f2b238dc3ffa96870e\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1781055247 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1781055247 +0800\n\nfix(R10.4 Lane E): 根治 timeseries_buckets_by_day flaky 边界断言\n\n测试 seed 用 `now - 2d - 1h` / `now - 2d - 2h` 相对偏移，假设两条记录落同一\n日历日。但 docker e2e 在 UTC 00:00–02:00 窗口运行时，这两个时刻跨过午夜落到\n不同 date_trunc(''day'') 桶，产生 3 桶而非预期 2 桶（left:3 right:2）。\n\n生产分桶逻辑（date_trunc(''day'', created_at)）本身无 bug——是测试不鲁棒。\n改为 noon-anchored 确定性时刻：两条「同日」记录锚定到 day-2 的 11:00/13:00，\n第三条到 day-1 的 12:00，无论运行时刻都稳定 2 桶 / 3 请求。\n\ndocker e2e 重跑：admin usage 7/7、subscriptions 7/7 稳定通过。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQTwk6BO0ZpxjxKKVrzY6T2w+wDz/QUCaii/DwAKCRDY6T2w+wDz\n/WjzAPwPO2CoRdSHY93aVqO1x6irJXBsAzUh8sRwMg2Hla1lOQEAwWCVEKy//dte\nBTO+fB2JpkY1fZOLuTwCXqA1DgqGkAw=\n=VxTc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T02:32:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/75d37fbcfb12b7bcc9547e87cc733b2a97086d46","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKDc1ZDM3ZmJjZmIxMmI3YmNjOTU0N2U4N2NjNzMzYjJhOTcwODZkNDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/e09697b9f18b9004adba15f2b238dc3ffa96870e","sha":"e09697b9f18b9004adba15f2b238dc3ffa96870e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/e09697b9f18b9004adba15f2b238dc3ffa96870e"}],"sha":"75d37fbcfb12b7bcc9547e87cc733b2a97086d46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/75d37fbcfb12b7bcc9547e87cc733b2a97086d46"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/e09697b9f18b9004adba15f2b238dc3ffa96870e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T01:15:28Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T01:15:28Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"message":"fix(R10.4 Lane E): 修 tokens.css 注释里 */ 提前闭合导致 CSS minify 警告\n\n`shadow-glass*/ambient (§1.5)` 中的 `*/` 把块注释提前关掉，使\n`ambient (§1.5)` 变成游离 CSS，vite/esbuild minify 报\n`Unexpected \"(\"` [css-syntax-error]。改为 `shadow-glass / shadow-ambient`，\n重建后零警告。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"83ebc9b19bb4353f394fa87cbdc1fbfa0f0a6a57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/83ebc9b19bb4353f394fa87cbdc1fbfa0f0a6a57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/e09697b9f18b9004adba15f2b238dc3ffa96870e","verification":{"payload":"tree 83ebc9b19bb4353f394fa87cbdc1fbfa0f0a6a57\nparent f2a42996d0b547b42d74b6276d509b16d100356c\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1781054128 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1781054128 +0800\n\nfix(R10.4 Lane E): 修 tokens.css 注释里 */ 提前闭合导致 CSS minify 警告\n\n`shadow-glass*/ambient (§1.5)` 中的 `*/` 把块注释提前关掉，使\n`ambient (§1.5)` 变成游离 CSS，vite/esbuild minify 报\n`Unexpected \"(\"` [css-syntax-error]。改为 `shadow-glass / shadow-ambient`，\n重建后零警告。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQTwk6BO0ZpxjxKKVrzY6T2w+wDz/QUCaii6sAAKCRDY6T2w+wDz\n/WQlAQCdUvQo9U6SoP+OpgesvP0VKF7p8+I7EWpKTOU/39xPbwEAqkAHbjKwy/LK\n//pbdALxtv6lhe82Lm4my+v8FqSFQQ8=\n=Mhlk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T02:32:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/e09697b9f18b9004adba15f2b238dc3ffa96870e","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKGUwOTY5N2I5ZjE4YjkwMDRhZGJhMTVmMmIyMzhkYzNmZmE5Njg3MGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/f2a42996d0b547b42d74b6276d509b16d100356c","sha":"f2a42996d0b547b42d74b6276d509b16d100356c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/f2a42996d0b547b42d74b6276d509b16d100356c"}],"sha":"e09697b9f18b9004adba15f2b238dc3ffa96870e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/e09697b9f18b9004adba15f2b238dc3ffa96870e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/f2a42996d0b547b42d74b6276d509b16d100356c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T16:08:03Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T16:08:03Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"message":"fix(R10.4 Lane D): make pre-auth IP rate-limit cap configurable\n\nThe pre-auth limiter (FR-46) hardcoded DEFAULT_PREAUTH_RPM=5 in\nbuild_router, despite the code''s own comments promising an env override\nand a test dial-up — neither was ever wired. reset_password_consumes_\ntoken_and_revokes_refresh issues 6 pre-auth requests from one client IP\n(register → verify → login → forgot → reset → login), so the 6th\ndeterministically got 429 instead of the asserted 401, a latent failure\nonly surfaced now that the full --ignored suite runs as a gate.\n\n- build_router reads SUB2API_PREAUTH_RPM (falls back to the 5-RPM\n  default), matching the existing CORS_EXTRA_ORIGINS env convention.\n- MgmtTestFixture sets the cap to 10000 so e2e flows exercise the\n  limiter layer without throttling legitimate multi-step sequences.\n\nreset 7/7 + 2fa 5/5 green.","tree":{"sha":"8c8f2c73db9a1d2dd7e8f61a854bc6406b333409","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/8c8f2c73db9a1d2dd7e8f61a854bc6406b333409"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/f2a42996d0b547b42d74b6276d509b16d100356c","verification":{"payload":"tree 8c8f2c73db9a1d2dd7e8f61a854bc6406b333409\nparent c2a21e4e8e5c5e82024196a14c61097f24d46d2d\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1781021283 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1781021283 +0800\n\nfix(R10.4 Lane D): make pre-auth IP rate-limit cap configurable\n\nThe pre-auth limiter (FR-46) hardcoded DEFAULT_PREAUTH_RPM=5 in\nbuild_router, despite the code''s own comments promising an env override\nand a test dial-up — neither was ever wired. reset_password_consumes_\ntoken_and_revokes_refresh issues 6 pre-auth requests from one client IP\n(register → verify → login → forgot → reset → login), so the 6th\ndeterministically got 429 instead of the asserted 401, a latent failure\nonly surfaced now that the full --ignored suite runs as a gate.\n\n- build_router reads SUB2API_PREAUTH_RPM (falls back to the 5-RPM\n  default), matching the existing CORS_EXTRA_ORIGINS env convention.\n- MgmtTestFixture sets the cap to 10000 so e2e flows exercise the\n  limiter layer without throttling legitimate multi-step sequences.\n\nreset 7/7 + 2fa 5/5 green.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQTwk6BO0ZpxjxKKVrzY6T2w+wDz/QUCaig6YwAKCRDY6T2w+wDz\n/R7XAP4qdMQ7TBGWnbHTSe9ZnFw6uTj7NeH75GGIEvDLh/FcwwD9HrJddpLF1UW4\nSp2hITgYVvemqB9M0b8L7J4E2Io3mw8=\n=3T0f\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T02:32:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url"