om/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/c2a21e4e8e5c5e82024196a14c61097f24d46d2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T13:32:31Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T13:32:31Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"message":"fix(R10.4 Lane D): repair schema-drift in admin usage/subscriptions inline e2e seeds\n\nPre-existing breakage (since R10.3) in #[cfg(test)] seeds that drifted\nfrom the live schema — only surfaced under --ignored docker runs:\n- usage.rs: accounts.credentials is JSONB (not bytea) -> drop from\n  insert and rely on ''{}'' default; api_keys gained NOT NULL key_hash/\n  key_prefix/last_4 (migration 0015) -> seed all three.\n- subscriptions.rs: groups has no model_mapping/admin_only columns ->\n  seed via (name, platform, subscription_type) like the tests/ suites.\n\nusage 7/7 + subscriptions 8/8 now green.","tree":{"sha":"cfedbc6d81d82638575f41d8aa176c42840de9f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/cfedbc6d81d82638575f41d8aa176c42840de9f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/c2a21e4e8e5c5e82024196a14c61097f24d46d2d","verification":{"payload":"tree cfedbc6d81d82638575f41d8aa176c42840de9f3\nparent 59444ff8a6d533f4c9429437aaa87cf427c6cbf3\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1781011951 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1781011951 +0800\n\nfix(R10.4 Lane D): repair schema-drift in admin usage/subscriptions inline e2e seeds\n\nPre-existing breakage (since R10.3) in #[cfg(test)] seeds that drifted\nfrom the live schema — only surfaced under --ignored docker runs:\n- usage.rs