n  400 no_pending_setup.\n- routing: move /auth/2fa/* from pre-auth tree into JWT-protected\n  subtree (both endpoints require an authenticated principal).\n- login: add hint=two_fa_recommended for admins without 2FA (OQ-2 (c),\n  hint not enforce); skip_serializing_if hides it otherwise.\n- deps: totp-rs 5.7 (otpauth/qr/gen_secret).\n- tests: auth_2fa_e2e.rs (5 cases) all green; existing auth suites\n  (login_jwt/logout/refresh/router = 26) unaffected.\n- docs: INTEGRATION 2FA rows -> R10.4 done; R10.4_PLAN Lane B marked.","tree":{"sha":"a16234c7d7f789f5339b1df2018cb5508179eed2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/a16234c7d7f789f5339b1df2018cb5508179eed2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/59444ff8a6d533f4c9429437aaa87cf427c6cbf3","verification":{"payload":"tree a16234c7d7f789f5339b1df2018cb5508179eed2\nparent cc35316acffe39f601ae6ede2305efa36127135a\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1781005514 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1781005514 +0800\n\nfeat(R10.4 Lane B): admin 2FA (TOTP) setup/verify + login hint\n\n- two_fa_setup: generate 160-bit secret, AES-GCM into\n  users.totp_secret_encrypted, return otpauth:// URI + QR base64.\n  Leaves totp_enabled=false until verify; 403 already_enabled guards\n  re-enrolment (no silent secret rotation).\n- two_fa_verify: decrypt pending secret, check OTP (SHA1/6/30s/skew1),\n  flip totp_enabled + stamp totp_enabled_at. 401 invalid_otp,\n  400 no_pending_setup.\n- routing: move /auth/2fa/* from pre-auth tree into JWT-protected\n  subtree (both endpoints require an authenticated principal).\n- login: add hint=two_fa_recommended for admins without 2FA (OQ-2 (c),\n  hint not enforce); skip_serializing_if hides it otherwise.\n- deps: totp-rs 5.7 (otpauth/qr/gen_secret).\n- tests: auth_2fa_e2e.rs (5 cases) all green; existing auth suites\n  (login_jwt/logout/refresh/router = 26) unaffected.\n- docs: INTEGRATION 2FA rows -> R10.4 done; R10.4_PLAN