rl":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/364d1226639dd7916388fe80a62fd49222aa9ed7","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKDM2NGQxMjI2NjM5ZGQ3OTE2Mzg4ZmU4MGE2MmZkNDkyMjJhYTllZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/403340f81b8425a768c990d862abb5a084dac76b","sha":"403340f81b8425a768c990d862abb5a084dac76b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/403340f81b8425a768c990d862abb5a084dac76b"}],"sha":"364d1226639dd7916388fe80a62fd49222aa9ed7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/364d1226639dd7916388fe80a62fd49222aa9ed7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/403340f81b8425a768c990d862abb5a084dac76b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T11:15:20Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T11:15:20Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"message":"fix(R10.3 #178): gate DataTable row hover/cursor behind `interactive` prop\n\nR10.2.9 (48ae126) 之后表格样式遗留问题定位：UiDataTable 的 body row\n无条件挂 `cursor: pointer` + hover 背景，但全 13 个消费方里只有\n`cf/Zones` 真正监听 `row-click`。结果 sub2api 全部 list view\n（Accounts / Subscriptions / UsageLogs / RedeemCodes / Groups）+ servers\n+ 其余 cf/* 的行都「看起来可点其实点了没反应」，即用户 2026-05-25\n反馈的表格样式问题。\n\n改动：\n\n- DataTable 新增 `interactive` prop（默认 false），仅它驱动\n  pointer cursor + hover 背景（CSS 从 `.ui-data-table__row:hover`\n  收窄到 `.ui-data-table__row--interactive:hover`）\n- `row-click` 仍无条件 emit —— 只有视觉 affordance 是 opt-in，\n  不破坏既有事件契约（DataTable.spec 既有断言不动）\n- cf/Zones 唯一需要整行导航，显式传 `interactive`\n- 新增测试：默认无 interactive class 但仍 emit row-click /\n  传 interactive 后每行带 class（91 → 92）\n- CHANGELOG 加 R10.3 段记录此 behavior change\n\ngates: ui-kit 92 + a11y 19 + main-panel typecheck + build 全绿","tree":{"sha":"79d98005ea6eec09f30b34e5b59a2dc7c3ffb78a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/79d98005ea6eec09f30b34e5b59a2dc7c3ffb78a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/403340f81b8425a768c990d862abb5a084dac76b","verification":{"payload":"tree 79d98005ea6eec09f30b34e5b59a2dc7c3ffb78a\nparent 66d2ba771f86b1a5b10e054e71d98c7fcff3286f\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1780226120 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1780226120 +0800\n\nfix(R10.3 #178): gate DataTable row hover/cursor behind `interactive` prop\n\nR10.2.9 (48ae126) 之后表格样式遗留问题定位：UiDataTable 的 body row\n无条件挂 `cursor: pointer` + hover 背景，但全 13 个消费方里只有\n`cf/Zones` 真正监听 `row-click`。结果 sub2api 全部 list view\n（Accounts / Subscriptions / UsageLogs / RedeemCodes / Groups）+ servers\n+ 其余 cf/* 的行都「看起来可点其实点了没反应」，即用户 2026-05-25\n反馈的表格样式问题。\n\n改动：\n\n- DataTable 新增 `interactive` prop（默认 false），仅它驱动\n  pointer cursor + hover 背景（CSS 从 `.ui-data-table__row:hover`\n  收窄到 `.ui-data-table__row--interactive:hover`）\n- `row-click` 仍无条件 emit —— 只有视觉 affordance 是 opt-in，\n  不破坏既有事件契约（DataTable.spec 既有断言不动）\n- cf/Zones 唯一需