"date":"2026-05-27T07:59:25Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T07:59:25Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"message":"test(R10.3 W2.5 H-10): admin emergency e2e (6 test, 0 production bug)\n\n6 tests / fixture-per-test PG container：\n\n- force_logout_all_clears_refresh_allowlist_and_audits   seed 2 user + refresh\n                                                          row → POST，allowlist\n                                                          drop 到 0 + audit 一条\n- maintenance_mode_upserts_settings_row                  POST {enabled:true,\n                                                          message, ips}\n                                                          → settings.system.maintenance\n                                                          的 JSONB enabled / message /\n                                                          allowed_admin_ips 都对齐\n- maintenance_mode_rejects_bad_ip                        allowed_admin_ips 含\n                                                          ''not-an-ip'' → 400 +\n                                                          message 含 ''invalid IP''\n- emergency_unmount_account_disables_and_audits          status=''disabled'' +\n                                                          schedulable=false +\n                                                          deleted_at != NULL +\n                                                          audit 一条\n- emergency_unmount_account_404_on_missing               不存在 id → 404\n- emergency_revoke_all_keys_by_user_soft_deletes         seed 3 key（key_hash\n                                                          唯一约束，所以\n                                                          per-row md5 random）\n                                                          → revoked_count=3 +\n                                                          live=0 + audit\n\nH-10 像 H-9 一样首跑全过——emergency 端点本身没有 schema 滑过去。\ntest seed 头一次用 ''\\xdeadbeef'' 重复触 idx_api_keys_key_hash UNIQUE，\n改成 decode(md5(random()::text || $2), ''hex'')。\n\n# wave-2.5 收尾跑分\n- 总 e2e: 34（H-1/3 + H-2/3 + H-3/3 + H-4/5 + H-5+H-6/4 + H-7/3 + H-8/4 +\n  H-9/6 + H-10/6 = 37 / 实际 34；个别 H-x lane 内部组合）\n- 抓产线 bug 数: 4\n  · H-6 group_accounts → account_groups（commit 35173c5，wave-2 之前）\n  · H-6 last_failure_at / cooldown_until 列名错位（wave-2.5 第一发）\n  · H-7 status=''cancelled'' 不在 CHECK 允许集合（migration 0020）\n  · H-8 plaintext secret 渗 admin_audit_logs.after_state（display_value 修补）\n- ROI：W2.5 一发挖出三个 H-x lane 的 schema/redaction blind spot，全是\n  ''sqlx::query() runtime check + ignored e2e 共谋漂过'' 同一种模式\n\n闸门：\n  cargo test --test admin_emergency_e2e -- --ignored: 6 pass\n  cargo test --lib: 218 pass / 64 ignored，无 regression","tree":{"sha":"09b2a97e5bd26e9297a46d03c8a1024269abddeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/09b2a97e5bd26e9297a46d03c8a1024269abddeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/6d663b8babf7efb295d6d77bf3505c98cb49f20b","verification":{"payload":"tree 09b2a97e5bd26e9297a46d03c8a1024269abddeb\nparent cac1d52c6f79c1dbd7cf60d3171f01a61364482b\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779868765 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779868765 +0800\n\ntest(R10.3 W2.5 H-10): admin emergency e2e (6 test, 0 production bug)\n\n6 tests / fixture-per-test PG container：\n\n- force_logout_all_clears_refresh_allowlist_and_audits   seed 2 user + refresh\n                                                          row → POST，allowlist\n                                                          drop 到 0 + audit 一条\n- maintenance_mode_upserts_settings_row                  POST {enabled:true,\n                                                          message, ips}\n                                                          → settings.system.maintenance\n                                                          的 JSONB enabled / message /\n                                                          allowed_admin_ips 都对齐\n- maintenance_mode_rejects_bad_ip                        allowed_admin_ips 含\n                                                          ''not-an-ip'' → 400 +\n                                                          message 含 ''invalid IP''\n- emergency_unmount_account_disables_and_audits          status=''disabled'' +\n                                                          schedulable=false +\n                                                          deleted_at != NULL +\n                                                          audit 一条\n- emergency_unmount_account_404_on_missing               不存在 id → 404\n- emergency_revoke_all_keys_by_user_soft_deletes         seed 3 key（key_hash\n                                                          唯一约束，所以\n                                                          per-row md5 random）\n                                                          → revoked_count=3 +\n                                                          live=0 + audit\n\nH-10 像 H-9 一样首跑全过——emergency 端点本身没有 schema 滑过去。\ntest seed 头一次用 ''\\xdeadbeef'' 重复触 idx_api_keys_key_hash UNIQUE，\n改成 decode(md5(random()::text || $2), ''hex'')。\n\n# wave-2.5 收尾跑分\n- 总 e2e: 34（H-1/3 + H-2/3 + H-3/3 + H-4/5 + H-5+H-6/4 + H-7/3 + H-8/4 +\n  H-9/6 + H-10/6 = 37 / 实际 34；个别 H-x lane 内部组合）\n- 抓产线 bug 数: 4\n  · H-6 group_accounts → account_groups（commit 35173c5，wave-2 之前）\n  · H-6 last_failure_at / cooldown_until 列名错位（wave-2.5 第一发）\n  · H-7 status=''cancelled'' 不在 CHECK 允许集合（migration 0020）\n  · H-8 plaintext secret 渗 admin_audit_logs.after_state（display_value 修补）\n- ROI：W2.5 一发挖出三个 H-x lane 的 schema/redaction blind spot，全是\n  ''sqlx::query() runtime check + ignored e2e 共谋漂过'' 同一种模式\n\n闸门：\n  cargo test --test admin_emergency_e2e -- --ignored: 6 pass\n  cargo test --lib: 218 pass / 64 ignored，无 regression\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQS347Yge2mOrQHQJpA