chema invariant，\n                                              将来 migration 误删 CHECK 会有\n                                              这条 e2e 兜底\n- list_audit_logs_400_on_window_oversize      from=not-a-date → 400\n\nH-9 read 端点本身首跑全过，没挖出新 bug——和 H-1/H-3/H-5 read-only 段\n表现一致。这正是 wave-2.5 的设计：read 段确认 SQL/schema 在 docker 上跑得通，\nwrite 端点抓行为 + 跨切关注（H-7 status / H-8 secret 渗透）。\n\n闸门：cargo test --test admin_audit_logs_e2e -- --ignored: 6 pass。\n\n# wave-2.5 跑分（追加）\n- 总 e2e: 28（H-1/3 + H-2/3 + H-3/3 + H-4/5 + H-5+H-6/4 + H-7/3 + H-8/4 +\n  H-9/6 = 28）\n- 抓产线 bug 数: 4\n  · H-6 group_accounts → account_groups\n  · H-6 last_failure_at / cooldown_until 列名错位\n  · H-7 status=''cancelled'' 不在 CHECK 允许集合\n  · H-8 plaintext secret 渗 admin_audit_logs.after_state","tree":{"sha":"87f2109d1c53a125ecb182341235fb2cd068bd76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/87f2109d1c53a125ecb182341235fb2cd068bd76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/cac1d52c6f79c1dbd7cf60d3171f01a61364482b","verification":{"payload":"tree 87f2109d1c53a125ecb182341235fb2cd068bd76\nparent f97be851e1a6dca3903482d1644873d73a02c70b\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779868584 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779868584 +0800\n\ntest(R10.3 W2.5 H-9): admin audit-logs e2e (6 test, 0 production bug)\n\n6 tests / fixture-per-test PG container：\n\n- list_audit_logs_paginates_and_filters       seed 3 rows，list 200 + total≥3，\n                                              ?target_kind=subscription 过滤到 1\n- get_audit_log_by_id_returns_full_envelope   GET .../:id 200 + 字段对齐\n- get_audit_log_404_on_unknown_id             不存在 id → 404\n- export_audit_logs_csv_contains_seeded_rows  CSV 导出：content-type=text/csv +\n                                              content-disposition attachment +\n                                              body 含 seeded action 字符串\n- admin_audit_logs_table_rejects_short_reason 0016 CHECK length(reason)>=5\n                                              直接 INSERT ''oops'' 必须 fail——\n                                              这条不是 handler 行为，是\n                                              audit 表的 schema invariant，\n                                              将来 migration 误删 CHECK 会有\n                                              这条 e2e 兜底\n- list_audit_logs_400_on_window_oversize      from=not-a-date → 400\n\nH-9 read 端点本身首跑全过，没挖出新 bug——和 H-1/H-3/H-5 read-only 段\n表现一致。这正是 wave-2.5 的设计：read 段确认 SQL/schema 在 docker 上跑得通，\nwrite 端点抓行为 + 跨切关注（H-7 status / H-8 secret 渗透）。\n\n闸门：cargo test --test admin_audit_logs_e2e -- --ignored: 6 pass。\n\n# wave-2.5 跑分（追加）\n- 总 e2e: 28（H-1/3 + H-2/3 + H-3/3 + H-4/5 + H-5+H-6/4 + H-7/3 + H-8/4 +\n  H-9/6 = 28）\n- 抓产线 bug 数: 4\n  · H-6 group_accounts → account_groups\n  · H-6 last_failure_at / cooldown_until 列名错位\n  · H-7 status=''cancelled'' 不在 CHECK 允许集合\n  · H-8 plaintext secret 渗 admin_audit_logs.after_state\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQS347Yge2mOrQHQJpAfJYZ9Ahsw8AUCahajqAAKCRAfJYZ9Ahsw\n8AGYAQCsOQlWMiMsKlv+QORR1OGVufbiHsYFJwYlatftmXKNhgD/ftq3/kuUdTfs\nHIdc9bNx5yQhaD4uUFkNUyvKKMU5CQI=\n=fC9Q\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-30T17:33:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/cac1d52c6f79c1dbd7cf60d3171f01a61364482b","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKGNhYzFkNTJjNmY3OWMxZGJkN2NmNjBkMzE3MWYwMWE2MTM2NDQ4MmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/f97be851e1a6dca3903482d1644873d73a02c70b","sha":"f97be851e1a6dca3903482d1644873d73a02c70b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/f97be851e1a6dca3903482d1644873d73a02c70b"}],"sha":"cac1d52c6f79c1dbd7cf60d3171f01a61364482b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/cac1d52c6f79c1dbd7cf60d3171f01a61364482b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/f97be851e1a6dca3903482d1644873d73a02c70b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T07:53:31Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T07:53:31Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"message":"test+fix(R10.3 W2.5 H-8): admin settings e2e + 第四处 hotfix（audit secret-leak）\n\n# E2E suite (admin_settings_e2e)\n\n4 tests / fixture-per-test PG container：\n\n- update_setting_non_secret_upserts_and_audits           PATCH /settings/:key\n                                                          → row + audit\n- update_setting_secret_key_redacts_response_and_audit   secret key\n                                                          → response value=null\n                                                          AND audit after_state\n                                                          不能含 plaintext\n                                                          AND settings 表\n                                                          仍存原文（脱敏是\n                                                          展示/审计层，不是\n                                                          存储层）\n- rotate_jwt_returns_501_with_deferred_marker            501 sentinel +\n                                                          details.deferred_to=R10.4\n- test_smtp_sends_via_mock_provider                      mock email snapshot\n                                                          有 to=canary 这条\n\n# 第四处 hotfix（audit 渗 plaintext）\n\nH-8 update_setting 把 audit envelope 写成\n  { \"key\": \"auth.jwt_secret\", \"value\": \"<plaintext>\", \"updated_at\": ts }\n然后 redact_secrets(after_state) 包外面。\n\n但 redact_secrets 是按 *JSON object key 名* 找黑名单 needle，外层 key 是字面量\n''value''/''key''/''updated_at''——一个都不在 SECRET_KEY_NEEDLES 里。结果 plaintext\n原样写进 admin_audit_logs.after_state JSONB。\n\nH-8 lane 自己有个 is_secret_key + display_value，但只用在 *response* 上；\naudit envelope 直接 v.clone() 没过 display_value——blind spot 在 lane 内部。\n\n修法：把 before_state / after_state 构造里的 value 字段换成 display_value(key, &v)\n——secret 时返 JsonValue::Null。settings 表本身不动（仍存原文，下次 PATCH 才能\ndiff）。lib unit test display_value_redacts_secrets_to_null 已经覆盖工具函数；\ne2e 这次抓的是 lane 没把工具用全的盲区。\n\n# wave-2.5 累计 hotfix\n- 35173c5  H-6 group_accounts → account_groups\n- 269812c  H-6 last_failure_at / cooldown_until 列名错位\n- 上次     H-7 status=''cancelled'' 不在 CHECK 允许集合（migration 0020）\n- 本次     H-8 secret 渗 admin_audit_logs.after_state（display_value 修补）\n\n闸门：\n  cargo test --test admin_settings_e2e -- --ignored: 4 pass\n  cargo test --lib admin::settings: 5 pass，无 regression","tree":{"sha":"df931dd7777d737165d80ebe7771ec47a617a722","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/df931dd7777d737165d80ebe7771ec47a617a722"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/f97be851e1a6dca3903482d1644873d73a02c70b","verification":{"payload":"tree df931dd7777d737165d80ebe7771ec47a617a722\nparent 96babaf9e0a222ace85598df4c44679613300d83\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779868411 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779868411 +0800\n\ntest+fix(R10.3 W2.5 H-8): admin settings e2e + 第四处 hotfix（audit secret-leak）\n\n# E2E suite (admin_settings_e2e)\n\n4 tests / fixture-per-test PG container：\n\n- update_setting_non_secret_upserts_and_audits           PATCH /settings/:key\n                                                          → row + audit\n- update_setting_secret_key_redacts_response_and_audit   secret key\n                                                          → response value=null\n                                                          AND audit after_state\n                                                          不能含 plaintext\n                                                          AND settings 表\n                                                          仍存原文（脱敏是\n                                                          展示/审计层，不是\n                                                          存储层）\n- rotate_jwt_returns_501_with_deferred_marker            501 sentinel +\n                                                          details.deferred_to=R10.4\n- test_smtp_sends_via_mock_provider                      mock email snapshot\n                                                          有 to=canary 这条\n\n# 第四处 hotfix（audit 渗 plaintext）\n\nH-8 update_setting 把 audit envelope 写成\n  { \"key\": \"auth.jwt_secret\", \"value\": \"<plaintext>\", \"updated_at\": ts }\n然后 redact_secrets(after_state) 包外面。\n\n但 redact_secrets 是按 *JSON object key 名* 找黑名单 needle，外层 key 是字面量\n''value''/''key''/''updated_at''——一个都不在 SECRET_KEY_NEEDLES 里。结果 plaintext\n原样写进 admin_audit_logs.after_state JSONB。\n\nH-8 lane 自己有个 is_secret_key + display_value，但只用在 *response* 上；\naudit envelope 直接 v.clone() 没过 display_value——blind spot 在 lane 内部。\n\n修法：把 before_state / after_state 构造里的 value 字段换成 display_value(key, &v)\n——secret 时返 JsonValue::Null。settings 表本身不动（仍存原文，下次 PATCH 才能\ndiff）。lib unit test display_value_redacts_secrets_to_null 已经覆盖工具函数；\ne2e 这次抓的是 lane 没把工具用全的盲区。\n\n# wave-2.5 累计 hotfix\n- 35173c5  H-6 group_accounts → account_groups\n- 269812c  H-6 last_failure_at / cooldown_until 列名错位\n- 上次     H-7 status=''cancelled'' 不在 CHECK 允许集合（migration 0020）\n- 本次     H-8 secret 渗 admin_audit_logs.after_state（display_value 修补）\n\n闸门：\n  cargo test --test admin_settings_e2e -- --ignored: 4 pass\n  cargo test --lib admin::settings: 5 pass，无 regression\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQS347Yge2mOrQHQJpAfJYZ9Ahsw8AUCahai+wAKCRAfJYZ9Ahsw\n8G97AQD57sEG//c85S9cgNmenP48oOEiH6GhO9RyU7BDrhRgbQEA6gJ4NnVIhj+6\ntbFesSmNps1ebs3jGs4FWsUhqZ1Clwk=\n=i2V4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-30T17:33:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelN