/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/96babaf9e0a222ace85598df4c44679613300d83/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T07:50:06Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T07:50:06Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"message":"test+fix(R10.3 W2.5 H-7): admin subscriptions e2e + 第三处 schema hotfix (cancelled status)\n\n# E2E suite (admin_subscriptions_e2e)\n\n3 tests / fixture-per-test PG container：\n\n- force_cancel_subscription_soft_cancels_and_audits      POST .../force-cancel\n                                                          → status=''cancelled'' +\n                                                          deleted_at NOW() + audit\n- force_cancel_subscription_double_returns_409           真实 double 是 404\n                                                          (deleted_at IS NULL guard\n                                                          先命中)；409 路径要手工\n                                                          捏一行 status=cancelled\n                                                          AND deleted_at IS NULL\n                                                          才能跑到，三步都验证\n- update_subscription_patches_row_and_audits             PATCH expires_at + notes\n                                                          → DB 行落 + audit 一条\n\n# 第三处 schema hotfix (migration 0020)\n\nH-7 force_cancel handler 写 status=''cancelled''，但 0007 的 CHECK 只允许\n{active, exhausted, expired, paused}。runtime sqlx::query() + ignored e2e\n共谋漂过——和 H-6 的 last_failure_at / cooldown_until 同病。\n\n修法：新加 0020_user_subscriptions_status_cancelled.sql，DROP 老 CHECK +\nADD 新 CHECK 把 ''cancelled'' 加进允许集合。idempotent，没有数据迁移。\n\n# 跑完后 wave-2.5 累计 hotfix\n- 35173c5  H-6 group_accounts → account_groups (table name)\n- 269812c  H-6 last_failure_at / cooldown_until 列名错位 (W2.5)\n- 本次     H-7 status=''cancelled'' 不在 CHECK 允许集合 (W2.5 follow-up)\n\n闸门：cargo test --test admin_subscriptions_e2e -- --ignored 3 pass。","tree":{"sha":"f7fdef63c8c7f7a4eb6eaf3343c4e0c1f6b8dc01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/f7fdef63c8c7f7a4eb6eaf3343c4e0c1f6b8dc01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/96babaf9e0a222ace85598df4c44679613300d83","verification":{"payload":"tree f7fdef63c8c7f7a4eb6eaf3343c4e0c1f6b8dc01\nparent 269812c9f63a7f4f09402185cbab3f7ab0beab52\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779868206 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779868206 +0800\n\ntest+fix(R10.3 W2.5 H-7): admin subscriptions e2e + 第三处 schema hotfix (cancelled status)\n\n# E2E suite (admin_subscriptions_e2e)\n\n3 tests / fixture-per-test PG container：\n\n- force_cancel_subscription_soft_cancels_and_audits      POST .../force-cancel\n                                                          → status=''cancelled'' +\n                                                          deleted_at NOW() + audit\n- force_cancel_subscription_double_returns_409           真实 double 是 404\n                                                          (deleted_at IS NULL guard\n                                                          先命中)；409 路径要手工\n                                                          捏一行 status=cancelled\n                                                          AND deleted_at IS NULL\n                                                          才能跑到，三步都验证\n- update_subscription_patches_row_and_audits             PATCH expires_at + notes\n                                                          → DB 行落 + audit 一条\n\n# 第三处 schema hotfix (migration 0020)\n\nH-7 force_cancel handler 写 status=''cancelled''，但 0007 的 CHECK 只允许\n{active, exhausted, expired, paused}。runtime sqlx::query() + ignored e2e\n共谋漂过——和 H-6 的 last_failure_at / cooldown_until 同病。\n\n修法：新加 0020_user_subscriptions_status_cancelled.sql，DROP 老 CHECK +\nADD 新 CHECK 把 ''cancelled'' 加进允许集合。idempotent，没有数据迁移。\n\n# 跑完后 wave-2.5 累计 hotfix\n- 35173c5  H-6 group_accounts → account_groups (table name)\n- 269812c  H-6 last_failure_at / cooldown_until 列名错位 (W2.5)\n- 本次     H-7 status=''cancelled'' 不在 CHECK 允许集合 (W2.5 follow-up)\n\n闸门：cargo test --test admin_subscriptions_e2e -- --ignored 3 pass。\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQS347Yge2mOrQHQJpAfJYZ9Ahsw8AUCahaiLgAKCRAfJYZ9Ahsw\n8Dz+AQD9zl1ius7H9sl0achqn9vs/VdQsG1/tJZycMZWZUla2wEA6dFvCk1gfc+u\ngcM6dnR5okMKbgHrDlnf5bObaFzdsQg=\n=mSNM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-30T17:33:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/96babaf9e0a222ace85598df4c44679613300d83","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKDk2YmFiYWY5ZTBhMjIyYWNlODU1OThkZjRjNDQ2Nzk2MTMzMDBkODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/269812c9f63a7f4f09402185cbab3f7ab0beab52","sha":"269812c9f63a7f4f09402185cbab3f7ab0beab52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/269812c9f63a7f4f09402185cbab3f7ab0beab52"}],"sha":"96babaf9e0a222ace85598df4c44679613300d83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/96babaf9e0a222ace85598df4c44679613300d83"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/269812c9f63a7f4f09402185cbab3f7ab0beab52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T07:11:55Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T07:11:55Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"message":"test+fix(R10.3 W2.5 H-5/H-6): usage + health e2e + 第二处 H-6 schema hotfix\n\n# E2E suite (admin_usage_health_e2e)\n\n4 tests / fixture-per-test PG container：\n\n- usage_summary_returns_zeros_on_empty_db                 GET /usage/summary\n                                                          → 200 + total_requests=0\n- usage_summary_aggregates_seeded_usage_logs              seed users + accounts +\n                                                          api_keys + 3 usage_logs\n                                                          → total_requests=3\n- health_scheduler_succeeds_on_empty_db                   GET /health/scheduler 200\n- health_accounts_succeeds_with_seeded_account_groups     seed accounts + groups\n                                                          + account_groups bind →\n                                                          GET /health/accounts 200\n\n# H-6 hotfix（第二轮）\n\nH-6 lane（commit 7149071）写 /admin/health/accounts handler 引用了两个\n不存在的列 a.last_failure_at 和 a.cooldown_until。第一轮 hotfix（commit\n35173c5）改了 group_accounts→account_groups，但没动列引用，因为没人跑过\ndocker e2e 闸门。\n\nW2.5 e2e 一上 docker 立刻爆 \"column a.last_failure_at does not exist\"。\n按 0004_accounts.sql schema：\n- last_failure_at  → rate_limited_at      （账号最近一次被限速的时刻，最近的失败投影）\n- cooldown_until   → rate_limit_reset_at  （限速冷却到期，对应''cooldown until''）\n\nhandler SQL 用 AS 别名保留 response 字段名，前端契约不变。\n\n# Wave-2.5 ROI 复述\nW2.5 全套（H-1/H-2/H-3/H-4/H-5+H-6 共 18 e2e）至此已挖出两个 H-6 schema\nbug（35173c5 + 本次）；都是 sqlx::query() 运行时校验 + ignored e2e 共谋\n漂过的——精确印证了 wave-2.5 设立的初衷（FR-89 spec 风险）。\n\n闸门：\n  cargo test --test admin_usage_health_e2e -- --ignored: 4 pass\n  cargo test --lib: 218 pass / 64 ignored，无 regression","tree":{"sha":"35c8e2c3b7d1d148b4c5ead201d2fc38f18370e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/35c8e2c3b7d1d148b4c5ead201d2fc38f18370e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/269812c9f63a7f4f09402185cbab3f7ab0beab52","verification":{"payload":"tree 35c8e2c3b7d1d148b4c5ead201d2fc38f18370e6\nparent b24556b67c41e3f878a8767b3f44d20483043015\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779865915 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779865915 +0800\n\ntest+fix(R10.3 W2.5 H-5/H-6): usage + health e2e + 第二处 H-6 schema hotfix\n\n# E2E suite (admin_usage_health_e2e)\n\n4 tests / fixture-per-test PG container：\n\n- usage_summary_returns_zeros_on_empty_db                 GET /usage/summary\n                                                          → 200 + total_requests=0\n- usage_summary_aggregates_seeded_usage_logs              seed users + accounts +\n                                                          api_keys + 3 usage_logs\n                                                          → total_requests=3\n- health_scheduler_succeeds_on_empty_db                   GET /health/scheduler 200\n- health_accounts_succeeds_with_seeded_account_groups     seed accounts + groups\n                                                          + account_groups bind →\n                                                          GET /health/accounts 200\n\n# H-6 hotfix（第二轮）\n\nH-6 lane（commit 7149071）写 /admin/health/accounts handler 引用了两个\n不存在的列 a.last_failure_at 和 a.cooldown_until。第一轮 hotfix（commit\n35173c5）改了 group_accounts→account_groups，但没动列引用，因为没人跑过\ndocker e2e 闸门。\n\nW2.5 e2e 一上 docker 立刻爆 \"column a.last_failure_at does not exist\"。\n按 0004_accounts.sql schema：\n- last_failure_at  → rate_limited_at      （账号最近一次被限速的时刻，最近的失败投影）\n- cooldown_until   → rate_limit_reset_at  （限速冷却到期，对应''cooldown until''）\n\nhandler SQL 用 AS 别名保留 response 字段名，前端契约不变。\n\n# Wave-2.5 ROI 复述\nW2.5 全套（H-1/H-2/H-3/H-4/H-5+H-6 共 18 e2e）至此已挖出两个 H-6 schema\nbug（35173c5 + 本次）；都是 sqlx::query() 运行时校验 + ignored e2e 共谋\n漂过的——精确印证了 wave-2.5 设立的初衷（FR-89 spec 风险）。\n\n闸门：\n  cargo test --test admin_usage_health_e2e -- --ignored: 4 pass\n  cargo test --lib: 218 pass / 64 ignored，无 regression\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQS347Yge2mOrQHQJpAfJYZ9Ahsw8AUCahaZOwAKCRAfJYZ9Ahsw\n8KP8AP9mJPdOtQNfqeGTmX/icFLIf6VdktksqryNV6B9h0KW7gEAyg9CYhuZnE1O\ncBKLjNGre6cePRwxfV2+7UpCqu97yA0=\n=dyHg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-30T17:33:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://ap