iner：\n\n- create_account_persists_row_and_audits\n    POST /admin/accounts platform=anthropic type=api_key + ACCOUNT_CREDENTIAL_KEY\n    env (b64 32 bytes，参 accounts unit test 1400 行同手法)，DB 行 active +\n    priority=60，audit 一行 ''create_account''\n- delete_account_soft_deletes_and_audits\n    DELETE → accounts.deleted_at NOW()，audit 一行 ''delete_account''\n- toggle_schedulable_flips_flag_and_audits\n    POST /toggle-schedulable {schedulable:false} → DB schedulable=false +\n    audit 一行 ''toggle_account_schedulable''\n\n修了两处假设：\n1) create_account 返回 200 + Json，不是 201 — handler 没显式写\n   StatusCode::CREATED，纯 Json 响应 axum 默认 200。这是 minor 次优但不\n   regression，测试配合现状写 200。\n2) delete_account 只 SET deleted_at = NOW()，不动 status 列。原计划写\n   status=''disabled'' 是想当然，按真实行为只断 deleted_at IS NOT NULL。\n\n闸门：cargo test --test admin_accounts_e2e -- --ignored 3 pass。\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQS347Yge2mOrQHQJpAfJYZ9Ahsw8AUCahaVrAAKCRAfJYZ9Ahsw\n8HdDAQCSvc91VLKo8b7nSvKa5vjl5Yd7x1h6fp3FntlMnFxkAwEAnHMQlrPfpJ0j\nFCefS6X2ZXvRn84C+vXEAhnBtqtrDAI=\n=o+fA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-30T17:33:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https: