ance-adjust e2e\n\n3 tests / fixture-per-test PG container：\n\n- credits_user_and_writes_audit  → 走 BalanceMutator 真改 users.balance；\n                                    topups 落 paid 行；admin_audit_logs\n                                    落 adjust_user_balance 行\n- negative_below_zero_returns_400 → 422 不存在（项目所有 validation\n                                    走 400 \"validation_failed\"），\n                                    回滚后 topups 0 行\n- soft_deleted_user_returns_404   → SELECT users WHERE deleted_at IS NULL\n                                    前置守门\n\nseed_admin helper（tests/common/mod.rs +30 LOC）：直接 INSERT users role=admin\n+ JwtSigner::sign_access(uid, \"admin\")，跳 /auth/login 与 auth_identities，\n和 auth_refresh_e2e:169 直 mint refresh token 同一手法。admin handler\nSELECT users WHERE id 没 join auth_identities。\n\n闸门：cargo test -p sub2api-rs --test admin_users_e2e -- --ignored 3 pass。\n默认 cargo test (无 docker) 218 lib pass / 65 ignored 不变。\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQS347Yge2mOrQHQJpAfJYZ9Ahsw8AUCahaTGwAKCRAfJYZ9Ahsw\n8A40AQDNZ86X8Tcvgpdn3uz2WTzlo2l3T6oPk6NENJXCbkezPQD9E1KFydT8CI7K\n3trccLbHoDIJoFk1rdK3cyySSdxcQQM=\n=vgiX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-30T17:33:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/7cd12e8b924ede98d4659f91b7e750de8f233ec8","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKDdjZDEyZThiOTI0ZWRlOThkNDY1OWY5MWI3ZTc1MGRlOGYyMzNlYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/70de37d20ef2d45313d52e5ff7767d6689d6f341","sha":"70de37d20ef2d45313d52e5ff7767d6689d6f341","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/70de37d20ef2d45313d52e5ff7767d6689d6f341"}],"sha":"7cd12e8b924ede98d4659f91b7e750de8f233ec8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/7cd12e8b924ede98d4659f91b7e750de8f233ec8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/70de37d20ef2d45313d52e5ff7767d6689d6f341/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T06:32:35Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T06:32:35Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"message":"feat(R10.3 H-4): 兑换码 + 充值审计 + 退款审批 9 endpoint 落地\n\nFR-93（\"卡密兑换 / 银行转账审核 / 退款审批\"）admin 端实装。9 个 endpoint：\n\n- POST   /admin/redeem-codes/batch              → 1..=500 codes 一批生成\n                                                   (UNIQUE 23505 → 单条重生\n                                                   ≤5 次)\n- GET    /admin/redeem-codes                    → paginate + filter (status,\n                                                   type, group_id)\n- DELETE /admin/redeem-codes/:id                → 仅 status=''unused'' 可删\n- GET    /admin/topups                          → ?status=pending 默认（hot\n                                                   path 走 0017 部分 index）\n- POST   /admin/topups/:id/mark-paid            → 走 BalanceMutator\n                                                   apply_topup 把 pending →\n                                                   paid，同事务 +balance\n- POST   /admin/topups/:id/mark-failed          → pending → failed\n- GET    /admin/refund-requests                 → ?status=pending 默认\n- POST   /admin/refund-requests/:id/approve     → BalanceMutator apply_topup\n                                                   amount=-actual_refund_usd\n                                                   channel=''refund''，同事务\n                                                   refund_requests.status =\n                                                   approved/partially_approved\n- POST   /admin/refund-requests/:id/reject\n\nDB-first invariant：\n- topups.status / refund_requests.status CHECK 强制状态机；mark-paid /\n  approve 在 SELECT FOR UPDATE 下重读 status=''pending''，双审批 → 409\n  topup_already_decided / refund_already_decided 而非双扣余额。\n- redeem_codes.code UNIQUE → batch generate 不预查直接 INSERT，遇 23505 重生。\n- BalanceMutator::apply_topup 内置负余额防护（FOR UPDATE + post-update\n  sanity）：refund 超额 → BalanceError::InsufficientBalance → admin 收到\n  400 insufficient_balance，详情含 current/delta/would_be。\n\n写路径全部一笔 sqlx tx + AuditWriter::record，reason ≥ 5 chars 校验在\nhandler 先挡，DB CHECK 兜底。\n\n清理：H-4 是最后一个 stub lane，admin/mod.rs 的 placeholders 模块整段\n删除（empty_list / stub_write 已无 caller），module 顶注同步去掉 wave-1\n说明。\n\n闸门：cargo build / clippy --all-targets -D warnings / fmt / cargo test\n-p sub2api-rs --lib：218 pass / 64 ignored / 0 fail（+5 单测：reason 校验、\ncode 生成 shape / 发散）。e2e admin/redeem_topup_test.rs 留 wave-2.5（须\ndocker pg）。","tree":{"sha":"e3d1949e27d71680d081e38c2dd1ea46668d294b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/e3d1949e27d71680d081e38c2dd1ea46668d294b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/70de37d20ef2d45313d52e5ff7767d6689d6f341","verification":{"payload":"tree e3d1949e27d71680d081e38c2dd1ea46668d294b\nparent 0e412443d9b9720b448a79474df4737235e895e8\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779863555 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779863555 +0800\n\nfeat(R10.3 H-4): 兑换码 + 充值审计 + 退款审批 9 endpoint 落地\n\nFR-93（\"卡密兑换 / 银行转账审核 / 退款审批\"）admin 端实装。9 个 endpoint：\n\n- POST   /admin/redeem-codes/batch              → 1..=500 codes 一批生成\n                                                   (UNIQUE 23505 → 单条重生\n                                                   ≤5 次)\n- GET    /admin/redeem-codes                    → paginate + filter (status,\n                                                   type, group_id)\n- DELETE /admin/redeem-codes/:id                → 仅 status=''unused'' 可删\n- GET    /admin/topups                          → ?status=pending 默认（hot\n                                                   path 走 0017 部分 index）\n- POST   /admin/topups/:id/mark-paid            → 走 BalanceMutator\n                                                   apply_topup 把 pending →\n                                                   paid，同事务 +balance\n- POST   /admin/topups/:id/mark-failed          → pending → failed\n- GET    /admin/refund-requests                 → ?status=pending 默认\n- POST   /admin/refund-requests/:id/approve     → BalanceMutator apply_topup\n                                                   amount=-actual_refund_usd\n                                                   channel=''refund''，同事务\n                                                   refund_requests.status =\n                                                   approved/partially_approved\n- POST   /admin/refund-requests/:id/reject\n\nDB-first invariant：\n- topups.status / refund_requests.status CHECK 强制状态机；mark-paid /\n  approve 在 SELECT FOR UPDATE 下重读 status=''pending''，双审批 → 409\n  topup_already_decided / refund_already_decided 而非双扣余额。\n- redeem_codes.code UNIQUE → batch generate 不预查直接 INSERT，遇 23505 重生。\n- BalanceMutator::apply_topup 内置负余额防护（FOR UPDATE + post-update\n  sanity）：refund 超额 → BalanceError::InsufficientBalance → admin 收到\n  400 insufficient_balance，详情含 current/delta/would_be。\n\n写路径全部一笔 sqlx tx + AuditWriter::record，reason ≥ 5 chars 校验在\nhandler 先挡，DB CHECK 兜底。\n\n清理：H-4 是最后一个 stub lane，admin/mod.rs 的 placeholders 模块整段\n删除（empty_list / stub_write 已无 caller），module 顶注同步去掉 wave-1\n说明。\n\n闸门：cargo build / clippy --all-targets -D warnings / fmt / cargo test\n-p sub2api-rs --lib：218 pass / 64 ignored / 0 fail（+5 单测：reason 校验、\ncode 生成 shape / 发散）。e2e admin/redeem_topup_test.rs 留 wave-2.5（须\ndocker pg）。\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQS347Yge2mOrQHQJpAfJYZ9Ahsw8AUCahaQBAAKCRAfJYZ9Ahsw\n8DP5AQDEpLLzLs9EVr9B+P00BmDLFV6phBy5hKZeYoeLFi4+7wEA7kO0HxpqVPQc\nWwfUYFJTCiBmPhAAiK+DZz1QUcOA8AQ=\n=s8NP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-30T17:33:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/oth