hub.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/35173c5fe2276cb3df3a74d6d434716a76eed852","verification":{"payload":"tree 6a2c0eb3dd54db02d6a39218d4ae8aee768e1e2e\nparent 7149071bfe2b186488a590ac057acad9eb3185d1\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779859867 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779859867 +0800\n\nfix(R10.3 H-6): /admin/health/accounts table name group_accounts→account_groups\n\nH-6 lane 提交 7149071 把 `account_groups` 写成了 `group_accounts`\n（后者不存在）。\nbuild 之所以漂过：sqlx::query() 是运行时校验，不是 sqlx::query!()，\n而 5 个 e2e 测试都 #[ignore=\"needs docker\"]，没有 PG 连接命中那条 SQL。\n\n修法：handler 里那行 FROM 改回 `account_groups`（migration\n0006_account_groups.sql 表名）。\n\n闸门：cargo build -p sub2api-rs：clean。\ne2e 跑 docker 时能跑通——这个 bug 留到 R11 会卡死 dashboard 的\n\"per-account 健康\" 卡片。\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQS347Yge2mOrQHQJpAfJYZ9Ahsw8AUCahaBmwAKCRAfJYZ9Ahsw\n8L9OAPsFDVe9HN6SnG52djs8QDDSjMmvR17UKhwOdA8Yz+nlPwD7BV8yyh0xbUdq\n+hDnfR17ivCk8NfhqPFLS/i1KK4wogk=\n=AS8V\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-30T17:33:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"h