板 5 read endpoint 落地\n\nH-6 lane 5 sub-task 完工（FR-95，全 read，无 audit，OQ-5 (a) 30s polling）：\n\n- W2.H6.1 GET /admin/health/scheduler   get_scheduler_health\n            从 accounts 表派生池组成（active/disabled/cooling_down\n            + by_platform）；scheduler crate 没有 live runtime metrics\n            export（R11 工作），polling-driven 场景 \"现在选会怎样\"\n            和 \"实时队列\" 同义；\n            status=''down'' if active=0 & total>0；\n            status=''degraded'' if active < total*0.5；ok otherwise\n- W2.H6.2 GET /admin/health/accounts    get_accounts_health\n            per-account snapshot：id / name / platform / status /\n            last_failure_at / cooldown_until / priority / group_count；\n            按 (active DESC, last_failure_at DESC NULLS LAST, id) 排；\n            cap 200 行 + truncated flag 防 OOM；\n            status=''down'' if zero active；''degraded'' 任一不健康；ok else\n- W2.H6.3 GET /admin/health/upstream    get_upstream_health\n            usage_logs 最近 1h 按 platform GROUP BY，\n            success_rate = ok_count / total；\n            阈值：<90% degraded，<50% down，零流量 ok（不是异常）\n- W2.H6.4 GET /admin/health/db          get_db_health\n            sqlx PgPool size + num_idle 直接读；\n            Redis tokio::time::timeout(2s, AsyncCommands::ping)\n            ping_ms 用 Instant::elapsed() 测；\n            阈值：pool.idle=0 且 size>0 → degraded；\n            redis configured 但不可达 → degraded\n- W2.H6.5 GET /admin/health/queue       get_queue_health\n            COUNT pending：topups (status=''pending'') /\n            refund_requests (status=''pending'') /\n            users (email_verified_at IS NULL AND created_at < now()-1h)\n            （不算 email_verify_tokens 表是因为 token 过期前的等待\n            是用户行为，不是积压；过 1h 才算异常队列）；\n            阈值：refund > 50 或 topup > 100 → degraded；> 5x 阈值 → down\n\n约束：\n- 全 endpoint 走 RequireAdmin extractor\n- 全 read，无 audit；polling cadence 30s（OQ-5 (a)）\n- 派生 status 字段：每端点都返回 ok|degraded|down，panel 不重算；\n  阈值的 \"含义\" 紧贴 \"使用\" 写（不抽常量），改一处可读\n\n清理：\n- crates/sub2api-rs/src/router/admin/mod.rs\n  删除 placeholders::empty_object（最后两个 caller H-6 / H-8 都已实装）\n  empty_list / stub_write 仍在用（H-3 / H-4 lane 还没落）\n\n实施方式：main session inline 落地（4 个 batch-2a sub-agent 撞 403 quota）\n单文件 + 1 处 mod.rs 清理：\n  crates/sub2api-rs/src/router/admin/health.rs +581/-19\n  crates/sub2api-rs/src/router/admin/mod.rs    +0/-7\n\n闸门：\n- cargo build -p sub2api-rs：clean\n- cargo clippy -p sub2api-rs --all-targets -- -D warnings：clean\n  (修了 1 处 unused JsonValue/json import → 仅 test 模块需要 →\n   局部 use；2 处 if_same_then_else 双 ''degraded'' 分支 → 抽布尔合并)\n- cargo fmt --all：clean\n- cargo test -p sub2api-rs --lib：211 pass / 57 ignored / 0 fail\n  - health::tests 3 pass：scheduler 阈值 / db 阈值 / queue 阈值\n    （阈值在 test 里 mirror handler 内联表达式，refactor 漂移即测试爆）\n  - health::tests_e2e 5 #[ignore]：scheduler / accounts truncated /\n    upstream success_rate / db pool stats / queue pending count","tree":{"sha":"9385def8f0b08f1f17a86791a2fe6a68d9e21dbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/9385def8f0b08f1f17a86791a2fe6a68d9e21dbc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/7149071bfe2b186488a590ac057acad9eb3185d1","verification":{"payload":"tree 9385def8f0b08f1f17a86791a2fe6a68d9e21dbc\nparent 7902391ef3b698dd702c3329d7c0236e99485460\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779859724 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779859724 +0800\n\nfeat(R10.3 H-6): 健康看板 5 read endpoint 落地\n\nH-6 lane 5 sub-task 完工（FR-95，全 read，无 audit，OQ-5 (a) 30s polling）：\n\n- W2.H6.1 GET /admin/health/scheduler   get_scheduler_health\n            从 accounts 表派生池组成（active/disabled/cooling_down\n            + by_platform）；scheduler crate 没有 live runtime metrics\n            export（R11 工作），polling-driven 场景 \"现在选会怎样\"\n            和 \"实时队列\" 同义；\n            status=''down'' if active=0 & total>0；\n            status=''degraded'' if active < total*0.5；ok otherwise\n- W2.H6.2 GET /admin/health/accounts    get_accounts_health\n           