\n- cargo fmt --all：clean\n- cargo test -p sub2api-rs --lib：211 pass / 57 ignored / 0 fail\n  - health::tests 3 pass：scheduler 阈值 / db 阈值 / queue 阈值\n    （阈值在 test 里 mirror handler 内联表达式，refactor 漂移即测试爆）\n  - health::tests_e2e 5 #[ignore]：scheduler / accounts truncated /\n    upstream success_rate / db pool stats / queue pending count\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQS347Yge2mOrQHQJpAfJYZ9Ahsw8AUCahaBDQAKCRAfJYZ9Ahsw\n8PIpAQDX1bH4XNvnd7PYM3+rKRYOodllkgPsw+KCGPD4oncFcgD/QS0C80XmwZxn\nWizAFx8GqayCeOpUAeypCZTXGqbZdAk=\n=SiTK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-30T17:33:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/7149071bfe2b186488a590ac057acad9eb3185d1","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKDcxNDkwNzFiZmUyYjE4NjQ4OGE1OTBhYzA1N2FjYWQ5ZWIzMTg1ZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/7902391ef3b698dd702c3329d7c0236e99485460","sha":"7902391ef3b698dd702c3329d7c0236e99485460","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/7902391ef3b698dd702c3329d7c0236e99485460"}],"sha":"7149071bfe2b186488a590ac057acad9eb3185d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/7149071bfe2b186488a590ac057acad9eb3185d1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/7902391ef3b698dd702c3329d7c0236e99485460/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T05:20:29Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T05:20:29Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"message":"feat(R10.3 H-8): 系统配置 4 endpoint + pricing.updated 落地\n\nH-8 lane 4 sub-task 完工：\n\n- W2.H8.1 GET   /admin/settings           list_settings\n            按 prefix 分组（key.split_once(''.'')）→ BTreeMap 稳定序；\n            secret 键 value 返回 null + is_secret=true（不漏底）\n- W2.H8.2 PATCH /admin/settings/:key      update_setting\n            UPSERT (ON CONFLICT (key) DO UPDATE)；reason ≥ 5；\n            key ≤ 100 chars 镜像 settings.key VARCHAR(100)；\n            同事务 audit (target_kind=''setting'', target_id=NULL —\n            行 id 不稳定且无业务意义，target 用 key 在 details 里冗余)；\n            before/after 都过 redact_secrets\n- W2.H8.3 \"is_secret\" marker             is_secret_key()\n            内联 SECRET_NEEDLES 字典（与 services::audit::SECRET_KEY_NEEDLES\n            等价，用 #[test] secret_needles_match_audit_module 编译时校验\n            漂移；不暴露 audit.rs 内部 const）；list + patch 都用同一个 fn\n- W2.H8.4 pricing.updated Redis pub-sub   spawn_pricing_pubsub()\n            key 以 ''billing.model_pricing'' 开头时事务提交后 tokio::spawn\n            一个 `AsyncCommands::publish(\"pricing.updated\", json)` 背景任务\n            （Redis 不可达不阻塞 PATCH 响应，warn! 记一行）\n\n辅助端点（stub 已存在，本轮配套实装）：\n- POST  /admin/settings/test-smtp         test_smtp\n            借 password_reset 模板烟测 SMTP（不写新邮件 surface）；\n            发到 admin 自己 email，链回登录页（无真实 reset token）；\n            email/base_url 未配 → 503，链路异常 → 502\n- POST  /admin/settings/rotate-jwt        rotate_jwt\n            **501 deferred**：现有 Config 是 startup 读取的不可变 singleton，\n            热轮换 JWT_SECRET 需先在 R10.4 / B-1 给 Config 加 reload hook +\n            旧 secret grace 窗口。endpoint body 写明 deferral 原因 + 真要换\n            的运维步骤（PATCH auth.jwt_secret + 进程 SIGTERM rolling restart）\n\n约束：\n- 全 endpoint 走 RequireAdmin extractor\n- 写端点 reason ≥ 5；test-smtp 不写 audit（不 mutate）；rotate-jwt 不到\n- 单 sqlx tx：snapshot before → UPSERT RETURNING after → audit → commit\n\n实施方式：main session inline 落地（4 个 batch-2a sub-agent 撞 403 quota）\n单文件：crates/sub2api-rs/src/router/admin/settings.rs +810/-7\n\n闸门：\n- cargo build -p sub2api-rs：clean\n- cargo clippy -p sub2api-rs --all-targets -- -D warnings：clean\n  (修了 7 处 doc list overindented + 1 处 unused Row import + 1 处\n   redis::cmd(\"PUBLISH\").query_async 接口签名错 → AsyncCommands::publish)\n- cargo fmt --all：clean\n- cargo test -p sub2api-rs --lib：208 pass / 52 ignored / 0 fail\n  - settings::tests 5 pass：is_secret_key / display_value 重定向 null /\n    group_for_key / validate_reason / secret_needles_match_audit_module\n    （⚡ 编译时漂移卫士）\n  - settings::tests_e2e 6 #[ignore = \"needs docker\"]：list 分组+redact /\n    patch 写 audit redacted diff / patch 新键 / patch reason 短拒 /\n    patch oversize key 拒 / rotate-jwt 501","tree":{"sha":"10f8b76e6f71379fd318b8f54a94ad825830d4c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/10f8b76e6f71379fd318b8f54a94ad825830d4c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/7902391ef3b698dd702c3329d7c0236e99485460","verification":{"payload":"tree 10f8b76e6f71379fd318b8f54a94ad825830d4c6\nparent 86cd5f8af3e68084cbeeb55600ebc9cae30965de\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779859229 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779859229 +0800\n\nfeat(R10.3 H-8): 系统配置 4 endpoint + pricing.updated 落地\n\nH-8 lane 4 sub-task 完工：\n\n- W2.H8.1 GET   /admin/settings           list_settings\n            按 prefix 分组（key.split_once(''.'')）→ BTreeMap 稳定序；\n            secret 键 value 返回 null + is_secret=true（不漏底）\n- W2.H8.2 PATCH /admin/settings/:key      update_setting\n            UPSERT (ON CONFLICT (key) DO UPDATE)；reason ≥ 5；\n            key ≤ 100 chars 镜像 settings.key VARCHAR(100)；\n            同事务 audit (target_kind=''setting'', target_id=NULL —\n            行 id 不稳定且无业务意义，target 用 key 在 details 里冗余)；\n            before/after 都过 redact_secrets\n- W2.H8.3 \"is_secret\" marker             is_secret_key()\n            内联 SECRET_NEEDLES 字典（与 services::audit::SECRET_KEY_NEEDLES\n            等价，用 #[test] secret_needles_match_audit_module 编译时校验\n            漂移；不暴露 audit.rs 内部 const）；list + patch 都用同一个 fn\n- W2.H8.4 pricing.updated Redis pub-sub   spawn_pricing_pubsub()\n            key 以 ''billing.model_pricing'' 开头时事务提交后 tokio::spawn\n            一个 `AsyncCommands::publish(\"pricing.updated\", json)` 背景任务\n            （Redis 不可达不阻塞 PATCH 响应，warn! 记一行）\n\n辅助端点（stub 已存在，本轮配套实装）：\n- POST  /admin/settings/test-smtp         test_smtp\n            借 password_reset 模板烟测 SMTP（不写新邮件 surface）；\n            发到 admin 自己 email，链回登录页（无真实 reset token）；\n            email/base_url 未配 → 503，链路异常 → 502\n- POST  /admin/settings/rotate-jwt        rotate_jwt\n            **501 deferred**：现有 Config 是 startup 读取的不可变 singleton，\n            热轮换 JWT_SECRET 需先在 R10.4 / B-1 给 Config 加 reload hook +\n            旧 secret grace 窗口。endpoint body 写明 deferral 原因 + 真要换\n            的运维步骤（PATCH auth.jwt_secret + 进程 SIGTERM rolling restart）\n\n约束：\n- 全 endpoint 走 RequireAdmin extractor\n- 写端点 reason ≥ 5；test-smtp 不写 audit（不 mutate）；rotate-jwt 不到\n- 单 sqlx tx：snapshot before → UPSERT RETURNING after → audit → commit\n\n实施方式：main session inline 落地（4 个 batch-2a sub-agent 撞 403 quota）\n单文件：crates/sub2api-rs/src/router/admin/settings.rs +810/-7\n\n闸门：\n- cargo build -p sub2api-rs：clean\n- cargo clippy -p sub2api-rs --all-targets -- -D warnings：clean\n  (修了 7 处 doc list overindented + 1 处 unused Row import + 1 处\n   redis::cmd(\"PUBLISH\").query_async 接口签名错 → AsyncCommands::publish)\n- cargo fmt --all：clean\n- cargo test -p sub2api-rs --lib：208 pass / 52 ignored / 0 fail\n  - settings::tests 5 pass：is_secret_key / display_value 重定向 null /\n    group_for_key / validate_reason / secret_needles_match_audit_module\n    （⚡ 编译时漂移卫士）\n  - settings::tests_e2e 6 #[ignore = \"needs docker\"]：list 分组+redact /\n    patch 写 audit redacted diff / patch 新键 / patch reason 短拒 /\n    patch oversize key 拒 / rotate-jwt 501\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQS347Yge2mOrQHQJpAfJYZ9Ahsw8AUCahZ/HgAKCRAfJYZ9Ahsw\n8G+cAQDG2PArDp4efSI6aJsofKHZdYj+Qv6tr0R/VV6UNxqe0QEArzuTKFIEHA3s\ncbujwH8Ymas/4H6mX0FXi/OKMDIPrgc=\n=cRJS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-30T17:33:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_u