"site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/86cd5f8af3e68084cbeeb55600ebc9cae30965de","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKDg2Y2Q1ZjhhZjNlNjgwODRjYmVlYjU1NjAwZWJjOWNhZTMwOTY1ZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/a5c391858fc938938059d67f86fcb26a5d8e7ecc","sha":"a5c391858fc938938059d67f86fcb26a5d8e7ecc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/a5c391858fc938938059d67f86fcb26a5d8e7ecc"}],"sha":"86cd5f8af3e68084cbeeb55600ebc9cae30965de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/86cd5f8af3e68084cbeeb55600ebc9cae30965de"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/a5c391858fc938938059d67f86fcb26a5d8e7ecc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T05:03:58Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T05:03:58Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"message":"feat(R10.3 H-5): usage 聚合 6 read endpoint 落地\n\nH-5 lane 6 sub-task 完工，全 read 不写 audit（R10.3_PLAN §3.2 H-5 末尾约定）：\n\n- W2.H5.1 GET /admin/usage/summary?from=&to=                 总览卡片\n            (total_requests / input/output/cache_creation/cache_read tokens\n             / total_cost / actual_cost / distinct_users / distinct_accounts)\n- W2.H5.2 GET /admin/usage/top-users?from=&to=&limit=        按 total_cost DESC\n- W2.H5.3 GET /admin/usage/top-accounts?from=&to=&limit=     LEFT JOIN accounts，\n            软删 / 硬删账号也保留 account_id 行\n- W2.H5.4 GET /admin/usage/top-models?from=&to=&limit=       按 total_cost DESC\n- W2.H5.5 GET /admin/usage/timeseries?from=&to=&bucket=hour|day\n            date_trunc 聚合；未传 bucket 默认 ''day''；非 hour/day 返 400\n- W2.H5.6 GET /admin/usage/report?format=csv|json            导出\n            CSV 列序锁定（doc 顶头 // ## CSV column order (locked) 节）：\n            created_at,user_id,user_email,account_id,account_name,platform,\n            model,input_tokens,output_tokens,cache_creation_tokens,\n            cache_read_tokens,total_cost,actual_cost\n            一次性 build String + Body::from（同 H-9 audit_logs.rs 选择，\n            90d 上限 + 单条行 ~120 字节，远低于 100k 行 / 12MB threshold）\n\n共享约束：\n- 每 handler 提取 RequireAdmin（即使不消费 user_id）—— defense-in-depth\n- 默认窗口：from=NOW()-30d, to=NOW()；客户端只给 from / 只给 to 都自动补\n- **窗口 ≤ 90d 硬约束**，逾期返 400（resolve_window helper 集中处理）\n- limit 默认 10，clamp 1..=100（top-X 三个端点）\n- bucket 仅接受 ''hour'' / ''day''，其它返 400\n- 全部用 sqlx::query + bind 防注入（无字符串拼接）\n- usage_logs 监控创建时间分区表：所有查询 `WHERE created_at >= $1 AND created_at < $2`\n  开启 partition pruning\n\nEntity 字段对齐（R10.3_PLAN 草案有差异，按 entities/usage_log.rs 真值）：\n- cache_creation_tokens / cache_read_tokens（plan 草案的 cache_create_tokens 错）\n- total_cost / actual_cost（plan 草案的 cost_usd 错；NUMERIC Decimal）\n- model 是 String 字段（不是 enum），直接 GROUP BY model\n\n闸门：\n- cargo build -p sub2api-rs：clean\n- cargo clippy -p sub2api-rs --all-targets -- -D warnings：clean\n  (修了 8 处 unwrap_or_else(|_| Decimal::ZERO) → unwrap_or 的 lazy-eval 警告)\n- cargo fmt --all：clean\n- cargo test -p sub2api-rs --lib：202 passed / 39 ignored / 0 fail\n  - usage 模块 6 unit pass：clamp_limit / csv_field escape / resolve_window\n    四种异常路径 (default 30d / bad rfc3339 / from>to / over 90d)\n  - usage 模块 7 testcontainers e2e #[ignore = \"needs docker\"]：summary\n    aggregate / over-90d 反向 / top-users 排序 / top-models 分组 / timeseries\n    day-bucket / timeseries bad-bucket 反向 / csv export\n\n未触：services/audit / services/balance / mod.rs / middleware / entity / migration\n单文件改动：crates/sub2api-rs/src/router/admin/usage.rs +1184 / -18\n\n实施方式：本 lane 由协调员主会话亲手落地（4 个 batch-2a sub-agent 撞 403\ndaily quota，~90s 都未触代码即被切；切到 main session 单 lane 推进，\n余 5 lane 排队）。","tree":{"sha":"b55d1911ff3bac11e6b4584e3068954fac5fd2f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/b55d1911ff3bac11e6b4584e3068954fac5fd2f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/a5c391858fc938938059d67f86fcb26a5d8e7ecc","verification":{"payload":"tree b55d1911ff3bac11e6b4584e3068954fac5fd2f0\nparent d9119dd7a1841dd9dbf953ab621e2a81551c7c58\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779858238 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779858238 +0800\n\nfeat(R10.3 H-5): usage 聚合 6 read endpoint 落地\n\nH-5 lane 6 sub-task 完工，全 read 不写 audit（R10.3_PLAN §3.2 H-5 末尾约定）：\n\n- W2.H5.1 GET /admin/usage/summary?from=&to=                 总览卡片\n            (total_requests / input/output/cache_creation/cache_read tokens\n             / total_cost / actual_cost / distinct_users / distinct_accounts)\n- W2.H5.2 GET /admin/usage/top-users?from=&to=&limit=        按 total_cost DESC\n- W2.H5.3 GET /admin/usage/top-accounts?from=&to=&limit=     LEFT JOIN accounts，\n            软删 / 硬删账号也保留 account_id 行\n- W2.H5.4 GET /admin/usage/top-models?from=&to=&limit=       按 total_cost DESC\n- W2.H5.5 GET /admin/usage/timeseries?from=&to=&bucket=hour|day\n            date_trunc 聚合；未传 bucket 默认 ''day''；非 hour/day 返 400\n- W2.H5.6 GET /admin/usage/report?format=csv|json            导出\n            CSV 列序锁定（doc 顶头 // ## CSV column order (locked) 节）：\n            created_at,user_id,user_email,account_id,account_name,platform,\n            model,input_tokens,output_tokens,cache_creation_tokens,\n            cache_read_tokens,total_cost,actual_cost\n            一次性 build String + Body::from（同 H-9 audit_logs.rs 选择，\n            90d 上限 + 单条行 ~120 字节，远低于 100k 行 / 12MB threshold）\n\n共享约束：\n- 每 handler 提取 RequireAdmin（即使不消费 user_id）—— defense-in-depth\n- 默认窗口：from=NOW()-30d, to=NOW()；客户端只给 from / 只给 to 都自动补\n- **窗口 ≤ 90d 硬约束**，逾期返 400（resolve_window helper 集中处理）\n- limit 默认 10，clamp 1..=100（top-X 三个端点）\n- bucket 仅接受 ''hour'' / ''day''，其它返 400\n- 全部用 sqlx::query + bind 防注入（无字符串拼接）\n- usage_logs 监控创建时间分区表：所有查询 `WHERE created_at >= $1 AND created_at < $2`\n  开启 partition pruning\n\nEntity 字段对齐（R10.3_PLAN 草案有差异，按 entities/usage_log.rs 真值）：\n- cache_creation_tokens / cache_read_tokens（plan 草案的 cache_create_tokens 错）\n- total_cost / actual_cost（plan 草案的 cost_usd 错；NUMERIC Decimal）\n- model 是 String 字段（不是 enum），直接 GROUP BY model\n\n闸门：\n- cargo build -p sub2api-rs：clean\n- cargo clippy -p sub2api-rs --all-targets -- -D warnings：clean\n  (修了 8 处 unwrap_or_else(|_| Decimal::ZERO) → unwrap_or 的 lazy-eval 警告)\n- cargo fmt --all：clean\n- cargo test -p sub2api-rs --lib：202 passed / 39 ignored / 0 fail\n  - usage 模块 6 unit pass：clamp_limit / csv_field escape / resolve_window\n    四种异常路径 (default 30d / bad rfc3339 / from>to / over 90d)\n  - usage 模块 7 testcontainers e2e #[ignore = \"needs docker\"]：summary\n    aggregate / over-90d 反向 / top-users 排序 / top-models 分组 / timeseries\n    day-bucket / timeseries bad-bucket 反向 / csv export\n\n未触：services/audit / services/balance / mod.rs / middleware / entity / migration\n单文件改动：crates/sub2api-rs/src/router/admin/usage.rs +1184 / -18\n\n实施方式：本 lane 由协调员主会话亲手落地（4 个 batch-2a sub-agent 撞 403\ndaily quota，~90s 都未触代码即被切；切到 main session 单 lane 推进，\n余 5 lane 排队）。\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQS347Yge2mOrQHQJpAfJYZ9Ahsw8AUCahZ7PgAKCRAfJYZ9Ahsw\n8DbvAQDWHkht+FV8YNoHVlZ8S4lFsT3emg1qx1JgDs9Gli/hLQEAh4ly5TzlMBfV\nKJlfzZ0kZaaCi9gw5/qDWIbfjFADGA0=\n=mvy/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-30T17:33:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/a5c391858fc938938059d67f86fcb26a5d8e7ecc","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKGE1YzM5MTg1OGZjOTM4OTM4MDU5ZDY3Zjg2ZmNiMjZhNWQ4ZTdlY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/d9119dd7a1841dd9dbf953ab621e2a81551c7c58","sha":"d9119dd7a1841dd9dbf953ab621e2a81551c7c58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/d9119dd7a1841dd9dbf953ab621e2a81551c7c58"}],"sha":"a5c391858fc938938059d67f86fcb26a5d8e7ecc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos