84dabe87d38edee97250f39a1b9367e69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/cefbb7e84dabe87d38edee97250f39a1b9367e69"}],"sha":"d9119dd7a1841dd9dbf953ab621e2a81551c7c58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/d9119dd7a1841dd9dbf953ab621e2a81551c7c58"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/cefbb7e84dabe87d38edee97250f39a1b9367e69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T01:53:29Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T01:53:39Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"message":"feat(R10.3 H-10): 紧急按钮 4 endpoint + MaintenanceGate middleware\n\nH-10 lane 5 sub-task 完工：\n\n**4 写端点（admin/emergency.rs）**：\n- W2.H10.1 POST /admin/emergency/force-logout-all       force_logout_all\n            DELETE refresh_token_allowlist 全表 + commit 后异步发邮件给所有 active admin\n- W2.H10.2 POST /admin/emergency/maintenance-mode       set_maintenance_mode\n            UPSERT settings.system.maintenance JSON（IPs 上行校验返 400 干净）\n- W2.H10.3 POST /admin/emergency/unmount-account/:id    emergency_unmount_account\n            accounts.status=''disabled'' + schedulable=false + deleted_at=NOW\n            （in-flight SSE 切断打 // TODO R11，当前 mock adapter 无流可切）\n- W2.H10.4 POST /admin/emergency/revoke-all-keys-by-user/:user_id  emergency_revoke_user_keys\n            soft-delete 全部 active api_keys + commit 后异步通知用户\n\n**1 全局 middleware（middleware/maintenance.rs）**：\n- W2.H10.5 MaintenanceGate\n            5s read-through cache → settings.system.maintenance JSON\n            allowlist：/sub2api/api/admin/* + /sub2api/api/auth/admin-login\n            IP allowlist：白名单 IP 一律放行\n            blocked → 503 + Retry-After: 60 + operator banner\n            fetched_at 用 Option<Instant> 避 Instant::checked_sub 在 boot 早期的可移植性坑\n\n**契约（铁律全过）**：\n- 4 写端点全经 RequireAdmin extractor + AuditWriter::record（同事务）\n- reason ≥ 5 字符（镜像 admin_audit_logs.reason CHECK 约束 from 0016）\n- 客户端 IP 走 X-Forwarded-For → X-Real-IP → peer SocketAddr ladder\n- email 副作用 fire-and-forget 在 commit 之后（SMTP 延迟不污染 admin response tail latency）\n\n**router.rs 装配 +3 行**（≤ 15 行约束达成）：\nfactory pattern install_maintenance_gate(router, state.db.clone()) 藏在 maintenance.rs，\nrouter.rs 仅 1 行调用。state.db = None 时 no-op（router-only unit tests 不受影响）。\n\n测试：\n- cargo build / clippy --all-targets -D warnings 全绿\n- cargo fmt 干净\n- cargo test --lib：192 pass / 0 fail\n- middleware::maintenance::e2e 2/2（gate enabled 拦 gateway + Retry-After / disabled 透传）\n- router::admin::emergency::e2e 4/4（每个 endpoint 一对：DB 状态 + audit 行）\n\n文件：\n- crates/sub2api-rs/src/middleware/maintenance.rs              新建 +470\n- crates/sub2api-rs/src/middleware/mod.rs                       +1（声明 mod）\n- crates/sub2api-rs/src/router.rs                               +3（一处 layer 装配）\n- crates/sub2api-rs/src/router/admin/emergency.rs               +1038/-10","tree":{"sha":"931254c1150231e39d2f737c73eb9ab59ab35c7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPan