.2 GET    /admin/accounts/:id        get_account（credentials 脱敏 + group_ids）\n- W2.H2.3 POST   /admin/accounts            create_account（AES-GCM envelope 加密 credentials）\n- W2.H2.4 PATCH  /admin/accounts/:id        update_account（动态 UPDATE + credentials 重新加密）\n- W2.H2.5 DELETE /admin/accounts/:id        delete_account（soft + schedulable=false）\n- W2.H2.6 POST   /admin/accounts/:id/toggle-schedulable\n- W2.H2.7 POST   /admin/accounts/:id/reset-cooldown（5 个 cooldown 列全清）\n- W2.H2.8 POST   /admin/accounts/import     import_accounts（按 (platform,name) upsert，per-row failures 不阻整批）\n- W2.H2.9 GET    /admin/accounts/export     export_accounts（不导 credentials，import 端会拒 envelope shape）\n\n写端点契约（铁律全过）：\n- RequireAdmin 提取 + parent middleware 双重 role 校验\n- snapshot_account 在 audit before/after 都把 credentials 替成 <redacted> + 走 redact_secrets\n- 单 sqlx tx：snapshot before → 主操作 → snapshot after → AuditWriter::record → tx.commit\n- audit 失败 → tx rollback 全撤\n- reason ≥ 5 字符 handler 端先校验（避免开 tx 仅为 rollback）\n- 客户端 IP/UA 走 X-Forwarded-For → X-Real-IP → peer ladder（同 router::auth）\n\ncipher 走 ACCOUNT_CREDENTIAL_KEY env per-call（require_cipher helper），\n镜像 bin/seed_accounts.rs，不动 AppState 让 lane 保持正交。\n\n测试：\n- 6 个 #[ignore = \"needs docker (testcontainers PG)\"] e2e（本地 docker 全过）：\n  create / update / delete / toggle / reset-cooldown / import\n- cargo build / clippy --all-targets -D warnings / fmt 全绿\n- workspace lib：186 pass + 14 ignored（含 H-2 6 个）\n\n单文件改动：crates/sub2api-rs/src/router/admin/accounts.rs +1576/-17\n未触 services/audit / mod.rs / middleware / entity / migration。","tree":{"sha":"c7065780f2a5088a62c9150fb9ed55eb8a2bc0f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/c7065780f2a5088a62c9150fb9ed55eb8a2bc0f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/a49cc224fbc8cb09ae17a326ceb1abb22c7389c5","verification":{"payload":"tree c7065780f2a5088a62c9150fb9ed55eb8a2bc0f0\nparent 85d8fa46135a1d0d200287f2d74ceccf9aeffa95\nauthor Rap