105d6973f282e17b2e7c1c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/ff92d6c1792d55626105d6973f282e17b2e7c1c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/80217c7a4809a0685e676352ecc27233b321148e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T02:25:00Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T02:25:00Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"message":"fix(R10.2.8): sub2api admin GET stub 改 200 empty + 加 subscriptions/usage 路由 + server-mgr 形状\n\n# 现状\n\npanel 调 admin/{subscriptions,usage,api-keys} 浏览器报 ''CORS no\nallow-origin'', 调 admin/{users,groups,redeem-codes} 报 501 + 各 view\n.length undefined 炸. 节点 (server-mgr/api/nodes) 也 .length 炸.\n\n# 根因\n\n1. sub2api admin_router subscriptions/usage 端点根本没注册 → axum 默认\n   404 fallback 在 CorsLayer 之外, 所以 404 响应没 attach\n   Access-Control-Allow-Origin → 浏览器报 ''blocked by CORS''.\n2. users/groups/redeem-codes/settings 是 501 stub. 前端\n   PaginatedResponse<T> 期望 {items, total, page, per_page}, 501\n   被前端 looksLikeUnimplemented 路径接住但 mock 数据不对路径, 仍\n   导致部分 view section.rows undefined.\n3. server-mgr 后端真返 {items: [...]} (跟 sub2api 形状一致), 但\n   panel/api/serverMgr.ts NodesPage type 写的是 {data, meta:{...}},\n   resp.data = undefined → nodes.value = undefined → view .length 炸.\n\n# 修\n\n## 后端 (crates/sub2api-rs/src/router/admin.rs)\n\n- admin_router 加 /subscriptions /usage /usage/:id 路由 (之前没注册)\n- 所有非 accounts 的 GET stub 从 501 改 empty_list() 200\n  + {items:[], total:0, page:1, per_page:20}, /settings 返 {} 200\n- POST/PATCH/DELETE 仍 stub_write() 501 (写不能静默吞).\n\n让前端在数据未就绪时拿到干净 empty list 渲染 ''no data'', 不再 toast\n''function not implemented''/''CORS error''. 真实 list 实现待 R10.3 Epic H.\n\n## 前端 (web/apps/main-panel/src/api/serverMgr.ts + stores/servers.ts)\n\nNodesPage type 改 sub2api SPEC §6 flat 形状; fetchNodes 改读\nresp.items / resp.total. 跟 sub2api admin/accounts 修法一致.\n\n# 验证\n\n- sub2api lib 174 tests pass, e2e 全 pass\n- cargo fmt + clippy clean\n- vue-tsc + panel build clean","tree":{"sha":"ad548411f37e543af27b0fbfe443e6d04bf65cf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/ad548411f37e543af27b0fbfe443e6d04bf65cf6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/80217c7a4809a0685e676352ecc27233b321148e","verification":{"payload":"tree ad548411f37e543af27b0fbfe443e6d04bf65cf6\nparent d465d89254160ab820548739fe5ced9092dded56\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779589500 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779589500 +0800\n\nfix(R10.2.8): sub2api admin GET stub 改 200 empty + 加 subscriptions/usage 路由 + server-mgr 形状\n\n# 现状\n\npanel 调 admin/{subscriptions,usage,api-keys} 浏览器报 ''CORS no\nallow-origin'', 调 admin/{users,groups,redeem-codes} 报 501 + 各 view\n.length undefined 炸. 节点 (server-mgr/api/nodes) 也 .length 炸.\n\n# 根因\n\n1. sub2api admin_router subscriptions/usage 端点根本没注册 → axum 默认\n   404 fallback 在 CorsLayer 之外, 所以 404 响应没 attach\n   Access-Control-Allow-Origin → 浏览器报 ''blocked by CORS''.\n2. users/groups/redeem-codes/settings 是 501 stub. 前端\n   PaginatedResponse<T> 期望 {items, total, page, per_page}, 501\n   被前端 looksLikeUnimplemented 路径接住但 mock 数据不对路径, 仍\n   导致部分 view section.rows undefined.\n3. server-mgr 后端真返 {items: [...]} (跟 sub2api 形状一致), 但\n   panel/api/serverMgr.ts NodesPage type 写的是 {data, meta:{...}},\n   resp.data = undefined → nodes.value = undefined → view .length 炸.\n\n# 修\n\n## 后端 (crates/sub2api-rs/src/router/admin.rs)\n\n- admin_router 加 /subscriptions /usage /usage/:id 路由 (之前没注册)\n- 所有非 accounts 的 GET stub 从 501 改 empty_list() 200\n  + {items:[], total:0, page:1, per_page:20}, /settings 返 {} 200\n- POST/PATCH/DELETE 仍 stub_write() 501 (写不能静默吞).\n\n让前端在数据未就绪时拿到干净 empty list 渲染 ''no data'', 不再 toast\n''function not implemented''/''CORS error''. 真实 list 实现待 R10.3 Epic H.\n\n## 前端 (web/apps/main-panel/src/api/serverMgr.ts + stores/servers.ts)\n\nNodesPage type 改 sub2api SPEC §6 flat 形状; fetchNodes 改读\nresp.items / resp.total. 跟 sub2api admin/accounts 修法一致.\n\n# 验证\n\n- sub2api lib 174 tests pass, e2e 全 pass\n- cargo fmt + clippy clean\n- vue-tsc + panel build clean\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQS347Yge2mOrQHQJpAfJYZ9Ahsw8AUCahJhfAAKCRAfJYZ9Ahsw\n8FpdAQCn2KitnimGggJBzuCXuNGPnR0oY9HYeK/nm1hzGaBn5wEA8R0i2lzGQjo5\ngU68IF10ZXC76cpsh6QSqNVqMI0j4AY=\n=uKSe\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-24T02:25:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/80217c7a4809a0685e676352ecc27233b321148e","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKDgwMjE3YzdhNDgwOWEwNjg1ZTY3NjM1MmVjYzI3MjMzYjMyMTE0OGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/d465d89254160ab820548739fe5ced9092dded56","sha":"d465d89254160ab820548739fe5ced9092dded56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/d465d89254160ab820548739fe5ced9092dded56"}],"sha":"80217c7a4809a0685e676352ecc27233b321148e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/80217c7a4809a0685e676352ecc27233b321148e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/d465d89254160ab820548739fe5ced9092dded56/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T02:04:36Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T02:04:36Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"message":"fix(R10.2.8): 修 panel sub2api list 形状 mismatch (admin/accounts .length undefined)\n\n# 现状\n\npanel ''/sub2api/accounts'' 报 ''Cannot read properties of undefined\n(reading length)''.\n\n# 根因\n\nsub2api 后端 admin list endpoint (accounts/users/api-keys/subscriptions/\nusage-logs/groups) 返 envelope 是顶层 flat:\n\n  { items: [...], total, page, per_page }\n\npanel 前端 PaginatedResponse type + withSection 适配器期望 nested:\n\n  { data: [...], meta: { page, per_page, total } }\n\n形状对不上, resp.data = undefined → section.rows = undefined → view\n里 row.group_ids?.length 路径之外某处 .length 调用炸 (具体 trace 由\n下一轮诊断, 但根因相同).\n\n# 修\n\n主 panel src/api/sub2api.ts: PaginatedResponse type 改为 sub2api 真实\nflat 形状.\n\nsrc/stores/sub2api.ts: withSection 改读 resp.items/total/page/per_page;\npaginate mock helper 同步.\n\nserver-mgr / cf-monitor 端点的 PaginatedResponse 是不同 backend 类型\n({data, meta}, 在 stores/servers.ts + cf.ts 内联定义), 本次不动.\n\n# 验证\n\n- vue-tsc clean\n- pnpm build clean\n- 后端 curl 真实形状已确认: {items, total, page, per_page}","tree":{"sha":"a1932084ba4672a8e150f3a8880b73f7d121f30d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/a1932084ba4672a8e150f3a8880b73f7d121f30d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/d465d89254160ab820548739fe5ced9092dded56","verification":{"payload":"tree a1932084ba4672a8e150f3a8880b73f7d121f30d\nparent daed4d427ca50ad9d4b994b95c0002df0136c048\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779588276 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779588276 +0800\n\nfix(R10.2.8): 修 panel sub2api list 形状 mismatch (admin/accounts .length undefined)\n\n# 现状\n\npanel ''/sub2api/accounts'' 报 ''Cannot read properties of undefined\n(reading length)''.\n\n# 根因\n\nsub2api 后端 admin list endpoint (accounts/users/api-keys/subscriptions/\nusage-logs/groups) 返 envelope 是顶层 flat:\n\n  { items: [...], total, page, per_page }\n\npanel 前端 PaginatedResponse type + withSection 适配器期望 nested:\n\n  { data: [...], meta: { page, per_page, total } }\n\n形状对不上, resp.data = undefined → section.rows = undefined → view\n里 row.group_ids?.length 路径之外某处 .length 调用炸 (具体 trace 由\n下一轮诊断, 但根因相同).\n\n# 修\n\n主 panel src/api/sub2api.ts: PaginatedResponse type 改为 sub2api 真实\nflat 形状.\n\nsrc/stores/sub2api.ts: withSection 改读 resp.items/total/page/per_page;\npaginate mock helper 同步.\n\nserver-mgr / cf-monitor 端点的 PaginatedResponse 是不同 backend 类型\n({data, meta}, 在 stores/servers.ts + cf.ts 内联定义), 本次不动.\n\n# 验证\n\n- vue-tsc clean\n- pnpm build clean\n- 后端 curl 真实形状已确认: {items, total, page, per_page}\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQS347Yge2mOrQHQJpAfJYZ9Ahsw8AUCahJctAAKCRAfJYZ9Ahsw\n8ABBAPwJYwef8OB/6sCsbNFJ7IZS3vl1+sOAcoDIofs+tOe4ngEA/tm1zFGYDU50\nfg3JpcWFG+3+zIKAaBTeyf5hB0e8fgY=\n=HVMk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-24T02:04:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/d465d89254160ab820548739fe5ced9092dded56","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKGQ0NjVkODkyNTQxNjBhYjgyMDU0ODczOWZlNWNlZDkwOTJkZGVkNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/daed4d427ca50ad9d4b994b95c0002df0136c048","sha":"daed4d427ca50ad9d4b994b95c0002df0136c048","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/daed4d427ca50ad9d4b994b95c0002df0136c048"}],"sha":"d465d89254160ab820548739fe5ced9092dded56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/d465d89254160ab820548739fe5ced9092dded56"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/daed4d427ca50ad9d4b994b95c0002df0136c048/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T01:48:58Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T01:48:58Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"message":"fix(R10.2.8): aggregator auth_authenticated 接受 ?token= query param + ws.ts 传 token\n\n# 现状\n\n修 caddy /ws 到 aggregator-core 后, /ws upgrade 仍然 401:\n''missing Authorization: Bearer header''.\n\n# 根因\n\n浏览器 WebSocket API 不允许自定义 Authorization header. aggregator-core\nauth_authenticated middleware 只查 header, /ws 又被它包围, 所以 ws\nupgrade 永远被 middleware 在 ws_upgrade_handler 之前拦截 401.\n\n# 修\n\n1. aggregator-core/middleware/auth.rs: token 提取 fallback 加 query\n   param ?token=<jwt>. 极简 percent-decoder (没引 url 库, JWT 是\n   URL-safe base64 偶尔 = padding 编码就够).\n\n2. main-panel/stores/ws.ts: 构 ws url 时 append ?token=<accessToken>.\n   logged-out 时不加 query (走原 first-frame auth path 让 server 拒).\n\nws.rs 内部的 first-frame auth 路径保留 (向后兼容 + 双层保险).\n\n# 验证\n\n- cargo test -p aggregator-core: 67 tests pass (lib + e2e)\n- fmt + clippy clean\n- vue-tsc + panel build clean","tree":{"sha":"f7c35308905b4e391615f5964ae393ed110948df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/f7c35308905b4e391615f5964ae393ed110948df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/daed4d427ca50ad9d4b994b95c0002df0136c048","verification":{"payload":"tree f7c35308905b4e391615f5964ae393ed110948df\nparent d909b151ba4429e7658a175db2ba0ee6c3a55f4b\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779587338 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779587338 +0800\n\nfix(R10.2.8): aggregator auth_authenticated 接受 ?token= query param + ws.ts 传 token\n\n# 现状\n\n修 caddy /ws 到 aggregator-core 后, /ws upgrade 仍然 401:\n''missing Authorization: Bearer header''.\n\n# 根因\n\n浏览器 WebSocket API 不允许自定义 Authorization header. aggregator-core\nauth_authenticated middleware 只查 header, /ws 又被它包围, 所以 ws\nupgrade 永远被 middleware 在 ws_upgrade_handler 之前拦截 401.\n\n# 修\n\n1. aggregator-core/middleware/auth.rs: token 提取 fallback 加 query\n   param ?token=<jwt>. 极简 percent-decoder (没引 url 库, JWT 是\n   URL-safe base64 偶尔 = padding 编码就够).\n\n2. main-panel/stores/ws.ts: 构 ws url 时 append ?token=<accessToken>.\n   logged-out 时不加 query (走原 first-frame auth path 让 server 拒).\n\nws.rs 内部的 first-frame auth 路径保留 (向后兼容 + 双层保险).\n\n# 验证\n\n- cargo test -p aggregator-core: 67 tests pass (lib + e2e)\n- fmt + clippy clean\n- vue-tsc + panel build clean\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQS347Yge2mOrQHQJpAfJYZ9Ahsw8AUCahJZCwAKCRAfJYZ9Ahsw\n8OU7APwJB79daRVh+sasMtbXVbhVUDafD6/bfdik4vjIkU8rbAD/cnncgdaOdROd\nHybHDi2oHvJTNPt2Efugo+Fz7Um0xQM=\n=aTPv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-24T01:49:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/daed4d427ca50ad9d4b994b95c0002df0136c048","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKGRhZWQ0ZDQyN2NhNTBhZDlkNGI5OTRiOTVjMDAwMmRmMDEzNmMwNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/d909b151ba4429e7658a175db2ba0ee6c3a55f4b","sha":"d909b151ba4429e7658a175db2ba0ee6c3a55f4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/d909b151ba4429e7658a175db2ba0ee6c3a55f4b"}],"sha":"daed4d427ca50ad9d4b994b95c0002df0136c048","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/daed4d427ca50ad9d4b994b95c0002df0136c048"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/d909b151ba4429e7658a175db2ba0ee6c3a55f4b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T01:42:11Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T01:42:11Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"message":"fix(R10.2.8): caddy 直接 handle /ws 跳过 nginx 修复 ws handshake fail\n\n# 现状\n\npanel 调 wss://core.raphaelny.net/ws (无 trailing slash) 浏览器 console\n报 ''WebSocket connection failed''.\n\n# 根因\n\ncaddyfile 没专门 handle /ws → 进 default handle{} → frontend nginx →\nnginx location /ws/ (有 trailing slash) 不匹配无 slash 路径 → nginx\n默认 try_files SPA fallback 或 301 redirect /ws → /ws/. WS upgrade\nHTTP semantic 不允许 redirect, 所以 handshake fail.\n\n# 修\n\ncaddyfile 加 handle /ws { reverse_proxy aggregator-core:8080 }, 让\nws 直接走 caddy → aggregator-core, 跳过 frontend nginx 的 trailing\nslash redirect.","tree":{"sha":"3c30a3c7248cda7021689fc7aa8922c5cb8ea940","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/3c30a3c7248cda7021689fc7aa8922c5cb8ea940"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/d909b151ba4429e7658a175db2ba0ee6c3a55f4b","verification":{"payload":"tree 3c30a3c7248cda7021689fc7aa8922c5cb8ea940\nparent e7b73328a7065b45e93679c3635af4f0854eb75b\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779586931 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779586931 +0800\n\nfix(R10.2.8): caddy 直接 handle /ws 跳过 nginx 修复 ws handshake fail\n\n# 现状\n\npanel 调 wss://core.raphaelny.net/ws (无 trailing slash) 浏览器 console\n报 ''WebSocket connection failed''.\n\n# 根因\n\ncaddyfile 没专门 handle /ws → 进 default handle{} → frontend nginx →\nnginx location /ws/ (有 trailing slash) 不匹配无 slash 路径 → nginx\n默认 try_files SPA fallback 或 301 redirect /ws → /ws/. WS upgrade\nHTTP semantic 不允许 redirect, 所以 handshake fail.\n\n# 修\n\ncaddyfile 加 handle /ws { reverse_proxy aggregator-core:8080 }, 让\nws 直接走 caddy → aggregator-core, 跳过 frontend nginx 的 trailing\nslash redirect.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQS347Yge2mOrQHQJpAfJYZ9Ahsw8AUCahJXcwAKCRAfJYZ9Ahsw\n8OTjAP46aWm31qFJqXH29yG6gvE96XsqQssUCAY4D+veGqswNgD/ckMtNwcXNoZG\nnqNxp8yg1XaGWY9gj6VdwK5UcC1p3As=\n=DWDm\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-24T01:42:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/d909b151ba4429e7658a175db2ba0ee6c3a55f4b","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKGQ5MDliMTUxYmE0NDI5ZTc2NThhMTc1ZGIyYmEwZWU2YzNhNTVmNGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/e7b73328a7065b45e93679c3635af4f0854eb75b","sha":"e7b73328a7065b45e93679c3635af4f0854eb75b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/e7b73328a7065b45e93679c3635af4f0854eb75b"}],"sha":"d909b151ba4429e7658a175db2ba0ee6c3a55f4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/d909b151ba4429e7658a175db2ba0ee6c3a55f4b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/e7b73328a7065b45e93679c3635af4f0854eb75b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T17:07:01Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T17:09:00Z","email":"109780307+RaphaelNY@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sqsleepy"},"message":"fix(R10.2.8): 回滚 panel auth + sub2api 信任 aggregator-core admin JWT + 修 400 bug\n\n# 现状\n\nR10.2.7 误判: panel 是 single-admin operator console，设计上 panel\nadmin auth 应该用 aggregator-core /api/v1/auth/login（ADMIN_USERNAME=\nRaphaelNY 单 admin 模式），sub2api 用户系统是给终端 API 用户的（不\n同的人）。R10.2.7 把 panel auth.ts 迁到 sub2api 偏离了设计。\n\n用户反馈 + console error 印证:\n- 总揽 GET /api/v1/services 401 (aggregator-core 端点，但 panel 拿\n  sub2api JWT 调，不认)\n- ws://core/ws fail (同上)\n- TypeError ''undefined.length'' (admin/accounts 失败 → frontend store\n  data 是 undefined → views 上的 .length 调用炸)\n- admin/accounts?platform=&status=&group_id=&page=1&per_page=20\n  返 400 ''group_id must be an integer'' (Option<i64> deserialize 空字\n  符串失败)\n\n# 改动 3 件\n\n## A. 回滚 R10.2.7 panel 前端 auth (4 文件)\n\n`git checkout 3743ea4 -- web/.../{stores/auth.ts, views/auth/Login.vue,\nlocales/zh-CN.json, locales/en-US.json}`\n\nrestore:\n- stores/auth.ts: login 调 aggregator.adminLogin + hydrate 调\n  aggregator.me + AuthUser type = aggregator.AdminUser (id/username/role)\n- Login.vue: form 字段 email → username, autocomplete=''username'',\n  type=''text'', i18n key 改回\n- locales: auth.fields.email → username, errors.emailRequired →\n  usernameRequired, invalidCredentials text 改回 ''用户名或密码错误''\n\npanel 重新用 RaphaelNY (aggregator-core /api/v1/auth/login) 登录。\n\n## B. sub2api jwt_auth 加 aggregator JWT fallback (cross-trust)\n\nmiddleware/jwt.rs:\n- JwtAuthState 加 `aggregator_admin_secret: Option<Arc<String>>`\n- jwt_auth 函数: sub2api signer decode 失败时, 若 aggregator secret 配\n  了, 用 HS256 + JWT_HMAC_SECRET 解 aggregator-core 签的 admin JWT\n  (claims: sub=''admin:RaphaelNY'', role=''admin'', exp)\n- try_decode_aggregator_admin: 仅当 role 严格 = ''admin'' 才接受;\n  构造 MgmtIdentity { user_id: 0 (service admin), role: Admin, sub, exp }\n  (admin/* scope 全局, 无 per-user join, user_id=0 安全)\n\nrouter.rs AppState: 加 `aggregator_admin_secret` field;\nbuild_router 把它传给 JwtAuthState.\n\nmain.rs: 读 `AGGREGATOR_JWT_HMAC_SECRET` env (空当 None);\n启动 log `aggregator_admin_jwt_trust=enabled|disabled`.\n\ncompose.r7.yml sub2api service: 加 env mapping\n`AGGREGATOR_JWT_HMAC_SECRET: ${JWT_HMAC_SECRET}` (跟 aggregator-core\n读的同一个 .env.r7 值, 自动同步).\n\n## C. 修 admin/accounts 400 (empty string param)\n\nrouter/admin.rs AccountListQuery:\n- group_id: Option<i64> → Option<String> + 手动 parse\n- 空字符串 (前端 ?group_id=) 当 None\n- 非空 + 非数字 → 400 with 友好 message\n- platform/status 已经是 Option<String>.filter(!empty) OK\n\n# 测试\n\n- lib test: 174 passed\n- e2e tests (router_e2e/auth_*/edge_cases/integration/cross_aggregator_proxy): all pass\n- benches compile clean\n- fmt + clippy: clean\n- vue-tsc typecheck: clean\n- pnpm build main-panel: ✓ built in 1.23s\n\n# 部署 plan\n\n1. rsync mac → VPS\n2. docker compose build sub2api + main-panel-frontend\n3. docker compose up -d sub2api main-panel-frontend recreate\n4. 验证 RaphaelNY login → 调 admin/accounts 返 200 + 10 items\n5. 验证 admin@raphaelny.net (sub2api user) 仍能 login 调 sub2api 用户\n   端点 (users/me, api-keys 等 — 不需要 admin scope)\n\n# 留 R10.3\n\nR10.2.8 是回滚 + 兼容 fix，长期方向 R10.3 待用户决定:\n- 维持双 auth 系统 (现状)：aggregator-core 是 panel admin auth, sub2api\n  是终端用户 auth, sub2api admin/* 通过 cross-trust 接受 aggregator JWT\n- 或合并到 aggregator-core: aggregator-core 加反向代理把 admin/* 转\n  发到 sub2api (service-to-service 信任)\n- 或合并到 sub2api: panel admin 改用 sub2api 用户 (R10.2.7 路径)","tree":{"sha":"7e9cc28a80e5adcabdf695592accd11c9825c679","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/7e9cc28a80e5adcabdf695592accd11c9825c679"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/e7b73328a7065b45e93679c3635af4f0854eb75b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/e7b73328a7065b45e93679c3635af4f0854eb75b","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKGU3YjczMzI4YTcwNjViNDVlOTM2NzljMzYzNWFmNGYwODU0ZWI3NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/7d17a86f0bfc80d54b9f65bd6ea98cf6d9484df6","sha":"7d17a86f0bfc80d54b9f65bd6ea98cf6d9484df6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/7d17a86f0bfc80d54b9f65bd6ea98cf6d9484df6"}],"sha":"e7b73328a7065b45e93679c3635af4f0854eb75b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/e7b73328a7065b45e93679c3635af4f0854eb75b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/7d17a86f0bfc80d54b9f65bd6ea98cf6d9484df6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T16:03:45Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T16:06:28Z","email":"109780307+RaphaelNY@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sqsleepy"},"message":"fix(R10.2.7): panel auth 迁到 sub2api + sub2api admin require_admin 修复\n\n# 现状根因（用户调 admin/accounts 看到 ''missing identity'' 401）\n\nR10.2 wave-2 + R10.2.6 hotfix 加了 sub2api admin endpoint 真实现 +\nrequire_admin layer，但有两个问题阻断了 panel 真用:\n\n1. sub2api **require_admin layer 用错了类型**:\n   - 我用 middleware/auth.rs::require_admin (检查 AuthIdentity)\n   - 但 mgmt plane 的 jwt_auth middleware 注入的是 MgmtIdentity\n   - 结果 admin/* 永远返 401 ''missing identity''\n   - 修法: 换用 middleware/jwt.rs::require_admin (同名但接受 MgmtIdentity)\n\n2. **panel 前端 auth 没迁** - panel stores/auth.ts 仍调 aggregator-core\n   /api/v1/auth/login（含 ADMIN_USERNAME=RaphaelNY 硬编码 bcrypt user），\n   admin views 调 sub2api admin/* 时却带的是 aggregator JWT，sub2api\n   的 jwt_auth 用的不是 aggregator HMAC secret 自然 reject。\n   修法: panel auth.ts 改调 sub2api.login + sub2api.getMe，老的\n   aggregator admin login 退役（aggregator-core service 现在已 stop）。\n\n# 改动\n\n## sub2api（修 1 行）\n\n### router.rs\n\n```diff\n-use crate::middleware::auth::{apikey_auth, require_admin, AuthState};\n+use crate::middleware::auth::{apikey_auth, AuthState};\n+use crate::middleware::jwt::require_admin;\n```\n\nmiddleware/auth.rs::require_admin 给 gateway plane (api_key 路径) 用，\n检查 AuthIdentity（key 解析后挂的 ext）。\nmiddleware/jwt.rs::require_admin 给 mgmt plane (JWT 路径) 用，检查\nMgmtIdentity（JWT 解码后挂的 ext）。\n\nadmin/* 在 mgmt plane 下，应该用 jwt.rs 那个。\n\n## panel frontend (5 文件)\n\n### stores/auth.ts\n\nlogin 调 `sub2api.login({email, password})` 取代\n`aggregator.adminLogin({username, password})`。\nhydrate 调 `sub2api.getMe()` 取代 `aggregator.me()`。\nAuthUser type 改 `sub2api.AuthUser`（id/email/username/role/balance/2fa）\n取代 `aggregator.AdminUser`（id/username/role）。\n注释更新解释 R10.2.7 迁移背景。\n\n### views/auth/Login.vue\n\n表单字段从 username → email：\n- type=''text'' autocomplete=''username'' → type=''email'' autocomplete=''email''\n- form initial.username → initial.email\n- form values.username → values.email\n- t(''auth.fields.username'') → t(''auth.fields.email'')\n- t(''auth.errors.usernameRequired'') → t(''auth.errors.emailRequired'')\n- data-testid ''login-username'' → ''login-email''\n\n### locales/zh-CN.json + en-US.json\n\n- auth.fields.username ''用户名''/Username → auth.fields.email ''邮箱''/Email\n- auth.errors.usernameRequired → auth.errors.emailRequired\n- invalidCredentials text 改 ''邮箱或密码错误''/''Email or password is incorrect''\n\n# 验证\n\n- vue-tsc typecheck: clean (no usage of usernameRequired remaining)\n- pnpm build main-panel: ✓ built in 1.27s\n- cargo build --release -p sub2api-rs --bins: ok\n- cargo fmt + clippy: clean\n\n# 部署\n\n1. rsync mac → VPS\n2. docker compose build sub2api + frontend\n3. docker compose up -d sub2api frontend recreate\n4. 用户 admin@raphaelny.net + RaphaelAdmin2026! 登录 panel\n5. 验证 API 网关-账号 看到 10 个 OAuth seed accounts (currently 0 group bound)\n\n# RaphaelNY 账号去哪了\n\naggregator-core /api/v1/auth/login 用的 ADMIN_USERNAME=RaphaelNY +\nADMIN_PASSWORD_BCRYPT 仍在 secrets/.env.r7（不删，但 aggregator-core\nservice 已 stop，没人调），R10.3 admin self-service 上线后随\naggregator-core 一并下线。","tree":{"sha":"de38b47c2083f00309d4b680aae468ffaef6b3de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/de38b47c2083f00309d4b680aae468ffaef6b3de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/7d17a86f0bfc80d54b9f65bd6ea98cf6d9484df6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/7d17a86f0bfc80d54b9f65bd6ea98cf6d9484df6","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKDdkMTdhODZmMGJmYzgwZDU0YjlmNjViZDZlYTk4Y2Y2ZDk0ODRkZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/3743ea4ff0a2c55d090cdd6cbbfcc063444dc9ef","sha":"3743ea4ff0a2c55d090cdd6cbbfcc063444dc9ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/3743ea4ff0a2c55d090cdd6cbbfcc063444dc9ef"}],"sha":"7d17a86f0bfc80d54b9f65bd6ea98cf6d9484df6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/7d17a86f0bfc80d54b9f65bd6ea98cf6d9484df6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/3743ea4ff0a2c55d090cdd6cbbfcc063444dc9ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T15:23:03Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T15:28:19Z","email":"109780307+RaphaelNY@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sqsleepy"},"message":"fix(R10.2.6): CORS credentials + admin/accounts GET + admin role guard + seed_admin_user\n\n# 现状\n\npanel SPA 前端 axios 配 withCredentials: true (cross-domain auth)，\n浏览器 CORS 规范要求 server 配 Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true\n否则 preflight reject。\n\nR10.2.5 hotfix 加了 CORS allow_origin/methods/headers 但漏了\nallow_credentials — 用户在前端调 /sub2api/api/admin/accounts 看到\n''preflight Access-Control-Allow-Credentials header is empty/不为 true''。\n\n同时发现安全 bug: admin/* 子树虽然挂在 JWT layer 后但**没挂\nrequire_admin** — 任何 logged-in user 都能调 admin endpoint\n(虽然全 stub)。\n\n# 改动 (4 件)\n\n## A. CORS allow_credentials (router.rs)\n\nbuild_cors_layer() 加 .allow_credentials(true)。\n安全: allow_origin 是显式 list (从不 ''*'')，浏览器同源策略仍然\ngate 哪些 origin 可读 response。\n\n## B. admin/accounts GET 真实现 (router/admin.rs)\n\nlist_accounts() handler 取代 stub:\n- Query params: platform | status | group_id | page | per_page\n- platform = anthropic | openai | gemini | antigravity (空跳过过滤)\n- status = active | error | disabled\n- group_id 走 INNER JOIN account_groups (空忽略 join)\n- pagination: page≥1, per_page 1-100 default 20\n- response: { items: AccountListItem[], total, page, per_page }\n- 19 字段含 schedulable / 频控状态 / session window 全暴露\n\n其他 admin endpoint (users / groups / redeem-codes / settings) 仍\n501 stub，留 R10.3 + Epic H 一并真实现。\n\n## C. admin/* 挂 require_admin layer (router.rs)\n\nlet admin_routes = admin::admin_router().layer(from_fn(require_admin));\n\n之前 admin_routes 只过 jwt_auth (任何 user role 可调)。补上\nrequire_admin (现已存在于 middleware/auth.rs:293) 强制 role=admin\n否则 403 forbidden。\n\n## D. seed_admin_user binary (src/bin/seed_admin_user.rs)\n\nOneoff binary 引导第一个 admin user，因为 R10.2 wave-2 没自动\n建 admin (R10.3 admin self-service 才有 admin user 招募流程)。\n\n模式仿 R10.1 seed_accounts.rs，复用容器 DATABASE_URL env，写\nsub2api_rs.users + auth_identities 两表。\n\n两种模式:\n- 创建模式: --email + --password (≥8 chars) + 可选 --username\n- 提升模式: --email + --promote (升级现有 user 为 admin + active +\n  verified_at COALESCE NOW)\n\nargon2 hash 用 sub2api_rs::auth::password::hash_password (跟 prod\nregister handler 同一函数，PHC 字符串完全兼容)。\n\nCargo.toml 加 [[bin]] seed_admin_user。\nDockerfile.sub2api-rs 加 COPY release/seed_admin_user。\n\n# 测试\n\nA+B+C 改 router.rs + admin.rs，用现 174 lib test 全过验证 (新增\nnest /admin layer 不破坏现 mock state e2e)。\n\nD 是 oneoff binary 不进 lib test，部署后真打验证。\n\n# 验证\n\ncargo fmt --all                                   clean\ncargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -D warnings  clean\ncargo test --workspace --lib --locked              174 passed (no regression)\ncargo build --release -p sub2api-rs --bins        ok (含 seed_admin_user)\n\n# 部署 plan\n\n1. rsync mac → VPS\n2. docker compose build sub2api (含新 seed_admin_user binary)\n3. docker compose up -d sub2api recreate\n4. 验证 CORS preflight 含 Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true\n5. docker compose exec sub2api seed_admin_user --email admin@raphaelny.net --password ''<plain>'' --username Admin\n6. 用户前端 login admin@raphaelny.net 看到 10 OAuth seed accounts","tree":{"sha":"22f0dc8605efcc8ebbf773c5f2abbfd15a14dbe7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/22f0dc8605efcc8ebbf773c5f2abbfd15a14dbe7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/3743ea4ff0a2c55d090cdd6cbbfcc063444dc9ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/3743ea4ff0a2c55d090cdd6cbbfcc063444dc9ef","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKDM3NDNlYTRmZjBhMmM1NWQwOTBjZGQ2Y2JiZmNjMDYzNDQ0ZGM5ZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/bfe1f009384ecc21864297ccafb7c4b1f829c74c","sha":"bfe1f009384ecc21864297ccafb7c4b1f829c74c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/bfe1f009384ecc21864297ccafb7c4b1f829c74c"}],"sha":"3743ea4ff0a2c55d090cdd6cbbfcc063444dc9ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/3743ea4ff0a2c55d090cdd6cbbfcc063444dc9ef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/bfe1f009384ecc21864297ccafb7c4b1f829c74c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T13:22:43Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T13:28:40Z","email":"109780307+RaphaelNY@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sqsleepy"},"message":"feat(R10.2 wave-2): refresh / forgot-reset / api-keys / users-me 真实现 + e2e\n\n按 R10.2_PLAN W2 + W2.5 全范围，9 OQ 全推荐项决议。Wave-2 完成\n所有 router 真实现 + testcontainers PG e2e 覆盖。\n\n# Router endpoints 真实现\n\n## auth.rs (4 新 + 1 改造)\n\n- POST /auth/refresh (FR-43, line 708)\n  OQ-3 决议: UPDATE allowlist SET revoked_at WHERE jti=$1 AND\n  revoked_at IS NULL; rows_affected==0 -> 410 already_rotated\n  防 replay/race。tx 内撤老 + sign 新 access+refresh pair + INSERT\n  新 allowlist 行。\n\n- POST /auth/forgot-password (FR-45 part 1, line 870)\n  OQ-4 决议 timing-safe: known/unknown email 同路径耗时 - sleep\n  rand 50-150ms 强制 + dummy PHC verify on unknown 路径。known\n  email 走 PasswordResetToken::generate(user_id, 1h TTL) 入库\n  hash, send raw token via email link。总返 200 防 enumeration。\n\n- POST /auth/reset-password (FR-45 part 2, line 966)\n  hash_raw(body.token) 反查 password_reset_tokens FOR UPDATE，\n  验 not used + not expired。tx 内: UPDATE users.password_hash +\n  UPDATE auth_identities.verified_at + DELETE all refresh\n  allowlist for user (防钓鱼后老 refresh) + UPDATE token used_at。\n\n- POST /auth/login (FR-42 残留补丁, line 518)\n  unknown-email 路径调 verify_password_dummy() 走 argon2 timing\n  与 wrong-password 路径对齐，防 enumeration。\n\n## users.rs (7 endpoint)\n\n- GET /users/me/profile (line 245)\n- GET /users/me/api-keys (line 286) - list 当前 user 的 active keys\n- POST /users/me/api-keys (line 348) - mint sub_<32 base62> + SHA-256 hash\n  + key_prefix + last_4，plaintext 仅本次返\n- DELETE /users/me/api-keys/{id} (line 404) - soft-delete (deleted_at)，\n  cross-user 404 防 enumeration\n- GET /users/me/usage (line 440) - group_by day | model，from/to 范围\n- GET /users/me/subscriptions (line 559) - 当前 active subscriptions\n- GET /users/me/balance (line 601) - 直返 users.balance (OQ-5)\n\n# Middleware\n\n## middleware/auth.rs::PgApiKeyResolver (W2.R2)\n\n扩 SELECT JOIN user_subscriptions (active + non-expired only)\n填 group_ids，gateway-plane scheduler 才能 scope account\nselection。\n\n# Router 挂载 (router.rs)\n\n- /sub2api/api/auth/* 包 ip_rate_limit middleware (DEFAULT_PREAUTH_RPM=5)\n  per IP per minute。429 envelope code=rate_limited + Retry-After。\n- /sub2api/api/users/me/* 全挂在 mgmt JWT layer 后\n\n# E2E (W2.5, 3 new binary, 全 #[ignore=\"needs docker\"])\n\n## auth_refresh_e2e.rs (225 行, 4 case)\n\n- happy rotation: refresh -> 新 access+refresh pair, 老 jti revoked\n- replay attack: 同 refresh 二次用 -> 410 already_rotated\n- garbage token: -> 401\n- disabled user: status=disabled -> 401\n\n## auth_password_reset_e2e.rs (341 行, 8 case)\n\n- known email -> token 入库 + email mock 抓到 link\n- unknown email -> 总 200 + 不入库 + email mock 不抓\n- both 路径耗时 ≈ (timing-safe 验证)\n- token 用一次 -> used_at 写\n- reset-password 后该 user 全 refresh allowlist 撤\n- 重用老 token -> 401\n- 过期 token -> 401\n- short password -> 422\n- unknown token -> 401\n\n## users_api_keys_e2e.rs (283 行, 5 case)\n\n- POST mint: 返 plaintext + DB 存 hash 不存原文\n- DELETE soft-delete: status=active 改 deleted, deleted_at NOT NULL\n- cross-user 404: alice 删 bob 的 key -> 404 (而非 403, 防 enumeration)\n- list scoped: alice list 只见自己的 active keys\n- JWT required: 缺 Authorization -> 401\n\n# Email mock\n\nemail/mock.rs: 加 clear() 方法让 multi-step e2e 抓 email 前能清空\n之前 capture。\n\n# 验证\n\n- cargo fmt --all (修了 4 处 agent 留的 fmt 不一致)\n- cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -D warnings: clean\n- cargo test --workspace --lib --locked: 174 passed (+5 from 169)\n- cargo test --workspace --tests --locked: 0 passed 5 ignored\n  (testcontainers e2e 需 docker，本地 cargo test 不跑)\n\n# File diff\n\n8 files: 5 modified + 3 new\n+1177 / -74\n\n- router/users.rs +722 行 (扩 7 endpoint 真实现)\n- router/auth.rs +464 行 (refresh + forgot/reset 真实现)\n- router.rs +21/-some (挂 ip_rate_limit + 路由)\n- middleware/auth.rs +35 (PgApiKeyResolver group_ids JOIN)\n- email/mock.rs +9 (clear())\n- 3 new e2e binary 共 849 行\n\n# 部署待跑\n\nprod 跑这版需要:\n- 0014 password_reset_tokens migration 自动跑\n- 0015 api_keys schema 迁移自动跑 (key -> key_hash + prefix + last_4)\n- prod 现 0 行 api_keys (R9.5 InMemoryApiKeyResolver)，迁移无损\n- 现 10 行 OAuth seed accounts 不受 0014/0015 影响 (accounts 表)","tree":{"sha":"1abba5984c7f24cbf4acf9c12cf2b228af9f1c3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/1abba5984c7f24cbf4acf9c12cf2b228af9f1c3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/bfe1f009384ecc21864297ccafb7c4b1f829c74c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/bfe1f009384ecc21864297ccafb7c4b1f829c74c","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKGJmZTFmMDA5Mzg0ZWNjMjE4NjQyOTdjY2FmYjdjNGIxZjgyOWM3NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/6775f2cdd431a14de4b4ac268d65cca627378eeb","sha":"6775f2cdd431a14de4b4ac268d65cca627378eeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/6775f2cdd431a14de4b4ac268d65cca627378eeb"}],"sha":"bfe1f009384ecc21864297ccafb7c4b1f829c74c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/bfe1f009384ecc21864297ccafb7c4b1f829c74c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/6775f2cdd431a14de4b4ac268d65cca627378eeb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T12:41:42Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T12:46:25Z","email":"109780307+RaphaelNY@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sqsleepy"},"message":"chore(ci): 只 PR 触发 + workflow_dispatch 手动，去掉 main push\n\n# 现状\n\nci.yml + secret-scan.yml 之前都配 ''push: branches: [main]'' +\n''pull_request:''。每次 PR squash merge 到 main 后 main HEAD 上\n那个 commit 触发 push event，重跑一遍 CI — 跟 PR 跑过的 100%\n重复（squash merge commit 跟 PR HEAD diff 一致），白白消耗\nGitHub Actions 配额。\n\n最近 30 run 看 14 push（全 main squash merge）+ 16 pull_request。\npush 那 14 个全是冗余。\n\n# 改动\n\n- 去掉两个 workflow 的 ''push: branches: [main]'' 触发\n- 加 ''workflow_dispatch:'' 手动触发兜底（main 上需 ad-hoc 跑\n  CI 时手动点 Actions UI Run）\n\n# 收益\n\n- CI 配额 ~50% 节省（push event 全去掉）\n- main 上 build status 由最后 merged PR 的 PR run 决定（GitHub\n  Actions ''Latest run on main'' 仍可见）\n\n# Trade-offs\n\n- main HEAD 不再 self-validate — 如果 PR base 不是 main 最新\n  HEAD，merge 后 main 状态可能跟 PR 跑的不一致。缓解：开\n  branch protection ''Require branches to be up to date before\n  merging'' (GitHub Settings → Branches)\n- workflow_dispatch 兜底，如果发现 main 损坏可手动跑\n\n# 关闭 push trigger 后的验证\n\n本 PR 自身 push 到 chore/ci-pr-only-trigger 分支不会触发 CI\n(branches[main] 限定 PR base = main)，但开 PR 后会触发 PR run。","tree":{"sha":"c2c049f6df06c11f303e50ea800c95df7d4a2d4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/c2c049f6df06c11f303e50ea800c95df7d4a2d4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/6775f2cdd431a14de4b4ac268d65cca627378eeb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/6775f2cdd431a14de4b4ac268d65cca627378eeb","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKDY3NzVmMmNkZDQzMWExNGRlNGI0YWMyNjhkNjVjY2E2MjczNzhlZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/9934fd42ab22a85007b078e15416994026ada325","sha":"9934fd42ab22a85007b078e15416994026ada325","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/9934fd42ab22a85007b078e15416994026ada325"}],"sha":"6775f2cdd431a14de4b4ac268d65cca627378eeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/6775f2cdd431a14de4b4ac268d65cca627378eeb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/9934fd42ab22a85007b078e15416994026ada325/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T12:12:14Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T12:41:51Z","email":"109780307+RaphaelNY@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sqsleepy"},"message":"feat(R10.2 wave-1): DB infra + crypto + 限流 + email 模板\n\n按 R10.2_PLAN W1 范围 + 9 OQ 全推荐项决议。Wave-1 不动 router 真\n实现 (refresh / forgot-password / reset-password / api-keys CRUD\n留 wave-2)，仅落 DB schema + helper + entity + middleware factory。\n\n# Migrations\n\n- 0014_password_reset_tokens.sql:\n  token_hash BYTEA UNIQUE (SHA-256, 不存原 token 防 DB 泄露)，\n  1h TTL，used_at 一次性，partial idx on active per user。\n\n- 0015_api_keys_hash_migration.sql:\n  api_keys 从 plaintext 迁移到 hash-at-rest。加 key_hash BYTEA +\n  key_prefix VARCHAR(8) + last_4 VARCHAR(4)；用 pgcrypto digest()\n  backfill；DROP 老 key 列 + UNIQUE INDEX；新 partial idx on\n  (user_id, status) WHERE deleted_at IS NULL。\n\n# Entities\n\n- password_reset_token.rs: sea-orm Model + Model::generate(user_id,\n  ttl)→(raw_hex, model)，hash_raw / is_expired / is_used /\n  is_valid helpers。32-byte OsRng→64 char hex；SHA-256→BYTEA。\n  6 unit tests。\n\n- api_key.rs: drop pub key: String，加 key_hash: Vec<u8> +\n  key_prefix + last_4 对齐新 schema。\n\n# Crypto / auth\n\n- verify_password_dummy(): once_cell Lazy<String> 冷启动 hash 一次\n  实 PHC，后续 verify 走真 argon2 timing 但永远 false。defeat\n  user-not-found enumeration。\n- sleep_jitter(): rand 50-150ms，I/O 分支 timing 差防御。\n- 4 new unit tests。\n\n# Rate limit\n\n- RpmScope::Ip(IpAddr) 变体，key ''ip:<addr>''。Display + Hash 全\n  variant 覆盖。2 tests。\n- middleware/rate_limit.rs: IpRateLimitState + ip_rate_limit axum\n  middleware factory。读 ConnectInfo<SocketAddr>，调 limiter\n  RpmScope::Ip。Limited→429 envelope (code=rate_limited,\n  Retry-After header, details.retry_after_sec)；Backend→500。\n  DEFAULT_PREAUTH_RPM=5 (5 req/min/IP)。ConnectInfo 缺失 pass-through\n  (test/proxy edge case)。3 tests 含 scripted-mock backend-failure。\n\n# Email\n\n- render_password_reset 真模板 zh-CN + en-US plain text，''1 小时''/\n  ''1 hour'' wording 锁定与 W2 RESET_TOKEN_TTL 一致。3 tests\n  (subject/link/no HTML)。删旧 ''TemplateNotImplemented'' test。\n- email/mock.rs: password_reset 现 captured；unimplemented-kinds\n  test 切到 balance_low。\n\n# PgApiKeyResolver\n\n- middleware/auth.rs: 加 PgApiKeyResolver impl ApiKeyResolver\n  trait。SHA-256 inbound key→key_hash，单 JOIN users 一次返\n  (api_key_id, user_id, role)。filter: key_hash= AND\n  deleted_at IS NULL AND status=''active'' AND (expires_at IS\n  NULL OR expires_at > NOW())。\n- 不缓存 (OQ-2 推荐项)，trait 窄留 R12 加 Redis cache <100 LOC。\n- group_ids: vec![] 暂留 (W2 扩 JOIN account_groups)。\n- unknown role 当 resolver fail 防静默 priv drop。\n\n# Cargo deps\n\nsha2 = ''0.10''  (token hashing)\nonce_cell = ''1.19''  (lazy dummy PHC)\n版本对齐 cf-monitor / server-mgr。\n\n# 关键设计偏离\n\nR10.2_PLAN §2.1 写 token_hash 用 VARCHAR(64) hex，本实施改 BYTEA\n节省 32 字节/行 + 原生 pgcrypto + 二进制 equality predicate。\n迁移 comment 标注。\n\n# 验证\n\n- cargo fmt --all --check: clean\n- cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings: clean\n- cargo test --workspace --lib: 169 passed (+16 from 152)\n  (6 entity / 3 password / 2 RpmScope::Ip / 3 rate_limit / 3\n  password_reset template / 1 mock rewritten / -1 stub)\n- cargo test --workspace --tests: 全绿，auth_*_e2e + router_e2e\n  无回归\n\n# 留 W2 的事\n\n- ip_rate_limit factory 由 W2 .layer() 挂 auth_routes 子树\n- PgApiKeyResolver 扩 JOIN account_groups 填 group_ids\n- password-reset handler 用 generate(...) mint (raw, model)，\n  persist model，send raw via EmailProvider，drop raw；\n  reset-password 用 hash_raw 反查\n- W2 才引入真 router 端点 + JWT layer 顺序设计","tree":{"sha":"7724049482d1f4cd409283ad70ed4e1e2c98b5df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/7724049482d1f4cd409283ad70ed4e1e2c98b5df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/9934fd42ab22a85007b078e15416994026ada325","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/9934fd42ab22a85007b078e15416994026ada325","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKDk5MzRmZDQyYWIyMmE4NTAwN2IwNzhlMTU0MTY5OTQwMjZhZGEzMjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/c4b1d4cc22708a060173df289bf74462235aac36","sha":"c4b1d4cc22708a060173df289bf74462235aac36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/c4b1d4cc22708a060173df289bf74462235aac36"}],"sha":"9934fd42ab22a85007b078e15416994026ada325","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/9934fd42ab22a85007b078e15416994026ada325"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/c4b1d4cc22708a060173df289bf74462235aac36/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T11:43:05Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T11:50:34Z","email":"109780307+RaphaelNY@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sqsleepy"},"message":"docs(v0.3): Epic H Admin 管理端用户故事补充\n\n范围：USER_STORIES.md 末尾追加 Epic H — Admin 管理端，10 故事 + R10.3\n启动前 5 个关键决策 OQ。+264 行。\n\n10 故事 / FR-90..FR-99：\n- H-1 用户管理（FR-90 / M）：列表/搜索/状态切/手工充值/强制改密/强制踢出\n- H-2 上游账号 CRUD + health dashboard（FR-91 / M）：含 0004_accounts.sql 8 个\n  health 字段（rate_limited_at/overload_until/session_window 等）+ import/export\n- H-3 群组管理（FR-92 / M）：groups CRUD + account_groups 多对多 + 订阅迁移\n- H-4 卡密 + 充值审核（FR-93 / M）：批量生成 / 列表 / 银行转账 mark-paid\n  / 退款审（D-3 / D-5 admin 视角拓展）\n- H-5 全局 usage 统计（FR-94 / M）：summary / top-users / top-accounts /\n  top-models / timeseries / CSV 导出\n- H-6 渠道健康 dashboard（FR-95 / M）：overview / scheduler-state / 告警\n  触发；polling vs SSE 入 OQ-5\n- H-7 套餐 admin CRUD（FR-96 / M）：引用 E-7 + 追加订阅记录管理\n- H-8 系统配置（FR-97 / S）：settings 表 UI + model_pricing 表格编辑\n  + secret 隐藏（OQ-4 决策）\n- H-9 操作审计（FR-98 / M）：admin_audit_logs schema + INSERT-only +\n  before/after diff + 90d 导出\n- H-10 紧急功能（FR-99 / S）：force-logout-all / maintenance mode /\n  unmount-account / revoke-keys-by-user，全双确认 + 强发邮件\n\n与现 Epic 关系：\n- D-3 银行转账：admin 视角下沉到 H-4（mark-paid 端点）\n- D-5 退款：admin 视角下沉到 H-4（refund-requests 审）\n- E-7 套餐 CRUD：H-7 显式引用并追加订阅记录管理（不重复定义）\n- A-6 找回密码：H-1 复用邮件流程\n- C-3 / C-4 trace + CSV：H-5 在 admin scope 复用\n- C-7 model_pricing：H-8 提供 admin 编辑入口\n\nR10.3 启动前 5 个 OQ：\n- OQ-1 admin 角色：users.role enum vs 独立 admin_users 表（推荐 A）\n- OQ-2 admin 强制 2FA：必开 vs 敏感操作邮件确认（推荐 A，R10.4 完工）\n- OQ-3 admin SPA：panel.../admin 同站 vs admin.raphaelny.net 子域（推荐 B）\n- OQ-4 audit_logs 存哪：PG INSERT-only vs 独立 schema vs S3 append-only（推荐 A）\n- OQ-5 健康 dashboard：polling vs SSE vs hybrid（推荐 v0.3 polling，v0.4 hybrid）\n\n不动其他 epic。Epic A-G + 文档 + 横切 + 优先级汇总段保持原状。","tree":{"sha":"6977d856fd6f894099db1c20e16d9f2c1972c9ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/6977d856fd6f894099db1c20e16d9f2c1972c9ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/c4b1d4cc22708a060173df289bf74462235aac36","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/c4b1d4cc22708a060173df289bf74462235aac36","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKGM0YjFkNGNjMjI3MDhhMDYwMTczZGYyODliZjc0NDYyMjM1YWFjMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/1b5fec4cd617611e34e6d62b2cbad0bfb776410f","sha":"1b5fec4cd617611e34e6d62b2cbad0bfb776410f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/1b5fec4cd617611e34e6d62b2cbad0bfb776410f"}],"sha":"c4b1d4cc22708a060173df289bf74462235aac36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/c4b1d4cc22708a060173df289bf74462235aac36"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/1b5fec4cd617611e34e6d62b2cbad0bfb776410f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T11:41:34Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T11:50:12Z","email":"109780307+RaphaelNY@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sqsleepy"},"message":"fix(R10.2.5): sub2api CORS + caddy /sub2api/api/* 拆分\n\nR10.2.5 hotfix — admin views 在 panel.raphaelny.net 显示 ''network\nerror''，刷新后 410 Gone 的根因诊断 + 修复。\n\n# 症状\n\npanel SPA 加载于 core.raphaelny.net，调 sub2api.raphaelny.net 的\nmgmt API：\n1. 浏览器 CORS preflight OPTIONS 命中 sub2api → 401 但缺\n   Access-Control-Allow-Origin → 浏览器拦报 ''network error''\n2. 用户 F5 刷新 /sub2api/accounts 等 SPA 路由 → caddy 全\n   /sub2api/* 拦 410 → SPA shell 加载不出来，看到 ''Gone'' 文本\n\n# 修 1: sub2api CORS layer (router.rs)\n\nbuild_router 末尾加 build_cors_layer() helper，allow:\n- https://core.raphaelny.net (主 origin)\n- https://panel.raphaelny.net (将来子域)\n- https://sub2api.raphaelny.net (自打)\n- http://localhost:5173 / 4173 (vite dev / preview)\n- CORS_EXTRA_ORIGINS env (CSV) — staging 可加临时\n\nmethods: GET POST PUT PATCH DELETE OPTIONS\nheaders: Authorization Content-Type Accept Accept-Language X-Trace-Id X-Request-Id\nexpose: X-Trace-Id X-Request-Id (前端 telemetry)\nmax-age: 600s (preflight 缓存 10 min)\n\n显式 origin list 不用 wildcard — credentials / Bearer 共存场景安全\n默认。\n\n# 修 2: caddy /sub2api/api/* 才 410 (Caddyfile)\n\nR9.2 deprecation handle 拆成两半：\n- /sub2api/api/* → 410 + Link header (跨域客户端 / curl\n  迁移提示，原意保留)\n- /sub2api/* (非 API SPA 路径) → 落 default frontend handle\n  (main-panel-frontend nginx fallback /index.html)\n\n让 F5 刷新 /sub2api/accounts /groups /subscriptions /usage /redeem\n等 SPA 路由能拿到 SPA shell 而非 410 文本页。\n\n# 验证\n\ncargo build -p sub2api-rs --release: OK\ncargo fmt --all: clean\ncargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings: clean\ncargo test -p sub2api-rs --lib: 152 passed\ncargo test -p sub2api-rs --test router_e2e: 13 passed\n\n# 部署需要\n\nrsync mac → VPS + rebuild sub2api 镜像 + caddy reload (caddy\n不需 rebuild，热 reload Caddyfile 即可)。下次 deploy 一并跑。","tree":{"sha":"39f27cfc505109092a2f7c747161713d66ebfcc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/39f27cfc505109092a2f7c747161713d66ebfcc3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/1b5fec4cd617611e34e6d62b2cbad0bfb776410f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/1b5fec4cd617611e34e6d62b2cbad0bfb776410f","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKDFiNWZlYzRjZDYxNzYxMWUzNGU2ZDYyYjJjYmFkMGJmYjc3NjQxMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/a1a4391ffc409eacdc8a021c74adfcc14b17dc64","sha":"a1a4391ffc409eacdc8a021c74adfcc14b17dc64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/a1a4391ffc409eacdc8a021c74adfcc14b17dc64"}],"sha":"1b5fec4cd617611e34e6d62b2cbad0bfb776410f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/1b5fec4cd617611e34e6d62b2cbad0bfb776410f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/a1a4391ffc409eacdc8a021c74adfcc14b17dc64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T11:30:23Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T11:44:52Z","email":"109780307+RaphaelNY@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sqsleepy"},"message":"docs(R10.2): plan + 9 决策点（refresh / forgot-reset / 限流 / api-keys / users-me / timing-safe）\n\nR10.2 sub-round 草稿计划：把 R10.1_PLAN §6 预告 + R10.1 残留补丁拆 6 项主线\n（FR-43 refresh / FR-45 forgot-reset / FR-46 限流 / FR-49-51 api-keys 自助 /\nusers-me 真实现 / login timing-safe）落到 4 wave + 5 闸门。\n\n§7 列 9 个待用户裁决决策点：\n- OQ-1 api-keys 命名前缀（推荐 sub_）\n- OQ-2 PgApiKeyResolver 缓存策略（推荐 c 不缓存，量小）\n- OQ-3 refresh 旋转 race（推荐 b UPDATE 行数判定）\n- OQ-4 forgot timing-safe 实现（推荐 c dummy PHC + sleep）\n- OQ-5 balance 端点 + Settings unit price（推荐 b 直返 users.balance）\n- OQ-6 api-keys admin override 是否本波（推荐 a 仅 self-service）\n- OQ-7 refresh 是否在 JWT layer 后（推荐 b 标准 OAuth pre-auth）\n- OQ-8 老 access 是否同步失效（推荐 b 自然 exp）\n- OQ-9 api_keys.key hash vs plain（推荐 a 本波迁 hash）\n\n不含实施代码，仅 docs/v0.3/R10.2_PLAN.md 一个新文件。","tree":{"sha":"7df68e7885f8654b52914edca737e5eb79b8f2c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/7df68e7885f8654b52914edca737e5eb79b8f2c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/a1a4391ffc409eacdc8a021c74adfcc14b17dc64","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/a1a4391ffc409eacdc8a021c74adfcc14b17dc64","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKGExYTQzOTFmZmM0MDllYWNkYzhhMDIxYzc0YWRmY2MxNGIxN2RjNjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/ded154aa1370bc7f35c74b9ac3aae5ae3d5d9eb3","sha":"ded154aa1370bc7f35c74b9ac3aae5ae3d5d9eb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/ded154aa1370bc7f35c74b9ac3aae5ae3d5d9eb3"}],"sha":"a1a4391ffc409eacdc8a021c74adfcc14b17dc64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/a1a4391ffc409eacdc8a021c74adfcc14b17dc64"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/ded154aa1370bc7f35c74b9ac3aae5ae3d5d9eb3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T11:03:35Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T11:11:23Z","email":"109780307+RaphaelNY@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sqsleepy"},"message":"fix(R10.1 deploy): Dockerfile 漏 COPY seed_accounts binary\n\nPR #19 commit 387449a 把 cargo build 改成 --bins（产出\nseed_accounts binary），但 runtime stage 只有一行 COPY\nsub2api-rs，漏了 COPY seed_accounts。结果镜像 build 成功\n但运行时 /usr/local/bin/seed_accounts 不存在。\n\n是我 wave Edit 链中 sys 报 ''File has not been read yet''\n那次 edit 失败但没注意到的 fallout。\n\n补一行 COPY 修复，单独 hotfix PR 走 main。","tree":{"sha":"a2259c314f560b927b072fe52690ffdf19241d60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/a2259c314f560b927b072fe52690ffdf19241d60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/ded154aa1370bc7f35c74b9ac3aae5ae3d5d9eb3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/ded154aa1370bc7f35c74b9ac3aae5ae3d5d9eb3","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKGRlZDE1NGFhMTM3MGJjN2YzNWM3NGI5YWMzYWFlNWFlM2Q1ZDllYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/387449a6275be3770dd50eadeee4fbbcea6fc09d","sha":"387449a6275be3770dd50eadeee4fbbcea6fc09d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/387449a6275be3770dd50eadeee4fbbcea6fc09d"}],"sha":"ded154aa1370bc7f35c74b9ac3aae5ae3d5d9eb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/ded154aa1370bc7f35c74b9ac3aae5ae3d5d9eb3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/387449a6275be3770dd50eadeee4fbbcea6fc09d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T10:27:37Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T10:55:37Z","email":"109780307+RaphaelNY@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sqsleepy"},"message":"feat(R10.1 deploy): seed_accounts oneoff binary\n\nR10.3 admin endpoint 接通前，号池 seed 走 SQL 直插 + sub2api 自己\n的 CredentialCipher 加密 credentials JSONB。配合 BASE_URL env\n落地一并部署。\n\n# crates/sub2api-rs/src/bin/seed_accounts.rs\n\n新 binary 读 sub2api 账号 export json（schema：{exported_at,\naccounts: [{name, platform, type, credentials, extra,\nconcurrency, priority, rate_multiplier, auto_pause_on_expired,\nnotes}]}）→ AES-256-GCM 加密 credentials → INSERT accounts。\n\n复用容器自身 DATABASE_URL / ACCOUNT_CREDENTIAL_KEY env，因此\n跑在 sub2api 容器内（docker compose exec sub2api seed_accounts\n/tmp/json）。\n\nCLI 选项：\n- --dry-run：只解析 JSON，不连 DB，不 encrypt\n- --clean-platform <p>：先 soft-delete 该 platform 全部旧行\n  再 INSERT（重跑场景；deleted_at = NOW() 可手动恢复）\n\n幂等性：accounts 表无 (platform, name) UNIQUE 约束（同邮箱多个\nOAuth session 是合法形态），所以 binary 不做 SELECT EXISTS 检查\n直接 INSERT。重跑会复制行，需先清就用 --clean-platform。\n\n# Cargo.toml\n\n加第二个 [[bin]] entry seed_accounts。\n\n# Dockerfile.sub2api-rs\n\ncargo build --bin sub2api-rs → --bins，让 multi-stage runtime\nCOPY 时把 seed_accounts 也带出。runtime 多 +9MB（release 优化\n+ tokio + sqlx 共享 lib 不重复 strip）。\n\n# 自验\n\n- cargo build -p sub2api-rs --bins --release：OK\n- cargo fmt --all：clean\n- cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings：clean\n- cargo test --workspace --lib：152 passed\n- ACCOUNT_CREDENTIAL_KEY=<random> ./seed_accounts <real json>\n  --dry-run：10 行 OAuth ChatGPT 账号全识别（同 email 多 session\n  各算独立行）\n\n# R10.3 退役计划\n\nR10.3 admin 子树（/sub2api/api/admin/accounts POST）接通后：\n- 把 seed_accounts.rs 删除\n- Cargo.toml 拿掉 [[bin]] seed_accounts\n- Dockerfile.sub2api-rs 改回 --bin sub2api-rs","tree":{"sha":"df11da002e6376dae3e6285b52c460b6a97773ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/df11da002e6376dae3e6285b52c460b6a97773ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/387449a6275be3770dd50eadeee4fbbcea6fc09d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_u