users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/dae37c5ceb16c45e8598886c527dedeab1e7c8e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T02:50:17Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T02:50:17Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"message":"feat(R8.5-Polish-B): Landing 打磨 — ParticleBg perf + ArchDiagram 重画 + LiveStats 真数据 + a11y\n\nR8.3-2b Landing 第一版 fly. R8.5 Polish B 完善:\n\nui-kit/primitives:\n- ParticleBg.vue: DOM N particles → 1 <canvas> + RAF main loop. 硬上限\n  80 桌面 / 40 移动 (< 768px). visibilitychange 暂停 (页面 blur 不烧 CPU).\n  IntersectionObserver out 暂停. prefers-reduced-motion 退化静态 SVG 星点.\n  早期 bbox 退出 (canvas 不在 viewport).\n- GradientMesh.vue: intensity 默认 0.35 → 0.3, watch reduced-motion 不漂移\n- ScrollReveal.vue: IntersectionObserver fallback (不支持时直接 reveal),\n  reduced-motion 时不上 transform 直接 opacity:1.\n\nmain-panel landing:\n- ArchDiagram.vue 重画: 中心 hub (玻璃 SVG circle + glow) + 4 spokes 到\n  sub2api / server-mgr / cf-monitor / main-panel-frontend, 每端 hover/focus\n  glow, dashed flow line + stroke-dashoffset CSS animation, legend 含 4 端\n  描述, role=''img'' + aria-label 全描述给屏幕阅读器.\n- LiveStatsStrip.vue: 4 tile 接 R8.5-A 真 endpoint shape:\n  Services {online}/{total} + Nodes {online}/{total} + Zones {total} + DNS records.\n  aria-live=''polite'' 实时变化通报.\n- HeroSection / FeaturesSection / LandingNav / LandingFooter: a11y 全 (skip\n  link → #main, aria-label=''Primary'' nav, hero h1 aria-live=meta, features\n  ul role=list + sr-only desc, footer role=contentinfo).\n- LandingLayout: skip link + 全局 :focus-visible 加品牌 outline.\n- public-stats.ts: PublicStats 扩 servicesDegraded/Offline/Pending +\n  nodesOnline + dnsRecords (R8.5-A endpoint shape). R8.4 endpoint 仅返\n  services 时仍 work (optional 字段缺失退 mock baseline).\n\ni18n: zh-CN + en-US 加 ~12 keys (skipToMain / aria 描述等).\n\ntypecheck + build 全绿.\n\nRound: 8.5 (Polish B)","tree":{"sha":"bb23215d3b884ebd5f08cc5a0fef48197ece9ef3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/bb23215d3b884ebd5f08cc5a0fef48197ece9ef3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/dae37c5ceb16c45e8598886c527dedeab1e7c8e7","verification":{"payload":"tree bb23215d3b884ebd5f08cc5a0fef48197ece9ef3\nparent 73a2cc2394bb16db4d482c542e954ce4a4b577a0\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779418217 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779418217 +0800\n\nfeat(R8.5-Polish-B): Landing 打磨 — ParticleBg perf + ArchDiagram 重画 + LiveStats 真数据 + a11y\n\nR8.3-2b Landing 第一版 fly. R8.5 Polish B 完善:\n\nui-kit/primitives:\n- ParticleBg.vue: DOM N particles → 1 <canvas> + RAF main loop. 硬上限\n  80 桌面 / 40 移动 (< 768px). visibilitychange 暂停 (页面 blur 不烧 CPU).\n  IntersectionObserver out 暂停. prefers-reduced-motion 退化静态 SVG 星点.\n  早期 bbox 退出 (canvas 不在 viewport).\n- GradientMesh.vue: intensity 默认 0.35 → 0.3, watch reduced-motion 不漂移\n- ScrollReveal.vue: IntersectionObserver fallback (不支持时直接 reveal),\n  reduced-motion 时不上 transform 直接 opacity:1.\n\nmain-panel landing:\n- ArchDiagram.vue 重画: 中心 hub (玻璃 SVG circle + glow) + 4 spokes 到\n  sub2api / server-mgr / cf-monitor / main-panel-frontend, 每端 hover/focus\n  glow, dashed flow line + stroke-dashoffset CSS animation, legend 含 4 端\n  描述, role=''img'' + aria-label 全描述给屏幕阅读器.\n- LiveStatsStrip.vue: 4 tile 接 R8.5-A 真 endpoint shape:\n  Services {online}/{total} + Nodes {online}/{total} + Zones {total} + DNS records.\n  aria-live=''polite'' 实时变化通报.\n- HeroSection / FeaturesSection / LandingNav / LandingFooter: a11y 全 (skip\n  link → #main, aria-label=''Primary'' nav, hero h1 aria-live=meta, features\n  ul role=list + sr-only desc, footer role=contentinfo).\n- LandingLayout: skip link + 全局 :focus-visible 加品牌 outline.\n- public-stats.ts: PublicStats 扩 servicesDegraded/Offline/Pending +\n  nodesOnline + dnsRecords (R8.5-A endpoint shape). R8.4 endpoint 仅返\n  services 时仍 work (optional 字段缺失退 mock baseline).\n\ni18n: zh-CN + en-US 加 ~12 keys (skipToMain / aria 描述等).\n\ntypecheck + build 全绿.\n\nRound: 8.5 (Polish B)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQS347Yge2mOrQHQJpAfJYZ9Ahsw8AUCag/EaQAKCRAfJYZ9Ahsw\n8GG5AP0TFg3HObfEujb2juVC/Qa8itzJnuVSA/GJ4yI2vLCuRgEA4stn3xBNMpgp\nNEXb85dggVxGC/z6WYnZxJ83XhrSRQA=\n=+dII\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-22T02:50:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.