3b2e319","sha":"e4fb46588826ff5d3dae831911f66507e3b2e319","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/e4fb46588826ff5d3dae831911f66507e3b2e319"}],"sha":"73a2cc2394bb16db4d482c542e954ce4a4b577a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/73a2cc2394bb16db4d482c542e954ce4a4b577a0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/e4fb46588826ff5d3dae831911f66507e3b2e319/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T02:50:16Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T02:50:16Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"message":"feat(R8.5-A): public stats endpoint 扩展 — services + nodes + zones + dns_records\n\nR8.4 加 /api/v1/public/stats 仅含 services counts. Landing LiveStatsStrip 还\nmock nodes / zones / dns_records 三项. R8.5-A 让 4 项全部真数据.\n\n设计: 3 db 独立 (panel / server_mgr / cf_monitor), aggregator-core 不直连\n跨库; 走 cross-service http call 到子服务公开端点.\n\n新增端点 (no auth, 仅返 counts):\n- server-mgr GET /public/counts: {nodes: {total, online}}\n  online 定义 = last_heartbeat_at > NOW() - heartbeat_interval_sec * heartbeat_timeout_degraded_periods\n  仅 NOT archived, 不含归档节点.\n- cf-monitor GET /public/counts: {zones: {total, dns_records}}\n  COUNT(*) FROM cf_zones / cf_dns_records (~10s rows / ~100s rows, < 5ms 即使冷)\n\naggregator-core /api/v1/public/stats 扩展:\n- 加 NodesSummary { total, online } + ZonesSummary { total, dns_records }\n- 遍历 registry.list() 收 services counts 同时记 server-mgr / cf-monitor\n  endpoint (仅 Online state)\n- tokio::join! 并发 fetch, 1500ms timeout, 失败/4xx/解析错均退 None\n- 字段加 #[serde(skip_serializing_if = \"Option::is_none\")] — 上游断点\n  时返回不含该 section, frontend 自动退 mock baseline.\n\n实证 (R8.5 deploy 后):\n  curl https://core.raphaelny.net/api/v1/public/stats →\n  {\n    \"services\": { \"total\": 2, \"online\": 2, ... },\n    \"nodes\":    { \"total\": 0, \"online\": 0 },\n    \"zones\":    { \"total\": 3, \"dns_records\": 9 },\n    \"schema_version\": \"1.0\"\n  }\n  Landing LiveStatsStrip 从 mock 切到真数据 (zones/dns_records 真; nodes 因\n  暂无节点注册 0/0).\n\nRound: 8.5-A","tree":{"sha":"4842089769dd0a2659b4dba88c34432c77285b76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/4842089769dd0a2659b4dba88c34432c77285b76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/e4fb46588826ff5d3dae831911f66507e3b2e319","verification":{"payload":"tree 4842089769dd0a2659b4dba88c34432c77285b76\nparent 7276bcb3aa473f0ff3b5f748990cdbc537503a30\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779418216 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779418216 +0800\n\nfeat(R8.5-A): public stats endpoint 扩展 — services + nodes + zones + dns_records\n\nR8.4 加 /api/v1/public/stats 仅含 services counts. Landing LiveStatsStrip 还\nmock nodes / zones / dns_records 三项. R8.5-A 让 4 项全部真数据.\n\n设计: 3 db 独立 (panel / server_mgr / cf_monitor), aggregator-core 不直连\n跨库; 走 cross-service http call 到子服务公开端点.\n\n新增端点 (no auth, 仅返 counts):\n- server-mgr GET /public/counts: {nodes: {total, online}}\n  online 定义 = last_heartbeat_at > NOW() - heartbeat_interval_sec * heartbeat_timeout_degraded_periods\n  仅 NOT archived, 不含归档节点.\n- cf-monitor GET /public/counts: {zones: {total, dns_records}}\n  COUNT(*) FROM cf_zones / cf_dns_records (~10s rows / ~100s rows, < 5ms 即使冷)\n\naggregator-core /api/v1/public/stats 扩展:\n- 加 NodesSummary { total, online } + ZonesSummary { total, dns_records }\n- 遍历 registry.list() 收 services counts 同时记 server-mgr / cf-monitor\n  endpoint (仅 Online state)\n- tokio::join! 并发 fetch, 1500ms timeout, 失败/4xx/解析错均退 None\n- 字段加 #[serde(skip_serializing_if = \"Option::is_none\")] — 上游断点\n  时返回不含该 section, frontend 自动退 mock baseline.\n\n实证 (R8.5 deploy 后):\n  curl https://core.raphaelny.net/api/v1/public/stats →\n  {\n    \"services\": { \"total\": 2, \"online\": 2, ... },\n    \"nodes\":    { \"total\": 0, \"online\": 0 },\n    \"zones\":    { \"total\": 3, \"dns_records\": 9 },\n    \"schema_version\": \"1.0\"\n  }\n  Landing LiveStatsStrip 从 mock 切到真数据 (zones/dns_records 真; nodes 因\n  暂无节点注册 0/0).\n\nRound: 8.5-A\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQS347Yge2mOrQHQJpAfJYZ9Ahsw8AUCag/EaAAKCRAfJYZ9Ahsw\n8Ox1AQDPfAXeSYZPDQ10ryOZksuuDrazqTKCehnUIzwzOIw/1wD/dbkHBnpi5ckP\nakZny0UC/t4QjSHvs26ruMClah1jCQI=\n=vvJY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-22T02:50:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users