{\"ok\":true}\n- aggregator-core log: \"proxy http hop ok status=200 OK\"\n\nRound: 8.4-B1","tree":{"sha":"a7c1eae03cf6c9d85a68b91ba013141e6109b919","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/a7c1eae03cf6c9d85a68b91ba013141e6109b919"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/fb184dbc417c09b11ddf0d61ddc778b3c1f35849","verification":{"payload":"tree a7c1eae03cf6c9d85a68b91ba013141e6109b919\nparent 681156c2c30d910dd1cb45596ab09be367e1d172\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779415571 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779415571 +0800\n\nfix(R8.4-B1): manifest routes prefix=''/'' — caller-selected service forwards tail verbatim\n\nR8.2 deploy 时发现 /services/server-mgr/healthz 反代返 404\n  service_not_found: no route prefix in manifest matched tail=/healthz\n\n根因 (R3 A 设计/落地不齐): server-mgr / cf-monitor 自注册 manifest 把 routes[0]\nprefix 写成 ''/server-mgr'' / ''/cf-monitor'' (类比 service_id), 但 caller 已经过\n`/services/{service_id}` 选定 service, tail 是 service 内部路径 (`/healthz` /\n`/api/nodes`). aggregator-core proxy_handler 的 pick_route 要求 needle (=/+tail)\n以 manifest.routes[].prefix 开头, 当 prefix=''/server-mgr'' 时 tail=''/healthz'' 不\n匹配 → 整段 service 反代不可用.\n\n修 (3 文件 + 1 测):\n- crates/server-mgr/src/manifest.rs: prefix ''/server-mgr'' → ''/'', strip_prefix\n  true → false (root prefix 不需 strip).\n- crates/cf-monitor/src/manifest.rs: prefix ''/cf-monitor'' → ''/'', strip_prefix\n  true → false.\n- crates/aggregator-core/src/proxy.rs 加 2 unit test:\n  - pick_route_root_prefix_matches_anything: prefix=''/'' match 任何 tail (含空)\n  - build_upstream_path_root_prefix_no_strip: tail=''healthz'' → ''/healthz'' 转\n- 修 server-mgr / cf-monitor manifest 测试 assert (prefix=''/'' + !strip_prefix)\n\n设计意图保留: manifest.routes[].prefix 仍可用于 ''gateway 顶级 / 反代到 service''\n场景 (Caddy 直接 / → /sub2api/* → service). 但服务通过 /services/{id} 选定时,\n不再要求二次 prefix match.\n\n实证 (R8.4 deploy 后):\n- /services/server-mgr/healthz → 200 {\"service\":\