s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commits/a23f5bcf02ae3eaec4821113bd4b180019cd1b1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T01:29:01Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T01:29:01Z","email":"1278173058@qq.com","name":"RaphaelNY"},"message":"ops(deploy): r7_install post-deploy docker build cache prune (R8.3 disk hygiene)\n\nVPS 部署期间发现系统盘 (29G) 因 docker build cache 累积 (单次 cargo + pnpm\nbuild 产 17GB+ cache) 而占用 76%. `docker system df` 实证:\n  Build Cache  128 layers   16.72GB    16.5GB reclaimable\n\n零风险清空: `docker builder prune -af` + `docker image prune -af`. running 容器\n+ volumes 不受影响. 实测后系统盘 76% → 23%, 释放 23GB.\n\ndeploy/r7_install.sh 加 §4.5 post-deploy hygiene 块, 每次部署后自动 prune\n未引用 build cache (--filter until=24h) + dangling images.\n\nVPS 同时加 root crontab 每周日 3:17 自动 prune (周级保底).\n\n后续 follow-up (留 R8.4): vdb1 数据盘 50GB 已 ext4 格式化但未挂载. 可挂\n/mnt/data + 迁 /var/lib/docker 到数据盘, 系统盘彻底卸下 docker 负担. 现因\nR8.3 frontend redesign agents 在跑不停服, 留作下次窗口.\n\nRound: 8.3 (ops)","tree":{"sha":"893d13eea7ef6901f901c0a35a11126698ef204b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/893d13eea7ef6901f901c0a35a11126698ef204b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/a23f5bcf02ae3eaec4821113bd4b180019cd1b1d","verification":{"payload":"tree 893d13eea7ef6901f901c0a35a11126698ef204b\nparent f3fdd85906b3404962aaeefca5cb5eb9a4c68340\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779413341 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779413341 +0800\n\nops(deploy): r7_install post-deploy docker build cache prune (R8.3 disk hygiene)\n\nVPS 部署期间发现系统盘 (29G) 因 docker build cache 累积 (单次 cargo + pnpm\nbuild 产 17GB+ cache) 而占用 76%. `docker system df` 实证:\n  Build Cache  128 layers   16.72GB    16.5GB reclaimable\n\n零风险清空: `docker builder prune -af` + `docker image prune -af`. running 容器\n+ volumes 不受影响. 实测后系统盘 76% → 23%, 释放 23GB.\n\ndeploy/r7_install.sh 加 §4.5 post-deploy hygiene 块, 每次部署后自动 prune\n未引用 build cache (--filter until=24h) + dangling images.\n\nVPS 同时加 root crontab 每周日 3:17 自动 prune (周级保底).\n\n后续 follow-up (留 R8.4): vdb1 数据盘 50GB 已 ext4 格式化但未挂载. 可挂\n/mnt/data + 迁 /var/lib/docker 到数据盘, 系统盘彻底卸下 docker 负担. 现因\nR8.3 frontend redesign agents 在跑不停服, 留作下次窗口.\n\nRound: 8.3 (ops)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQS347Yge2mOrQHQJpAfJYZ9Ahsw8AUCag+xXQAKCRAfJYZ9Ahsw\n8LBtAQD990YWWC8zhibK8V8w+XRDEIH1AZ6MhpVXkwCqXcj/IAEAuV9ruLh9r5l+\nFOjE4KnnI6lDcWYyIHLWYCJYY/7q5gA=\n=tckM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-22T01:29:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/a23f5bcf02ae3eaec4821113bd4b180019cd1b1d","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKGEyM2Y1YmNmMDJhZTNlYWVjNDgyMTExM2JkNGIxODAwMTljZDFiMWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Raphael