TERNAL_TOKEN bearer auth 可选, 失败仅 warn 不 fatal)\n  - 2 unit tests (manifest_has_required_fields + manifest_serializes_to_valid_json)\n\nmain.rs 加 `tokio::spawn(manifest::register_with_aggregator(&cfg))` after\n`router(state)` 同 server-mgr 范式. 加 `use cf_monitor::manifest` import.\n\nCargo.toml 加 `url = { workspace = true }` (manifest::build_manifest endpoint\n字段类型需要).\n\n实证 (强 rebuild --no-cache 后):\n- cf-monitor 启动 log: \"manifest registered with aggregator-core url=...\"\n- aggregator_core.services 表: cf-monitor 0.0.1 registered_at=2026-05-21 15:48:16\n  (含 server-mgr + cf-monitor 共 2 row)\n\nRound: 8.2","tree":{"sha":"c939441ae5ce350b0045c4f110334c3ac1bc2bf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/c939441ae5ce350b0045c4f110334c3ac1bc2bf2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/c6052f0266f3a325093d2f9986c33229190a8d9f","verification":{"payload":"tree c939441ae5ce350b0045c4f110334c3ac1bc2bf2\nparent b34970d31380caf8dccc3a6d28eda6e3fde8d3d7\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779378587 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779378587 +0800\n\nfeat(cf-monitor): manifest self-register to aggregator-core (R3 D 同模式 silent partial 修)\n\nR8.2-B. R3 团队 D 同 R3 团队 C 模式: lib 完整但 main.rs 不调 manifest::register.\nv0.2.0 出口后 services 表只有 server-mgr (R8 commit 8553d80 修 server-mgr 后),\ncf-monitor 一直没注册. 第六处 silent partial.\n\n新增 crates/cf-monitor/src/manifest.rs (~140 LOC, mirror server-mgr/manifest.rs\nR8 commit 8553d80 范式):\n  - build_manifest(cfg) 构造 ServiceManifest:\n    service_id=cf-monitor, port from cfg, routes prefix=/cf-monitor,\n    health_check /healthz GET 30s, ui_panel path=/cloudflare title=Cloudflare,\n    capabilities=[Http], events 5 (cf-monitor.zone.up/paused/dns.changed/\n    ssl.expiring/alert.triggered), metadata: polling_lanes + tracked_resources\n  - register_with_aggregator(cfg) reqwest POST 同 server-mgr 逻辑 (10s timeout,\n    INTERNAL_TOKEN bearer auth 可选, 失败仅 warn 不 fatal)\n  - 2 unit tests (manifest_has_required_fields + manifest_serializes_to_valid_json)\n\nmain.rs 加 `tokio::spawn(manifest::register_with_aggregator(&cfg))` after\n`router(state)` 同 server-mgr 范式. 加 `use cf_monitor::manifest` import.\n\nCargo.toml 加 `url = { workspace = true }` (manifest::build_manifest endpoint\n字段类型需要).\n\n实证 (强 rebuild --no-cache 后):\n- cf-monitor 启动 log: \"manifest registered with aggregator-core url=...\"\n- aggregator_core.services 表: cf-monitor 0.0.1 registered_at=2026-05-21 15:48:16\n  (含 server-mgr + cf-monitor 共 2 row)\n\nRound: 8.2\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQS347Yge2mOrQHQJpAfJYZ9Ahsw8AUCag8pmwAKCRAfJYZ9Ahsw\n8D5yAQCsYTjpxTzF8a9MJfli9Q6CxC9Mxfat11seRX0NCD8OJgD/VL1/DejmeHg3\n9vPW/hkLQHN8iuZOMN4lMQ51BoxYbwg=\n=4Q3w\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-21T16:05:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109780307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY","id":109780307,"login":"RaphaelNY","node_id":"U_kgDOBosdUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaphaelNY","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/commit/c6052f0266f3a325093d2f9986c33229190a8d9f","node_id":"C_kwDOSjhqB9oAKGM2MDUyZjAyNjZmM2EzMjUwOTNkMmY5OTg2YzMzMjI