addyfile 加 3 块显式 handle 在 default {} 之前:\n  /services/*   → aggregator-core   (gateway 反代到 manifest 注册的 services)\n  /api/v1/*     → aggregator-core   (admin api 直访)\n  /healthz      → aggregator-core   (R8.1 已有)\n\n实测 (经 CF + Caddy + Bearer):\n- /services/server-mgr/healthz  → aggregator-core 接到, 但返 404 service_not_found\n                                   (R3 A: aggregator-core /services/* 反代逻辑 bug,\n                                   tail 必须以 manifest.routes[0].prefix 开头, 留 R8.3)\n- /api/v1/registry              → 200 services list (含 server-mgr + cf-monitor)\n- /healthz                      → 200 aggregator-core (services.online >= 1)\n\nRound: 8.2","tree":{"sha":"5a626183331d48517f968ceac5453e022fe420ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/trees/5a626183331d48517f968ceac5453e022fe420ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RaphaelNY/RaphaelPanel/git/commits/b34970d31380caf8dccc3a6d28eda6e3fde8d3d7","verification":{"payload":"tree 5a626183331d48517f968ceac5453e022fe420ab\nparent 08c8321ce57fd425013645e0e2ed4028b6294f29\nauthor RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779378586 +0800\ncommitter RaphaelNY <1278173058@qq.com> 1779378586 +0800\n\nfeat(R8.2-A): Caddyfile /services/* + /api/v1/* → aggregator-core\n\nR8 manifest::register_with_aggregator 修后, services 表填数据 (R8 server-mgr +\nR8.2 cf-monitor). 但 R8.1 Caddyfile 默认 / → main-panel-frontend 把 /services/*\n和 /api/v1/* 也吃掉了, gateway 反代不可用.\n\nCaddyfile 加 3 块显式 handle 在 default {} 之前:\n  /services/*   → aggregator-core   (gateway 反代到 manifest 注册的 services)\n  /api/v1/*     → aggregator-core   (admin api 直访)\n  /healthz      → aggregator-core   (R8.1 已有)\n\n实测 (经 CF + Caddy + Bearer):\n- /services/server-mgr/healthz  → aggregator-core 接到, 但返 404 service_not_found\n                                   (R3 A: aggregator-core /services/* 反代逻辑 bug,\n                                   tail 必须以 manifest.routes[0].prefix 开头, 留 R8.3)\n- /api/v1/registry              → 200 services list (含 server-mgr + cf-m