ả CI\n  (quality+build+e2e nightly), thêm mục Styling (Tailwind) + Observability/mocking;\n  e2e không còn cần Chrome/fleet thủ công (webServer tự boot)\n- CONTRIBUTING: lệnh test:coverage/test:e2e/storybook, quy ước env browser + styling,\n  gate PR dùng test:coverage\n- add-new-mfe: ghi rõ MFE sinh ra đã có Tailwind sẵn\n- ADR 0006: quyết định styling/observability/DX (Tailwind, Sentry, Storybook, MSW,\n  coverage+Playwright, Renovate, typed contracts)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"afa21f3cf5166d421ddc06af17ff047eb3add950","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/trees/afa21f3cf5166d421ddc06af17ff047eb3add950"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/commits/8bbec1e15b1a5284ef1a71ec55bf3345ee8ed2e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commit/8bbec1e15b1a5284ef1a71ec55bf3345ee8ed2e4","node_id":"C_kwDOSjxIpNoAKDhiYmVjMWUxNWIxYTUyODRlZjFhNzFlYzU1YmYzMzQ1ZWU4ZWQyZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commit/a054c86350073c7c72eabee8e4425931b73e2092","sha":"a054c86350073c7c72eabee8e4425931b73e2092","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/a054c86350073c7c72eabee8e4425931b73e2092"}],"sha":"8bbec1e15b1a5284ef1a71ec55bf3345ee8ed2e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/8bbec1e15b1a5284ef1a71ec55bf3345ee8ed2e4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/a054c86350073c7c72eabee8e4425931b73e2092/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T08:21:04Z","email":"chiennm96@gmail.com","name":"Minh Chiến"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T08:21:04Z","email":"chiennm96@gmail.com","name":"Minh Chiến"},"message":"fix: bọc auth state update bằng startTransition tránh vỡ Suspense hydration\n\nAuthProvider.useEffect gọi setState({ ready:true }) ngay sau mount → đổi context\nmà ProtectedRoute (gate các remote noSSR đang trong Suspense) tiêu thụ → update\nbắn vào boundary chưa hydrate xong → \"This Suspense boundary received an update\nbefore it finished hydrating\" (React rớt về client render).\n\n- AuthContext: bọc sync() bằng startTransition (đúng khuyến nghị React)\n- e2e smoke: thêm \"before it finished hydrating\" vào bộ lọc lỗi fatal để bắt\n  lớp lỗi này về sau\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"411a22782b02915a8a5875cde42814597fa2c033","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/trees/411a22782b02915a8a5875cde42814597fa2c033"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/commits/a054c86350073c7c72eabee8e4425931b73e2092","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commit/a054c86350073c7c72eabee8e4425931b73e2092","node_id":"C_kwDOSjxIpNoAKGEwNTRjODYzNTAwNzNjN2M3MmVhYmVlOGU0NDI1OTMxYjczZTIwOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commit/47198d530db8d50c197fb2cd8d77c9f7fa4778cf","sha":"47198d530db8d50c197fb2cd8d77c9f7fa4778cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/47198d530db8d50c197fb2cd8d77c9f7fa4778cf"}],"sha":"a054c86350073c7c72eabee8e4425931b73e2092","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/a054c86350073c7c72eabee8e4425931b73e2092"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/47198d530db8d50c197fb2cd8d77c9f7fa4778cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T08:12:00Z","email":"chiennm96@gmail.com","name":"Minh Chiến"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T08:12:00Z","email":"chiennm96@gmail.com","name":"Minh Chiến"},"message":"fix: tránh ReferenceError `process` ở browser khi env MODERN_* chưa set\n\nModern.js chỉ inline `process.env.MODERN_*` thành literal KHI var được set; khi\nchưa set, biểu thức giữ nguyên và `process` không tồn tại ở browser → crash\nruntime (phát hiện qua e2e: landing page chết với \"process is not defined\").\n\n- sentry.ts: đọc DSN/ENV qua helper bọc try/catch (giữ literal cho DefinePlugin)\n- shell layout: bọc try/catch quanh check MODERN_MSW\n- mocks/browser: bỏ re-check process.env thừa (chỉ gọi khi đã bật)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"60cb55f7e14c7adc26c143e5c6c86da63ed6674b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/trees/60cb55f7e14c7adc26c143e5c6c86da63ed6674b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/commits/47198d530db8d50c197fb2cd8d77c9f7fa4778cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commit/47198d530db8d50c197fb2cd8d77c9f7fa4778cf","node_id":"C_kwDOSjxIpNoAKDQ3MTk4ZDUzMGRiOGQ1MGMxOTdmYjJjZDhkNzdjOWY3ZmE0Nzc4Y2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commit/c4bf1acf59e9ce19e18aeeff7caba1f217bb407b","sha":"c4bf1acf59e9ce19e18aeeff7caba1f217bb407b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/c4bf1acf59e9ce19e18aeeff7caba1f217bb407b"}],"sha":"47198d530db8d50c197fb2cd8d77c9f7fa4778cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/47198d530db8d50c197fb2cd8d77c9f7fa4778cf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/c4bf1acf59e9ce19e18aeeff7caba1f217bb407b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T08:05:49Z","email":"chiennm96@gmail.com","name":"Minh Chiến"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T08:05:49Z","email":"chiennm96@gmail.com","name":"Minh Chiến"},"message":"test: coverage gate + Playw