{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T03:24:45Z","email":"minhchien@Minhs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Minh Chiến"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T03:24:45Z","email":"minhchien@Minhs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Minh Chiến"},"message":"feat: base chuẩn MFE — Modern.js federated SSR toàn tuyến + AWS deploy simulation\n\nPivot từ Next.js shell về Modern.js SSR thuần (cách ByteDance dùng production):\n- Shell rewrite: Modern.js SSR stream host, file routes + splat $.tsx\n  (fix bug /accounts/:id), createLazyComponent (Login SSR thật cho SEO,\n  protected noSSR + skeleton), Helmet per-route, AuthContext {user, ready}\n- 6 MFE + shared: bật ssr stream, SSR-safe guards (localStorage/eventBus),\n  serve script đúng (modern serve, không phải modern start)\n- Dual-URL runtime plugin: MF_INTERNAL_HOST_MAP rewrite host server-side\n  trong Docker/ECS + resilience guard (remote chết không kéo chết host)\n- Workaround lib: dts: false (dts-plugin crash EPIPE), externalize\n  @module-federation/node/utils khỏi web bundle (race ssrPlugin)\n- Deploy: docker/Dockerfile chung + compose (7 SSR + LocalStack S3),\n  scripts/deploy-localstack.sh, workflow AWS thật (S3/CloudFront+ECR/ECS);\n  xóa 9 workflows GH Pages (static hosting không chạy SSR)\n- Dọn: pages/, mfe-cart, mfe-orders, mfe-products, toàn bộ file Next.js\n- README rewrite + .env.example env matrix + scripts/e2e-smoke.mjs (pnpm test:e2e)\n\nVerified: E2E Chrome 0 console error, SSR curls (/login chứa form remote),\nresilience test (kill 1 remote → fallback, shell sống), pnpm -r build sạch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0dc3cc15ff0f94abed9a73e23e70c4da91d2e39a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/trees/0dc3cc15ff0f94abed9a73e23e70c4da91d2e39a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/commits/cb91bde3d8abab69c4a4f878549d08221553d536","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"v