rents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commit/0f71dd62a5862b3ff4421f56aab6a1bc3574768a","sha":"0f71dd62a5862b3ff4421f56aab6a1bc3574768a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/0f71dd62a5862b3ff4421f56aab6a1bc3574768a"}],"sha":"41a23a02bc918a8b167048df1caa4c05fc21d0a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/41a23a02bc918a8b167048df1caa4c05fc21d0a0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/0f71dd62a5862b3ff4421f56aab6a1bc3574768a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T04:42:26Z","email":"minhchien@Minhs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Minh Chiến"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T04:42:26Z","email":"minhchien@Minhs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Minh Chiến"},"message":"ux: thay Suspense spinner của /transfer bằng TransferSkeleton\n\nKhi navigate trực tiếp vào /#/transfer, có 2 loading state liên tiếp:\n  1. Spinner \"Đang tải Chuyển tiền...\" (MFE bundle loading)\n  2. Skeleton trong TransferDashboard (data fetching)\n\nFix: dùng TransferSkeleton làm Suspense fallback — khớp layout chính xác\nvới skeleton bên trong TransferDashboard (gradient account card + quick\nactions placeholder + SkeletonList). Hai bước loading giờ trông như 1.\n\nmfe() helper nhận tham số fallback tùy chọn (mặc định LoadingFallback\nspinner giữ nguyên cho các route khác).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e8600f5a104eacc61a7ca2e9dd04a4627c0f794","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/trees/9e8600f5a104eacc61a7ca2e9dd04a4627c0f794"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/commits/0f71dd62a5862b3ff4421f56aab6a1bc3574768a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commit/0f71dd62a5862b3ff4421f56aab6a1bc3574768a","node_id":"C_kwDOSjxIpNoAKDBmNzFkZDYyYTU4NjJiM2ZmNDQyMWY1NmFhYjZhMWJjMzU3NDc2OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commit/a92dc42234f9686f8e51c455bdcf625f9ea19861","sha":"a92dc42234f9686f8e51c455bdcf625f9ea19861","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/a92dc42234f9686f8e51c455bdcf625f9ea19861"}],"sha":"0f71dd62a5862b3ff4421f56aab6a1bc3574768a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/0f71dd62a5862b3ff4421f56aab6a1bc3574768a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/a92dc42234f9686f8e51c455bdcf625f9ea19861/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T04:38:47Z","email":"minhchien@Minhs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Minh Chiến"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T04:38:47Z","email":"minhchien@Minhs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Minh Chiến"},"message":"fix: thêm skeleton loading cho TransferDashboard khi accounts đang fetch\n\nKhi isLoading=true, thay vì hiện \"Vui lòng truy cập Tài khoản\" (trông như\nmàn login), hiện skeleton: gradient card mờ cho account card và SkeletonList\ncho danh sách giao dịch gần đây.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f18738ac5a46a45ea85cce81a06013b7a71396f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/trees/0f18738ac5a46a45ea85cce81a06013b7a71396f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/commits/a92dc42234f9686f8e51c455bdcf625f9ea19861","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commit/a92dc42234f9686f8e51c455bdcf625f9ea19861","node_id":"C_kwDOSjxIpNoAKGE5MmRjNDIyMzRmOTY4NmY4ZTUxYzQ1NWJkY2Y2MjVmOWVhMTk4NjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commit/b676ad95beb3d02863cd9a6fb67d0b2e311ed6f4","sha":"b676ad95beb3d02863cd9a6fb67d0b2e311ed6f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/b676ad95beb3d02863cd9a6fb67d0b2e311ed6f4"}],"sha":"a92dc42234f9686f8e51c455bdcf625f9ea19861","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/a92dc42234f9686f8e51c455bdcf625f9ea19861"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/b676ad95beb3d02863cd9a6fb67d0b2e311ed6f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T04:34:06Z","email":"minhchien@Minhs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Minh Chiến"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T04:34:06Z","email":"minhchien@Minhs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Minh Chiến"},"message":"fix: tách deploy-all thành build+deploy job để tham gia deploy-gh-pages queue\n\ndeploy-all dùng single job → concurrency group riêng (deploy-pages), không\nqueue cùng per-MFE deploy jobs (deploy-gh-pages) → race condition khi commit\nthay đổi cả pnpm-lock.yaml (trigger deploy-all) lẫn mfe-accounts/** (trigger\ndeploy-mfe-accounts) trong cùng 1 push.\n\nFix: tách thành build job (build + assemble + upload artifact) và deploy job\n(download + peaceiris push) với concurrency group: deploy-gh-pages — giờ\ndeploy-all xếp hàng cùng per-MFE deploy jobs, không còn race nhau.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"908d60d0934738a3d3ec108a0a5f2858a3d420b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/trees/908d60d0934738a3d3ec108a0a5f2858a3d420b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/commits/b676ad95beb3d02863cd9a6fb67d0b2e311ed6f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commit/b676ad95beb3d02863cd9a6fb67d0b2e311ed6f4","node_id":"C_kwDOSjxIpNoAKGI2NzZhZDk1YmViM2QwMjg2M2NkOWE2ZmI2N2QwYjJlMzExZWQ2ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commit/a9058cbeb42d46ea59b5dc9cf391c6b00b9b40e6","sha":"a9058cbeb42d46ea59b5dc9cf391c6b00b9b40e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/a9058cbeb42d46ea59b5dc9cf391c6b00b9b40e6"}],"sha":"b676ad95beb3d02863cd9a6fb67d0b2e311ed6f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/b676ad95beb3d02863cd9a6fb67d0b2e311ed6f4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/a9058cbeb42d46ea59b5dc9cf391c6b00b9b40e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T04:30:50Z","email":"minhchien@Minhs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Minh Chiến"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T04:30:50Z","email":"minhchien@Minhs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Minh Chiến"},"message":"feat: thêm dark mode, React 18 Concurrent, Virtual Scrolling, React Query advanced\n\n- Dark mode: ThemeContext (shared MF remote) + CSS custom properties + toggle trong Nav\n- React 18: useTransition (filter switch) + useDeferredValue (search) trong TransactionList\n- Virtual scrolling: @tanstack/react-virtual — chỉ render visible rows (120 tx mock data)\n- useInfiniteQuery: phân trang server-side thay cho client pagination\n- useMutation + optimistic update: NewTransfer cập nhật TransferHistory trước khi API trả về\n- README: cập nhật Section 9 với đầy đủ code examples + flow diagram\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b963450bd6b068c47c3cdc04fb1dbc3f20c771b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/trees/9b963450bd6b068c47c3cdc04fb1dbc3f20c771b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/commits/a9058cbeb42d46ea59b5dc9cf391c6b00b9b40e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commit/a9058cbeb42d46ea59b5dc9cf391c6b00b9b40e6","node_id":"C_kwDOSjxIpNoAKGE5MDU4Y2JlYjQyZDQ2ZWE1OWI1ZGM5Y2YzOTFjNmIwMGI5YjQwZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commit/8f13143744ed8679b0eb51de5faf18a0eac31ba1","sha":"8f13143744ed8679b0eb51de5faf18a0eac31ba1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/8f13143744ed8679b0eb51de5faf18a0eac31ba1"}],"sha":"a9058cbeb42d46ea59b5dc9cf391c6b00b9b40e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/a9058cbeb42d46ea59b5dc9cf391c6b00b9b40e6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/8f13143744ed8679b0eb51de5faf18a0eac31ba1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T09:14:32Z","email":"minhchien@Minhs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Minh Chiến"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T09:14:32Z","email":"minhchien@Minhs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Minh Chiến"},"message":"docs: cập nhật README phản ánh MF runtime remote và CI 2-job\n\n- Section 1: diagram + architecture table → shared là MF runtime remote\n- Section 3: MFE config ví dụ bỏ resolve.alias, thêm remotes.shared;\n  remotes.config.js thêm shared entry\n- Section 7: rewrite hoàn toàn từ Build-time Alias → MF Runtime Remote\n  (config shared vite.config.js, trade-off table, HMR note)\n- Section 10: 8 devserver thay vì 7, cảnh báo shared server cần chạy\n- Section 11: per-MFE YAML example → 2-job build/deploy, giải thích\n  race condition fix; concurrency table thêm tầng 2 deploy-gh-pages\n- Section 12: workflow thay đổi shared không cần restart MFE devserver\n- Section 13: thay mục HMR alias bằng mục shared server offline\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87861ad73b21b76a2d5ea0dbb368da2f75c1b613","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/trees/87861ad73b21b76a2d5ea0dbb368da2f75c1b613"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/commits/8f13143744ed8679b0eb51de5faf18a0eac31ba1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commit/8f13143744ed8679b0eb51de5faf18a0eac31ba1","node_id":"C_kwDOSjxIpNoAKDhmMTMxNDM3NDRlZDg2NzliMGViNTFkZTVmYWYxOGEwZWFjMzFiYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commit/2594ae843598b66f7af9df4caf673e93d43ee063","sha":"2594ae843598b66f7af9df4caf673e93d43ee063","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/2594ae843598b66f7af9df4caf673e93d43ee063"}],"sha":"8f13143744ed8679b0eb51de5faf18a0eac31ba1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/8f13143744ed8679b0eb51de5faf18a0eac31ba1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/2594ae843598b66f7af9df4caf673e93d43ee063/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T09:06:35Z","email":"minhchien@Minhs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Minh Chiến"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T09:06:35Z","email":"minhchien@Minhs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Minh Chiến"},"message":"ci: tách build/deploy jobs để tránh race condition trên gh-pages\n\nKhi nhiều workflow push lên gh-pages cùng lúc (vd: merge PR thay đổi\nnhiều MFE), tất cả clone tại cùng 1 commit rồi đua nhau push → bị\nreject \"cannot lock ref\". Fix: tách mỗi workflow thành 2 job — build\n(chạy song song, upload artifact) và deploy (needs: build, dùng shared\nconcurrency group: deploy-gh-pages, cancel-in-progress: false để xếp\nhàng tuần tự).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"18db764ab04fbc3cceced21904a5e7e3154dfb3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/trees/18db764ab04fbc3cceced21904a5e7e3154dfb3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/commits/2594ae843598b66f7af9df4caf673e93d43ee063","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"veri