up riêng (cancel-in-progress:true)\n- Xóa remotes.config.js khỏi trigger của per-MFE: deploy-all xử lý\n- deploy-all giữ group:deploy-pages,cancel-in-progress:false (full rebuild)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"97c5b1760db977698cadcd5cf2a3f3e7bc0a8ed6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/trees/97c5b1760db977698cadcd5cf2a3f3e7bc0a8ed6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/git/commits/49769b3ec93b9e34fb88872897fa15e331a12e93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commit/49769b3ec93b9e34fb88872897fa15e331a12e93","node_id":"C_kwDOSjxIpNoAKDQ5NzY5YjNlYzkzYjllMzRmYjg4ODcyODk3ZmExNWUzMzFhMTJlOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commit/9fdff184c9b2366fe3c944f3d33fbf0a87a1fb9c","sha":"9fdff184c9b2366fe3c944f3d33fbf0a87a1fb9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/9fdff184c9b2366fe3c944f3d33fbf0a87a1fb9c"}],"sha":"49769b3ec93b9e34fb88872897fa15e331a12e93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/49769b3ec93b9e34fb88872897fa15e331a12e93"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MinhChien96/micro-frontend/commits/9fdff184c9b2366fe3c944f3d33fbf0a87a1fb9c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T08:50:20Z","email":"minhchien@Minhs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Minh Chiến"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T08:50:20Z","email":"minhchien@Minhs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Minh Chiến"},"message":"docs: rewrite README với nội dung chi tiết và chính xác\n\n- Thêm bảng permissions đầy đủ 16 permissions × 3 roles\n- Code snippet lấy trực tiếp từ source (App.jsx, Nav.jsx, auth.js, …)\n- Bổ sung standalone mode, bảng UI components, chunk caching strategy\n- CI/CD: giải thích deploy-all vs per-MFE, concurrency