ankla/archery/commits/33c470997a31ed7fe8c47e1512db1540e6d674fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T21:17:37Z","email":"nymankla@gmail.com","name":"Klas Nyman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T21:17:37Z","email":"nymankla@gmail.com","name":"Klas Nyman"},"message":"Rename solution to Archery and drop aspire-sample project prefix\n\nRename the solution to Archery.sln and re-prefix the runtime projects\nfrom aspire-sample.* to aspire.* (AppHost, ApiService, Web,\nServiceDefaults). The two test projects drop the prefix entirely\n(aspire-sample.Tests -> Tests, aspire-sample.UnitTests -> UnitTests).\n\n- Renamed all project directories, .csproj files, and the .sln via\n  git mv so history is preserved.\n- Updated namespaces (aspire_sample.* -> aspire.*), test namespaces\n  (-> Tests / UnitTests), and the generated AppHost project handles\n  (Projects.aspire_sample_* -> Projects.aspire_*).\n- Fixed project references, aspire.config.json, and the .claude hook\n  path that pointed at the old UnitTests directory.\n- Pinned Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore(.Relational) 10.0.9 in both test\n  projects to match aspire.ApiService; Aspire''s health-checks package\n  otherwise pulls 10.0.8 transitively, which broke a clean build/run.\n\nSolution builds clean; all 13 unit tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a9be95a43a49e72c4afb440a0355c3500d390445","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nymankla/archery/git/trees/a9be95a43a49e72c4afb440a0355c3500d390445"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nymankla/archery/git/commits/33c470997a31ed7fe8c47e1512db1540e6d674fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nymankla/archery/commit/33c470997a31ed7fe8c47e1512db1540e6d674fd","node_id":"C_kwDOSjy22NoAKDMzYzQ3MDk5N2EzMWVkN2ZlOGM0N2UxNTEyZGIxNTQwZTZkNjc0ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.c