-06T20:46:34Z","email":"nymankla@gmail.com","name":"Klas Nyman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T20:46:34Z","email":"nymankla@gmail.com","name":"Klas Nyman"},"message":"Add conflict handling, indexes, and test coverage\n\n- Add query-supporting indexes for MembershipFees, Competitions, CompetitionResults, and CompetitionParticipants\n- Introduce ConflictException and persistence exception helpers for PostgreSQL constraint handling\n- Update services and API endpoints to surface unique/check constraint violations as HTTP 409 Conflict responses\n- Refactor MembershipFeeService and DashboardService for more efficient queries\n- Upgrade NuGet dependencies for bug fixes and compatibility\n- Add integration tests for constraint violation handling\n- Add sample CSV for competition import","tree":{"sha":"2b6eecb1c45613a9c907d14c4c67451120dddb47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nymankla/archery/git/trees/2b6eecb1c45613a9c907d14c4c67451120dddb47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nymankla/archery/git/commits/ea79e9d1ea31196d12c305e3e48edb3a82541e92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nymankla/archery/commit/ea79e9d1ea31196d12c305e3e48edb3a82541e92","node_id":"C_kwDOSjy22NoAKGVhNzllOWQxZWEzMTE5NmQxMmMzMDVlM2U0OGVkYjNhODI1NDFlOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nymankla/archery/commit/1f84b8c2a03b991da5c3f7aba851f266a5821e3d","sha":"1f84b8c2a03b991da5c3f7aba851f266a5821e3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nymankla/archery/commits/1f84b8c2a03b991da5c3f7aba851f266a5821e3d"}],"sha":"ea79e9d1ea31196d12c305e3e48edb3a82541e92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nymankla/archery/commits/ea79e9d1ea31196d12c305e3e48edb3a82541e92"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nymankla/archery/commits/1f84b8c2a03b991da5c3f7aba851f266a5821e3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T19:00:11Z","email":"nymankla@gmail.com","name":"Klas Nyman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T19:00:11Z","email":"nymankla@gmail.com","name":"Klas Nyman"},"message":"feat: Implement competition import functionality and enhance membership fee endpoints with age filtering","tree":{"sha":"77569ab58868a7a44dc5440b8c577ffb89b76d20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nymankla/archery/git/trees/77569ab58868a7a44dc5440b8c577ffb89b76d20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nymankla/archery/git/commits/1f84b8c2a03b991da5c3f7aba851f266a5821e3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nymankla/archery/commit/1f84b8c2a03b991da5c3f7aba851f266a5821e3d","node_id":"C_kwDOSjy22NoAKDFmODRiOGMyYTAzYjk5MWRhNWMzZjdhYmE4NTFmMjY2YTU4MjFlM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nymankla/archery/commit/6bd0f9bbb932f07cb60a2aa4ff67aae20ffc7d2d","sha":"6bd0f9bbb932f07cb60a2aa4ff67aae20ffc7d2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nymankla/archery/commits/6bd0f9bbb932f07cb60a2aa4ff67aae20ffc7d2d"}],"sha":"1f84b8c2a03b991da5c3f7aba851f266a5821e3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nymankla/archery/commits/1f84b8c2a03b991da5c3f7aba851f266a5821e3d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nymankla/archery/commits/6bd0f9bbb932f07cb60a2aa4ff67aae20ffc7d2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T18:14:11Z","email":"nymankla@gmail.com","name":"Klas Nyman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T18:14:11Z","email":"nymankla@gmail.com","name":"Klas Nyman"},"message":"Add comprehensive documentation and safety guardrails for Aspire workflows\n\n- Introduced `agent-workflows.md` to outline best practices for managing tasks in Aspire, including safe background runs and handling code changes.\n- Created `app-commands.md` detailing app-level lifecycle commands, including starting, stopping, and initializing Aspire apps.\n- Added `detection.md` to provide guidelines for recognizing Aspire projects and identifying the AppHost.\n- Developed `resource-management.md` to focus on resource-specific operations and readiness checks.\n- Established `safety-guardrails.md` to define critical rules for AI agents, preventing common pitfalls and ensuring proper command usage.\n- Documented breaking changes in `aspire-13-3-breaking-changes.md` to assist in migrating to Aspire 13.3.\n- Added `MemoryCacheTicketStore.cs` for managing authentication tickets in memory cache.\n- Included a new data protection key file for secure data handling in `aspire-sample.Web`.","tree":{"sha":"8eadcf967e9de9889f0e5872f5f3714c3adb2199","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nymankla/archery/git/trees/8eadcf967e9de9889f0e5872f5f3714c3adb2199"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nymankla/archery/git/commits/6bd0f9bbb932f07cb60a2aa4ff67aae20ffc7d2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nymankla/archery/commit/6bd0f9bbb932f07cb60a2aa4ff67aae20ffc7d2d","node_id":"C_kwDOSjy22NoAKDZiZDBmOWJiYjkzMmYwN2NiNjBhMmFhNGZmNjdhYWUyMGZmYzdkMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nymankla/archery/commit/04211783f3bff75422e57bf6d2e49183dd1a72d8","sha":"04211783f3bff75422e57bf6d2e49183dd1a72d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nymankla/archery/commits/04211783f3bff75422e57bf6d2e49183dd1a72d8"}],"sha":"6bd0f9bbb932f07cb60a2aa4ff67aae20ffc7d2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nymankla/archery/commits/6bd0f9bbb932f07cb60a2aa4ff67aae20ffc7d2d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nymankla/archery/commits/04211783f3bff75422e57bf6d2e49183dd1a72d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T21:23:09Z","email":"nymankla@gmail.com","name":"Klas Nyman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T21:23:09Z","email":"nymankla@gmail.com","name":"Klas Nyman"},"message":"Add services and models for competition management a