ala/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saivinaychintala","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saivinaychintala/micro-frontend-demo/commits/38a2574528231d10acaa59f661c7fb69534c149d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T11:08:03Z","email":"saivinaychintala@gmail.com","name":"Vinay Chintala"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T11:08:03Z","email":"saivinaychintala@gmail.com","name":"Vinay Chintala"},"message":"feat: complete micro-frontend demo with module federation\n\nInitial release of production-ready micro-frontend architecture demo.\n\nFeatures:\n- Host application with navigation shell and error boundaries\n- Dashboard remote with stats, charts, and activity widgets\n- Settings remote with profile, preferences, and security forms\n- Shared UI component library (Button, Card, Input, Container)\n- Module Federation setup for runtime integration\n- Tailwind CSS styling (utility classes only)\n- Full TypeScript support across all applications\n- Comprehensive documentation (README, QUICKSTART, ARCHITECTURE)\n- CI/CD pipeline with GitHub Actions\n- Docker Compose for local deployment\n\nTech Stack:\n- Next.js 14 with App Router\n- Webpack 5 Module Federation\n- pnpm monorepo workspace\n- Tailwind CSS for styling\n\nAll applications can run independently or as integrated micro-frontends.","tree":{"sha":"2213de19a3ca68e647afe8947f3b1cf52338ccee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saivinaychintala/micro-frontend-demo/git/trees/2213de19a3ca68e647afe8947f3b1cf52338ccee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saivinaychintala/micro-frontend-demo/git/commits/38a2574528231d10acaa59f661c7fb69534c149d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110385548?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saivinaychintala/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://a