 lessons worth remembering — gitignore-as-deploy-gotcha,\nVercel''s per-domain CNAME targets, Squarespace-on-Google-Cloud-DNS,\n95-second DNS+cert handoff, .app HSTS-preload constraint.\n\nIMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md marks Phase M closed with a one-paragraph\nreference back to PROGRESS.md, promotes Phase J (RSS feed) to active,\nand trims the budget summary to ~0.5 session remaining.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f76f077d5b1a9b7df34452aca05d0e273c76c933","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NavyDevilDoc/anime-newsletter/git/trees/f76f077d5b1a9b7df34452aca05d0e273c76c933"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NavyDevilDoc/anime-newsletter/git/commits/6434d39cfe9007ccfa7b0b6fb01d113db10f39f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75228?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yayhooray","id":75228,"login":"yayhooray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NavyDevilDoc/anime-newsletter/commit/6434d39cfe9007ccfa7b0b6fb01d113db10f39f7","node_id":"C_kwDOSj6oLtoAKDY0MzRkMzljZmU5MDA3Y2NmYTdiMGI2ZmIwMWQxMTNkYjEwZjM5Zjc","pa