e surfaced enough stack-mismatch friction\nto recharacterize the original constraint (\"newsletter must live under\nanimeintel.app\") as self-imposed. Phase L''s scoping notes preserved in\nFUTURE_ENHANCEMENTS.md for the case where the constraint becomes real\nlater.\n\nReplaces L with Phase M: a standalone Vercel static deploy at\nnewsletter.animeintel.app. Editor stays local; only the read-only public\nsurface deploys. Eight-step plan documented in IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md\ncovering build-time bundling of published artifacts, production gating\nof EditorPage, Vercel project setup, and Squarespace CNAME configuration.\n\nPROGRESS.md refreshed: stale \"10-step plan\" preamble replaced, two\npost-Phase-I follow-ups recorded (source-fidelity validator tightening\nafter the Saturday 17:00 mismatch + 4 new Reddit title-formatter tests\nfor locale-pin / day-padding / leap-day / shape invariant). Suite is now\n50 tests across 5 files.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f59c53e78e71630c166525438361665458c19084","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NavyDevilDoc/anime-newsletter/git/trees/f59c53e78e71630c166525438361665458c19084"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NavyDevilDoc/anime-newsletter/git/commits/91d57c5a09906f5cd20b597b590cc5ee2912dd03","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75228?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yayhooray","id":75228,"login":"yayhooray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api