s/NavyDevilDoc/anime-newsletter/commits/3f7c5fd0105da031a7ea4f5bbb6f7d7e7cdfa8bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T00:02:20Z","email":"someone@example.com","name":"Anime Intel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T00:06:57Z","email":"someone@example.com","name":"Anime Intel"},"message":"Source-fidelity: drop temporal/event tokens from significance filter\n\nSaturday 17:00 scheduled run surfaced one URL/headline mismatch that\ncleared the >=2 shared-token threshold on temporal filler alone:\na Made in Abyss headline attached to an Iceblade Sorcerer URL, where\nboth stories happened to share \"october\" and \"premiere\" — neither of\nwhich actually validates that the URL covers the headlined subject.\n\nExtends STOPWORDS with the twelve month names plus season / year /\npremiere / premieres. Legitimate URL/headline pairs still match on\nsubject words (show name, studio, platform); these tokens were noise\neither way.\n\nVerified against the existing 5 GOOD fixtures (all still pass with\n3+ shared subject tokens) plus a new regression case for the exact\n2026-05-23 17:00 mismatch (shared drops from 2 to 0, correctly\nrejected). Sunday 0800 scheduled run is the next data point.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fade63f9aa1fa7c7dbcd07873762ed9a2b96475a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NavyDevilDoc/anime-newsletter/git/trees/fade63f9aa1fa7c7dbcd07873762ed9a2b96475a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NavyDevilDoc/anime-newsletter/git/commits/3f7c5fd0105da031a7ea4f5bbb6f7d7e7cdfa8bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75228?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/following{/other_user}","gists_