arred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NavyDevilDoc/anime-newsletter/commits/5f741f69887a1278e6b0d1dd685d73ca75c762b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T22:12:54Z","email":"someone@example.com","name":"Anime Intel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T22:12:54Z","email":"someone@example.com","name":"Anime Intel"},"message":"docs: observability + dashboard ideas for FUTURE_ENHANCEMENTS\n\nNew \"Observability & data utilization\" section captures the five data\ncapture gaps surfaced by the 2026-05-23 inventory (retry events, prompt\nversion stamp, raw model output behind RAW_DUMP flag, UI edit history,\nsearch-tool query metadata) and a dashboard idea that would consume\nusage.jsonl + drafts + published index + failures.jsonl. Cross-links the\nexisting Tier-2 Usage-report CLI as the cheap precursor.\n\nAll entries follow the doc''s existing \"when to build / trade-offs\"\nshape — nothing scheduled, just parked with clear trigger criteria.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4680d2dee1d6d9b88921601563591dd10e9cc32c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NavyDevilDoc/anime-newsletter/git/trees/4680d2dee1d6d9b88921601563591dd10e9cc32c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NavyDevilDoc/anime-newsletter/git/commits/5f741f69887a1278e6b0d1dd685d73ca75c762b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75228?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/following{/other_user}","gists