tarred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NavyDevilDoc/anime-newsletter/commits/610ddedbf322f295a3b23d7284048d397fc9aab5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T21:18:13Z","email":"someone@example.com","name":"Anime Intel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T21:18:13Z","email":"someone@example.com","name":"Anime Intel"},"message":"Phase K: Reddit copy helper + locale-pinned title formatter\n\nTwo-button cluster in ReviewUI''s publish row: \"Copy Reddit title\" emits\nthe CLAUDE.md-spec title ([Weekly] AnimeIntel Newsletter — Week of <DATE>),\n\"Copy Reddit body\" fetches /api/published/:draftId and copies it\nunchanged. Body source is the published artifact, not the in-memory\nfullMarkdown — keeps Reddit / RSS / /newsletter/:id in lock-step;\nre-publish first if you want UI edits reflected on Reddit. Both buttons\ndisable with tooltip when the draft isn''t yet published.\n\nformatWeekOf gains an optional locale arg (backward-compatible; existing\ncall sites unaffected). Reddit title pins to en-US for deterministic\noutput. Suite now 45 tests with 5 new cases for the title formatter\n(mid-month / end-of-month / year-boundary / em-dash UTF-8 round-trip /\nbody identity invariant).\n\nPROGRESS.md and IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md updated; Phase J marked next.\nReal-Reddit paste smoke test deferred to next posting session.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"56af678c0622fb450e65db815467b7d51237c090","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NavyDevilDoc/anime-newsletter/git/trees/56af678c0622fb450e65db815467b7d51237c090"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NavyDevilDoc/anime-newsletter/git/commits/610ddedbf322f295a3b23d7284048d397fc9aab5","verification":{"payload":null,