ptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NavyDevilDoc/anime-newsletter/commits/5da0cf4da23456c36b18b14e8a313208a1a6eb4b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T11:50:14Z","email":"someone@example.com","name":"Anime Intel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T11:50:14Z","email":"someone@example.com","name":"Anime Intel"},"message":"Initial commit: scaffold + working search agent (in-progress diagnosis)\n\n- React + Vite client (dark Tailwind, 6 sections, edit/regenerate/copy)\n- Express server with /api/generate and /api/regenerate-section\n- Pipeline: search (real, Sonnet 4.6 + web_search_20260209), curate + write stubs\n- Per-run usage tracker writing to usage/usage.jsonl (gitignored)\n- API verifier (pnpm verify-api)\n- PROGRESS.md captures current state, debug spend, and next-step diagnosis plan\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d884a38981a1d787f2fd431155ad60fd2cab4e60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NavyDevilDoc/anime-newsletter/git/trees/d884a38981a1d787f2fd431155ad60fd2cab4e60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NavyDevilDoc/anime-newsletter/git/commits/5da0cf4da23456c36b18b14e8a313208a1a6eb4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75228?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yayhooray","id":75228,"login":"yayhooray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yayhooray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.