login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/mfa-community-parent/commit/8fbed195e4532e79de92d69819fc7b84488183d1","node_id":"C_kwDOSkCe6NoAKDhmYmVkMTk1ZTQ1MzJlNzlkZTkyZDY5ODE5ZmM3Yjg0NDg4MTgzZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/mfa-community-parent/commit/b92978369353eff87ed5774e7bf8b8478d8d5b75","sha":"b92978369353eff87ed5774e7bf8b8478d8d5b75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/mfa-community-parent/commits/b92978369353eff87ed5774e7bf8b8478d8d5b75"}],"sha":"8fbed195e4532e79de92d69819fc7b84488183d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/mfa-community-parent/commits/8fbed195e4532e79de92d69819fc7b84488183d1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/mfa-community-parent/commits/b92978369353eff87ed5774e7bf8b8478d8d5b75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T14:29:46Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T14:29:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(build): pin Node 22.23.2 so the toolchain keeps up with its dependencies (#104)\n\nThe four modules install Node v22.20.0 through frontend-maven-plugin. That is\nnow below the floor some devDependencies require, which surfaced as a dependabot\nPR that could never go green (#80):\n\n  error jsdom@30.0.1: The engine \"node\" is incompatible with this module.\n  Expected version \"^22.22.2 || ^24.15.0 || >=26.0.0\". Got \"22.20.0\"\n\nRaised to v22.23.2, the current 22.x LTS (\"Jod\"), which clears that floor with\nheadroom and stays on the same major. Applied to all four modules together -\nextensions, totp, webauthn and login-ui had already drifted apart on yarnVersion\n(1.22.21 vs 1.22.22), and there is no reason for the Node pin to drift too.\n\nVerified:\n- mvn clean install - BUILD SUCCESS on the new Node, 352 tests, lint and webpack\n  builds all running as before.\n- The blocked case specifically: applying #80''s bump on top of this branch,\n  `yarn install` resolves jsdom 30.0.1 without the engine error and login-ui''s\n  vitest suite passes 41/41. #80 should go green once it rebases onto this.\n\nOnly the Node pin changes; yarnVersion is left alone deliberately, since moving\nit would churn the lockfiles for no reason here.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"fb59dd55f000943ef27f2145f3fe3334e79bf84e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/mfa-community-parent/git/trees/fb59dd55f000943ef27f2145f3fe3334e79bf84e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/mfa-community-parent/git/commits/b92978369353eff87ed5774e7bf8b8478d8d5b75","verification":{"payload":"tree fb59dd55f000943ef27f2145f3fe3334e79bf84e\nparent 361768b4e847965d35f93371f9f54d5a524a8f69\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1786631386 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786631386 +0200\n\nchore(build): pin Node 22.23.2 so the toolchain keeps up with its dependencies (#104)\n\nThe four modules install Node v22.20.0 through frontend-maven-plugin. That is\nnow below the floor some devDependencies require, which surfaced as a dependabot\nPR that could never go green (#80):\n\n  error jsdom@30.0.1: The engine \"node\" is incompatible with this module.\n  Expected version \"^22.22.2 || ^24.15.0 || >=26.0.0\". Got \"22.20.0\"\n\nRaised to v22.23.2, the current 22.x LTS (\"Jod\"), which clears that floor with\nheadroom and stays on the same major. Applied to all four modules together -\nextensions, totp, webauthn and login-ui had already drifted apart on yarnVersion\n(1.22.21 vs 1.22.22), and there is no reason for the Node pin to drift too.\n\nVerified:\n- mvn clean install - BUILD SUCCESS on the new Node, 352 tests, lint and webpack\n  builds all running as before.\n- The blocked case specifically: applying #80''s bump on top of this branch,\n  `yarn install` resolves jsdom 30.0.1 without the engine error and login-ui''s\n  vitest suite passes 41/41. #80 should go green once it rebases onto this.\n\nOnly the Node pin changes; yarnVersion is left alone deliberately, since moving\nit would churn the lockfiles for no reason here.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfdTaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAa6UQAJbOlFabcxQHE0cYaIt8k2Z7\ntIqoBiJYyJ68tjIgW4hlCyJa64uqK0H0w89vU2eRnwEC0/LPjlTTJhGQPB27N+05\nXCUgJcZU3ggD37lyvjTxCaaZjzEuNvf4/93mPw5//jpRjlj4RyY/+BWoizBBSBTb\n6w4yHUsHbWJIWYoxgtJxRzFm2QzWpQ696OaNjZyjvfLJG5nGwT0avndMu9imiyZw\n0Zeq5iox/ggPshNLVYktERPKFxfi9xfvFobS2lEcJTSjo8pM4H4Y