\nDependabot raised 9 PRs bumping deps that are either Jahia-8.2.3-platform-provided\n(scope=provided: graphql-dxm-provider, graphql-java(-annotations), commons-codec,\ncommons-lang3, jackson-databind) or deliberately pinned to Jahia''s Jackson line\n(the embedded jackson datatypes). Their versions must track the Jahia runtime, not\nupstream latest - a higher compile version risks an OSGi Import-Package range the\nruntime cannot satisfy. Ignore them so dependabot manages only the genuinely\nembedded, non-Jahia libraries (e.g. com.yubico:webauthn-server-core, just bumped).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f2f9623510c69c41b7906177d130a15802a1024","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/mfa-community-parent/git/trees/9f2f9623510c69c41b7906177d130a15802a1024"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/mfa-community-parent/git/commits/b854d9e6f54cb074233f94c0aafe66a74ae143e7","verification":{"payload":"tree 9f2f9623510c69c41b7906177d130a15802a1024\nparent 86c4b469fe3ca6620cc9755a0049840882bda5cc\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782560624 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782560624 +0200\n\nchore(dependabot): ignore Jahia-platform-provided and pinned deps (#15)\n\nDependabot raised 9 PRs bumping deps that are either Jahia-8.2.3-platform-provided\n(scope=provided: graphql-dxm-provider, graphql-java(-annotations), commons-codec,\ncommons-lang3, jackson-databind) or deliberately pinned to Jahia''s Jackson line\n(the embedded jackson datatypes). Their versions must track the Jahia runtime, not\nupstream latest - a higher compile version risks an OSGi Import-Package range the\nruntime cannot satisfy. Ignore them so dependabot manages only the genuinely\nembedded, non-Jahia libraries (e.g. com.yubico:webauthn-server-core, just bumped).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqP7dwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUbQQAAt2n1L3E+aP7fV