c7e5de290d50e9711339535407414e071"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/mfa-community-parent/commits/51a3de6dd1dce900cf81467aef2844ae57780a6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T15:46:23Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T15:46:23Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"feat(extensions): server-administration UI for the global MFA configuration\n\nEverything in org.jahia.modules.mfa.extensions.cfg is now editable from Administration ->\nServer -> Configuration -> \"MFA Community\" (server admin permission), instead of hand-editing\nthe Karaf file or calling the provisioning API.\n\nBackend: root GraphQL fields mfaExtensionsConfiguration / mfaExtensionsSaveConfiguration\n(@GraphQLRequiresPermission(\"admin\"), mirroring the proven root-login-notification pattern),\nreading and writing the PID through ConfigurationAdmin - Karaf persists to the cfg file and\nthe consuming components (MfaGlobalPolicy, MfaLoginGateFilter, MfaLoginLogoutProvider)\nhot-reload via @Modified. Unknown keys are preserved. Validation with stable error codes:\nenforced factors must be REGISTERED factor types (a typo would create an unsatisfiable policy\nand lock users out - the list comes from the new MfaFactorDirectory.getRegisteredFactorTypes),\ngraceDays bounded 0..365, whitelist entries must be valid IP literals/CIDR blocks (validated\nthrough the promoted MfaLoginGateFilter.parseWhitelist); the global URLs stay deliberately\nunrestricted (operator-level, external SSO portals are legitimate).\n\nFrontend: the extensions module gains its own webpack/Module-Federation build (clone of the\ntotp setup) shipping a GlobalSettings panel - one enforcement checkbox per installed factor,\ngrace period, /cms/login gate toggle + IP whitelist (with the set-the-whitelist-first warning),\nglobal login/logout URLs - registered at administration-server-configuration:30.\n\nTests: MfaExtensionsConfigSupportTest (validation/serialization rules, 8 tests);\ngraphQL.extensions.adminConfig.cy.ts (round-trip, validation guards, non-admin denied -\ndefaults always restored in after()); ui.admin.extensionsConfig.cy.ts (panel renders, save\npersists across reload, server-side validation surfaces). Live: full suite 14 specs 48/48,\nSonarQube 0 open issues.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"b90d6988f4163548e1c0cd2451641c153d2aab6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/mfa-community-parent/git/trees/b90d6988f4163548e1c0cd2451641c153d2aab6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/mfa-community-parent/git/commits/51a3de6dd1dce900cf81467aef2844ae57780a6a","verification":{"payload":"tree b90d6988f4163548e1c0cd2451641c153d2aab6f\nparent 65fd3fefb16e66a352eb20c3668576ac21ffc075\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780760783 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780760783 +0200\n\nfeat(extensions): server-administration UI for the global MFA configuration\n\nEverything in org.jahia.modules.mfa.extensions.cfg is now editable from Administration ->\nServer -> Configuration -> \"MFA Community\" (server admin permission), instead of hand-editing\nthe Karaf file or calling the provisioning API.\n\nBackend: root GraphQL fields mfaExtensionsConfiguration / mfaExtensionsSaveConfiguration\n(@GraphQLRequiresPermission(\"admin\"), mirroring the proven root-login-notification pattern),\nreading and writing the PID through ConfigurationAdmin - Karaf persists to the cfg file and\nthe consuming components (MfaGlobalPolicy, MfaLoginGateFilter, MfaLoginLogoutProvider)\nhot-reload via @Modified. Unknown keys are preserved. Validation with stable error codes:\nenforced factors must be REGISTERED factor types (a typo would create an unsatisfiable policy\nand lock users out - the list comes from the new MfaFactorDirectory.getRegisteredFactorTypes),\ngraceDays bounded 0..365, whitelist entries must be valid IP literals/CIDR blocks (validated\nthrough the promoted MfaLoginGateFilter.parseWhitelist); the global URLs stay deliberately\nunrestricted (operator-level, external SSO portals are legitimate).\n\nFrontend: the extensions module gains its own webpack/Module-Federation build (clone of the\ntotp setup) shipping a GlobalSettings panel - one enforcement checkbox per installed factor,\ngrace period, /cms/login gate toggle + IP whitelist (with the set-the-whitelist-first warning),\nglobal login/logout URLs - registered at administration-server-configuration:30.\n\nTests: MfaExtensionsConfigSupportTest (validation/serialization rules, 8 tests);\ngraphQL.extensions.adminConfig.cy.ts (round-trip, validation guards, non-admin denied -\ndefaults always restored in after()); ui.admin.extensionsConfig.cy.ts (panel renders, save\npersists across reload, server-side validation surfaces). Live: full suite 14 specs 48/48,\nSonarQube 0 open issues.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"---